<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">- Gedeo Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Langassatikaa Maaafa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Langassatikaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Langassatikaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lan.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Langassatikaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt">E'yichchoo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kunni Langassatik Maxaafi Isir'eeliki ardi heddole gammoojje qiilla giddo me'ineechchi uduma Kanaanika boga genno'aa he'nee'naa Mo'aabike boga'ni Muuse Isira'eelike ardi'a uurisabelo haaso'eeke haaso'a abideeke maxaafan.</para>
  <para style="ip">Konne maxaafi giddo borreesende hexxeexxe la'o affeexxe yaanuwwa giddii'n mitte mitte konneechchi butta hexxeexxen.</para>
  <para style="ip">1. Muuse saxxeexxe shoole tomme wogguwwa giddo muuxendeexxe lumolla yaanuwwa qaabachchiisa'n haaso'e; Mageni gammoojje qiilli boga'ni insa'nee hitta akeekeexxa arda kassi assati, insa'nenna Magenokee xuurameeyete kandaashanna qajeelummati isi'a ajajeemmaashsha insa'ne'n jabeesse kuleen.</para>
  <para style="ip">2. Muusenna Tomme ajajuwwa higgeen lebe qaassisa'n giddii'ninni siretika seera farri asse tike kula'ni, ardi Mageno calla magenoonfataasha jabeessaamman. Tennenni welti abidisati Isira'eeliki ardi ookkone addachchiisa uwwendeemmake boga'ni hitta gale hosaa qico kulaaka gargar gargar hedheeka seeruwwa higgeen barrisee kulaamman.</para>
  <para style="ip">3. Muuse Mageni ardakee aageexxi kako hitta hexxeexxe kaddeexxa tika'n kulati, ardikinna tennee kako'aa afeexxa xuurameesumma haaronsashsha insa'nee qaabbachchiisaamman.</para>
  <para style="ip">4. Iyyaasu Muuse'n aaneexxi Mageniinka arda akeekaashsha hariiremaan. Muusenna Mageniinxa xuurameesumma'aa faaro faarse ke'eechchi udumanna Isira'eelika gosa gosati mine duuchcha eebbiseechchi uduma Yordaanosike galaanii'ni boroti darre'ni hedheeke Mo'aabike boga'ni lummedhe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Maxaafi konne giddo umoke kaddeek yaadi Mageni fi'leekanna eeyya'neeka ifika arda wodeexanna eebbiseexxa kulaaken; ardikinna Mageniinxi eebba insa'nenaa'ni kutendebaangi hedhoti hedhaashshanna Mageni insa'ne'a asseexxa duuchcha qaabbatati duuchchi wodda Mageno eeyyaashshanna isi'aa ajajemaashsha insa'nee qalli assaan.</para>
  <para style="ip">Konne maxaafika umo yaada abideek laakkossuwwi hafuura adhdha 6:4-6 hedheeke kadaa wodda isoonna Yesuusi «Ajaji duuchchinaa'ni sa'aki ajaja» hiyye haaso'emmake hiyyichchuwwa abideekeeran. Kunninna, «Duuchchi Woddika Gootta atika Mageno mitte godobinni, shenitte hedhonni, shenite hunnanni eeyyi» hiyyaaken.</para>
  <para style="iot">Konne Maxaafi Giddo Hexxeexxa Yaanuwwa</para>
  <para style="io1">Siretika Muuseka Haaso'a <char style="ior"><ref loc="DEU 1:1-4:49">1:1—4:49</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Muuseka Langaka Haaso'a <char style="ior"><ref loc="DEU 5:1-26:19">5:1—26:19</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Tomme Ajajuwwa <char style="ior"><ref loc="DEU 5:1-10:22">5:1—10:22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Seeruwwaa, Aaduwwaanna Xexxe'achchoo <char style="ior"><ref loc="DEU 11:1-26:19">11:1—26:19</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kanaanik Bogibaa E'yati Edi Ga'ma Uwwendeexxa Akeete <char style="ior"><ref loc="DEU 27:1-28:68">27:1—28:68</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kakotixxa Haaro'ma <char style="ior"><ref loc="DEU 29:1-30:20">29:1—30:20</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Muuseka Muuxamiinka Haaso'a <char style="ior"><ref loc="DEU 31:1-33:29">31:1—33:29</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Muusexxa Reyo <char style="ior"><ref loc="DEU 34:1-12">34:1-12</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DEU 1" />
  <para style="s1">Isira'eelik Ardi Korebni'n Ke'aashsha Uwwemeeka Aajaja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 1:1" />Yordaanoosii'n boroti darre'n Araba hiyyendaaxxe qiilla gammooje'n Suuphi edi darre Faara'ninna Xoofeeli'n, Laaba'nin, Hatsirotin'ninna Diizahaabixxe oddo'n he'nee'naa Muuse Isira'eelito Duuchcha'n haaso'eek haaso'i konneechchi butta hedheeken. <verse eid="DEU 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 1:2" />Seeyirixxe koobake oribaa'n Koorebii'n Qaades Barne qico'n tommenna mitte barra me'isaan. <verse eid="DEU 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 1:3" />Shoole tomme wogga'n tommenna mitteessoke agenjixxe taakkaxxe barra'n Isira'eelito uuddaaxxin Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ajajeexxa duuchcha Muuse insa'ne'n kule. <verse eid="DEU 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 1:4" />Tinninna kaddeek Haseebon galchammake Amooritotika moyanjo, Sewooniinna Asitaarooti galcha'ammaka Oogika moyanjo Baasaani Edire'i giddo loleexxi injifateechchi uduman. <verse eid="DEU 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 1:5" />Yordaanoosii'n boroti darre'n Mo'aabike boga'n he'nee'naa Muuse konneechchi butta hedheeka seera ardake'n ifise haaso'ate'n ke'e.<verse eid="DEU 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 1:6" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti no'ok Magen, Kooreeb no'o'n hiyyee qici: «Tenne kooba'n qeeraxxa yanna turtine'en. <verse eid="DEU 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 1:7" />Hexxinemmaxxa kaanbe waldineexxi Koobatike Amooritotike bogiba'n me'we; ookkonna Arabixxe koobuwwabba dhidhim darreke tullichchuwwi hunda, Negeebi giddonna isixxe abbaayyuwwake kasa'n hedheeke olla'uwwike ardibaa me'we; iitanni Kenaanitotike bogiba'anna Libaanosi'a, lumoka galaana Efiraaxis qico'n me'we. <verse eid="DEU 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 1:8" />Kunse, konnee boga ha'no'aa uwweenen; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'nooke annuwwa, Abiraami'a Yisaaqi'anna Ya'iqoobi'a, iittanni insa'nee udumanna insa'neexxe horte'a uwwo'a kako aagemaka boga e'yitine dhaalle.»<verse eid="DEU 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akeekisanjuwwiinxa Hariirensha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 18:13-27">Fula. 18:13-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 1:9" />Aninna eettenee yanna insa'ne'e hiyyeennee qici, «Ani calli ha'noo akeeka dande'abo'non. <verse eid="DEU 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 1:10" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti laakkosa ha'nooka leba'een; tennexxee ha'no iimixxe urjuwwashsha birasaxine'een. <verse eid="DEU 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 1:11" />Ta'anna Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'nooke annuwwik Magen lebe lebe'e ha'noo bira sa'isowwaal; uwwemmaxxe addachchiisashanna ha'noo ebbisowwaal! <verse eid="DEU 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 1:12" />Kaddo malee'e ha'nooxxa rakko, moronsha ha'nooxxa duuchcha ani calli qofitti hitta asee dande'ano? <verse eid="DEU 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 1:13" />Beekuma, ege'na afe'eekanna ulfesemaaka manna ha'no mitte mittenge gosa gosatike mininaa'n fille; aninna ha'noo galchinaashsha insa'nee hariiranon.» <verse eid="DEU 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 1:14" />Ha'noonna, «Ati kandaashsha shiqishe'etek yaadi eloken» hitinee ane'n hissitine haasotineen. <verse eid="DEU 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 1:15" />Tennexxee aninna ha'nooke gosa gosatike mini minika sooreesuwwi beekoletanna ulfeessemeeka manna aadhennexxi, kuma ajajalluuwwa, dhibba ajajalluwwa, onde tommenna tomme ajajalluwwa, iittanni gosa gosatike mini mini hadika ja'laabuwwa assati ha'no'o galchinaashsha insa'ne'a baalle uwweennen. <verse eid="DEU 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 1:16" />Eettene yanna'n hayyichchuwwa ha'nooka hiyye ajajenne qici, «Ha'nooke dayyuwwixxe oddo'n kexxaaxxa moronsha ille uushsho belo uudde; ku'lendaaxxi yaane dayyuwwake kade'eke Isira'eelitotixxe oddo'n yookaan mitte Isira'eelixxenna alagi manjiinxe oddo'n kaddoole toggitte murte murre. <verse eid="DEU 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 1:17" />Murtinaa wodda gamisinoqqe'e; shiixxo lumoka mitte illenni uudde; murte Mageeniinxe kaddeemmaxxee hoone manjonna sodaattinoqqe'e. Ha'nooxxe hunna iimi darre kaddeexxa aniba'a iyyedagge, ani uudannon» hiyyennen. <verse eid="DEU 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 1:18" />Eettene yanna'n assa hasissaaxxa yaane duuchcha ha'no'n kulennen.<verse eid="DEU 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dooyaake Mannixxa Ergensha.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 13:1-33">Lak. 13:1-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 1:19" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'nook Magen no'oo ajajemmashshanni Koorebii'n ke'ne'e uuddinemmashshanni eettene qiqqilii kaddeexxenna sodaachchissa'neexxe qiilla gammoojje giddii'n sa'nennexxi Amooritotike bogi darree'n Qaadees Barne dangennen. <verse eid="DEU 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 1:20" />Ani insa'nee hiyyeenne qici: «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti no'ok Magen no'aa uwwa'neeka koobatika Amooritotika boga geltine'een. <verse eid="DEU 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 1:21" />Kunnise, Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ookkone boga ha'no'aa uwwe'een; ta'anna Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'nooke annuwwik Magen ha'no'n kulemmashshann, marre, dhaalle, alaltinoqqe'e, godoba gurtinoqqe'e» hiyyennen.<verse eid="DEU 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 1:22" />Ookkoneechchi uduma, «Ha'noo duuchchiing anibba daggineexxi ane'n, boga ookkone no'aa dooyyaashsha manna edinse ergino; insa'nenna no'o ookko geessisaaka marrennexxi gennannoke qachchuwwixxa odo illee iima hinge'e no'o'n kullaan» hitineen.<verse eid="DEU 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 1:23" />Ookkoneechchi uduma kunni yaadinna eloke labe'e ane'n leelle; aninna mitte mittinge gosatike mininaa'n mitte mitte manjo filleennexxi ha'noonaa'n tommenna lame manna ergennen. <verse eid="DEU 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 1:24" />Insa'nenna ke'neexxi koobatike bogibaa allalle me'ineechchi uduma Eshikoolixxe dhooqa giddo dangeexxi boga ookkonee dooyyine. <verse eid="DEU 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 1:25" />Ookkone bogixxe gummanaa'n no'obaa aa'ne dangeexxi, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti no'ok Magen no'aa uwwa'neek bogi eloken» hineexxi no'o'n kulle.<verse eid="DEU 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'n Jalla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 1:26" />Ha'noo kinni ookkone bogibaa alalle me'a eetineba Duuchchi Woddike Gootta ha'nooke Mageniinke ajaja'n jallitine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:23">Lew. 9:23</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 3:16">Ibr. 3:16</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 1:27" />Ha'nooxxe duunkaane giddo hexxine gungundina'n hitinee qici: «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti no'oo gibe'een; tennexxe Gibtseke boginaa'n no'oo fulcheechchi Amoorito no'o birto'a anga insa'nexxee no'o sa'isse uwwo'aten. <verse eid="DEU 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 1:28" />Habaata me'inanno? Dayyuwwi no'ok, ‹Iikki manni no'o irra jajjabakenna ejjuma qeerrarramma manna, qachchuwwikinna lumollakenna hojja iima geyeeke kinjiinke dalla'uwwiken; iittanni ookkonna Enaaqito uundenen› no'o sodaachchinseen.»<verse eid="DEU 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 1:29" />Tennexxee aninna insa'nee hiyyeenne qici, «Weekendinoqqe'e, insa'neenna sodaatinoqqe'e. <verse eid="DEU 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 1:30" />Ha'noo edo me'aneek Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'nook Mageni konnechchi edo ille ha'nooxxi uuda'naa Gibtse'ni assemmashshanni, ta'anna ha'no'a lolaan. <verse eid="DEU 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 1:31" />Qiilla gammoojje'ni ookkonna anni belto ifika ba'edhammashsha ha'noo Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'nook Mageni konne booncho'n geltinaa qico'n, daggineeke ora duuchcha'n ha'noo hitta ba'edheexxa uudine'een» hiyyenne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:18">Erga. Huj. 13:18</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 1:32" />Yaane kinni ha'noo Duuchchi Woddika gootta ha'nooka Mageno addatinebaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 3:19">Ibr. 3:19</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 1:33" />Me'ate'n hexxine'anaa martine ofoldinaaka boonchuwwa ora me'itinaaka ha'no'n leellishsho'a isi, hashsha giirati, barra duumanchik no'oo akeeka'nemman.<verse eid="DEU 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eel'i Mura Woxiseexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 14:45">Lak. 14:45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 1:34" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna ha'noo hitineexxa laqeexxi mufate; kakatenna hiyyee qici: <verse eid="DEU 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 1:35" />«Ani edike ha'nooke annuwwi'a uwwonna'a kako aagenneka ookkone shamoka boga tenne fuggaaleyye ilanaa'n ayyinna uudabaan. <verse eid="DEU 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 1:36" />Yoofonika belto Kaalebi'i male'e weli ookkonee boga uudaak hedhebaan; isi ookkonee boga uudaan; Duuchchi Woddika Gootta mitte godobinni hordofemmaxxe'e isi mare lekkati hadheeka boga isi'anna isixxe horte'a uwwannon.»<verse eid="DEU 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 1:37" />Ha'nooxxe buuton Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ane'n mufte'e hiyyee qici: «Koo Muuse, atetenna kaddotole midde ookkonee boga'ni e'yitabexxon. <verse eid="DEU 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 1:38" />Yaane kinni atik gargaarsaji Neweki belti Iyyaasu ookkoonee boga e'yaan; boga ookkonee dhallaashsha Isira'eeli akekaak isote kadeemmaxxe'e iso'o jajjabeessi. <verse eid="DEU 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 1:39" />Boji'endaan hitinemmaxxi, eloyo'oxxa egendebaaxxi ha'nooxxi shiixxaramma oose ookkonee boga'n aggaan; aninna insa'ne'a uwwe'naa boga ookone dhaallaan. <verse eid="DEU 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 1:40" />Ha'no kinni udumi'a wirri hitine Eritiriinxe Abbaayyika ora higge.»<verse eid="DEU 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 1:41" />«Ha'noo koo Muuse, no'o Duuchchi Woddika Gootta balleesineenen; ta'a kinn Duuchchi Woddik Goottii no'ok Mageni no'o ajajemmashanni lollanon; hitine hiisitineen; ookkone kooba callika boga dhaala ha'no'aa shollaxxe labbe'en; isexxe qophpheefatte» hiyye. <verse eid="DEU 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 1:42" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ane'n hiyyee qici, «Ani ha'noonni welti hedha gophaannaxxe'e ‹Alalle fuldine loldinoqqe'e; ha'nook naaph ha'noo injifataan hite insa'nee kuli› » hiyye. <verse eid="DEU 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 1:43" />Aninna ha'noo'n kulene; ha'no kinni caqassinebaan; Duuchchi Woddike Goottike ajaja'n jallitineexxi ifisaadiyyoti koobatike bogibaa duuldine. <verse eid="DEU 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 1:44" />Ookkone tullichcuwwa'n hana hedhemmak Amoorak manni ha'noo lolo'a dageexxi; kinniisiinke sannachchishsha ha'noo shorre. Seeyiri'n ke'nenexxi Horimaani qico'n ha'no'o shorre lole. <verse eid="DEU 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 1:45" />Ha'noonna illee iima higgine dagineexxi, Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo ooxine; yaane kinni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti oodhishsha ha'nooxxa laqebaan; caqasatanna gibeen. <verse eid="DEU 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 1:46" />Tennexxee eeteneqicixxa yanna tola sa'issati Qaadeesi giddo heddo barra turrennen.<verse eid="DEU 1:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DEU 2" />
  <para style="s1">Qiilla Gammoojje Giddo Gadaado'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 2:1" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anee ajajemmashshanni illee iima hingeen; Eritiriinxe Abbaayyaka ora qiilla gammoojjebaa me'inneen; Seeyirixxe koobatike bogika qarqara qeerraxxa yanna gadaadonneen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:4">Lak. 21:4</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 2:2" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ane'ni hiyyee qici: <verse eid="DEU 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 2:3" />«Konne koobatike bogike qarqara'n gadaadoottineen; ta'a kinni middi'a higge. <verse eid="DEU 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 2:4" />Ardakanna konneechchinni butti'a hedheeka ajajuwwa ajaji; Seeyirike boga'n hedha'neeka ha'nooka dayyuwwa ‹Eesawwuxxe horteke bogi giddii'n saxxine me'itino'aten; insa'nenna ha'noo sodaantaan; kaddoolenna ha'noo jabaxxa xexxe'achcho asse.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 36:8">Dada. 36:8</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 2:5" />Seeyirixxi kooba Eesuwu'a geego asse uwweenaxxe'e ani boga insa'nekenaa'ni lekka ha'nooxxenni haxxinaaxxe bakka qicika boga ha'no'a uwwa gonphammaxxee insa'ne'a lolakee tirtistinoqe'e. <verse eid="DEU 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 2:6" />Ookko ittinaaxxe itanna kadi ha'witinaake wode'e birretike sibljin insa'nee'ni hidhdhitinaan.› » <verse eid="DEU 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 2:7" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ha'nooki Mageni huccitineexxe ha'noo eebbise'een; tennee qiqilli hiteexxe qiilla gammoojje giddo me'itinee wodda ha'noo heqqeen; tennee shoole tomme wogga Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'noonn welti hedhemmaxxee mittichchinna ha'no'aa xe'yeemmabaan.<verse eid="DEU 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 2:8" />Tennexxee Seeyir hedhaammaka dayyuwwa no'oke Eesawuxxe horteka Edoomika boga sa'ne me'inene; Eelaatinaa'ninna Etsiyoonigabbirii'n dagemmaka Araabike gammoojje orika Mo'aabi'a me'inenne. <verse eid="DEU 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 2:9" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ane'n hiyyee qici: «Mo'aabitotike boginaa'n hoonee boganna ha'no'aa uwwa gophaannaxxe insa'nee rakkissinoqqe'e. Lolakeenna insa'ee tirtirsitinoqqe'e; Eerii'i Looxixxe horte'a qadaadake kado'a uwweennen.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:37">Dada. 19:37</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 2:10" />Ookko, jajjabbi laakkoossik bira sa'eek, Enaaqitotishshanna ejjumma qeerrarrammi Eemiimik manni hedha'eemman. <verse eid="DEU 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 2:11" />Insa'nenna Enaaqitotishshanni Raafayitote hiyyemma'nee ege'nemme'emman; yaane kinni Mo'aabito insa'neeka summa Eemito hine'e ye'na'emman. <verse eid="DEU 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 2:12" />Hoorito edi wodda Seeyiri'i ha'na'emman; Eesawuxxi horte kinni ookkoo'n insa'nee shorrite fulchite; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti qadaadake kado'a uwweemmake boga'n Isira'eeli assitammashshanni insa'nenna Hoorito shorrineexxi boga insa'neke'n ookko offole.<verse eid="DEU 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 2:13" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti no'oo, «Ta'anni kexxine'e Zaareddika galaana fooffe» hiyye; no'onna Zerdixxa oyyo foonfenne. <verse eid="DEU 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 2:14" />Qaadeesi Berne'e waalle fullenexxe yannanaa'n Zaareddika galaana foonfanno qico'n sase tommenna saddeeta wogga mudde. Eettenee yanna lolakee geyeek eettene ilak labballi duuchchi, Duuchchi Woddik Gootti insa'ne'n ediseexxi kakatemmashshanni kaanbe giddii'n munde. <verse eid="DEU 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 2:15" />Kutti asse'e kanbe giddii'n insa'enee bira qico'n Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi anga insa'nenaa'n illee iima higgeemmabaan.<verse eid="DEU 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 2:16" />Ardi giddo hedhaammak loliink manni duuchchi reyeechchi uduma, <verse eid="DEU 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 2:17" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anee hiyyee qici, <verse eid="DEU 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 2:18" />«Mo'aabike bogixxa gabala Eeri qachchi giddii'n saxxine me'itinaan. <verse eid="DEU 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 2:19" />Rakkissinoqqe'e; lolakeenna insa'nee tirtirsitinoqqe'e; ookkone boga Looxixxe horte'a qadaadake kado'a uwweennen.»<verse eid="DEU 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 2:20" />Tinni kabanna ookko hexxemmaxxe Raafayitotike boga hiyyeme ege'nemme'eman; yaane kinni Amoonito insa'neka summa Zemzumito hinee ye'na'emman. <verse eid="DEU 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 2:21" />Zemizumito jajjabba, laakkoossik birasa'neekenna Enaaqitotishshanni ejjuma qeerrarrammakeman; Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Amoonito bire; Insa'nenna Amonito shorineexxi eettene insa'nexxe bakka'n ofolle. <verse eid="DEU 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 2:22" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Eesawuxxe horte edii'n Hoorito bire wodda Seeyiri giddo hexxeemmaxxe isixxe horte'a assema qicishsha insa'ne Hoorito shorrine fulchineemmake boga'n techchi qico'n offollaashsha asse'een. <verse eid="DEU 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 2:23" />Gaaza qico'n hedheeke olla'uwwi giddo hexxaammaxxa Eewito uuddaxxenni: Keftoori'n fulde daggeexxa Keftoorito Eewito birteexxi insa'neeke boga'n offolde.<verse eid="DEU 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Haseeboonka Moyanjo Seewoonixxa Injifatensha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 2:24" />«Ta'anni kexxineexxi Arinoonixxa oyyo fooffe; Amoorichcho Haseebonika moyanjo Sewooniinna boga isika ha'nooxxe anga'n sa'isse uwweennen; isika boganna dhaalate'n ke'we; isoonna lolle. <verse eid="DEU 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 2:25" />Iimati buttaa hedheeke gosa gosake arda duuchcha'n ha'nooxxi alalshanna sodaachchisa galdaashsha assiyyo tenne telchixxe barra'n safano; insa'nenna odo ha'nooxxa lanqeexxi sodante chulphinssan.»<verse eid="DEU 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moyanjo Sewoonii Isira'eelik Manni Injifateexa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 21:21-30">Lak. 21:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 2:26" />Qideemootixxe qiilla gammoojjenaa'n Haseebonke moyanjo Sewooni'n nage'a geessisaashsha erganjuwwa hiyye ergee qici, <verse eid="DEU 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 2:27" />«Atike bogi giddii'n sa'na'nnoshsha eeti no'aa uwwi; oragenaa'n middi bita'i'a gorraabe'non. <verse eid="DEU 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 2:28" />Indannoxxa itanna ha'winannoka wode'e birretike sibljinni hidhdhinannon. Lekka callinni sa'nonna'a eeti no'aa uwwi. <verse eid="DEU 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 2:29" />Seeyiri giddo hexxaammaxxi Eesawuxxi hortenna Eeri giddo hexxaammaxxi Mo'aabito no'aa assinemmashshanni atinna Duuchchi Woddik Gootti no'ok Mageni no'aa uwwa'neeke boga'n e'yatee Yordaanoosika galaana foofinaa qico'n eetii no'aa uwwi.»<verse eid="DEU 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 2:30" />Yaane kinni Haseeboniki moyanji Sewooni eetii uwwebaan; tinni kaddeechchi Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'nook Mageni ta'a assemmashshann iso'o sa'isse ha'nooxxe anga'n uwwo'a haseemmaxxe godoba isika jabeesseexxi ifinna dukaashsha asse'eman. <verse eid="DEU 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 2:31" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anee, «Kunse Sewooninna boga isika ha'no'n sa'isse uwwo'a ke'een; ta'anna isoo injifattineexxi boga isika dhaaldino'a ke'we.»<verse eid="DEU 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 2:32" />Sewooninna isik loliink manni duuchchi Yahaatsike lollo'a fullee wodda, <verse eid="DEU 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 2:33" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti no'ok Mageni isoo anga no'oxxe'n sa'isse uwwe; no'onna isoo isixxa labbaxxa oosenna isika loliinka manna duuchcha mittenba birrenne. <verse eid="DEU 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 2:34" />Eettene yanna qachchuwwa isika duuchcha adhdhinennexxi giddo hedhaammaka labballo mellaalle oose insa'neexxenninni mitteba birrenne; mittekanna gatinsebe'no. <verse eid="DEU 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 2:35" />Hore insa'neekanna qachchuwwa insa'nekenaa'n aa'nennexxa booji'o kinni ifi'a adhdhinennen. <verse eid="DEU 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 2:36" />Arinoonixxe dhooqake kasa'n hedheeka Aro'eelika qachchanna dhooqa giddike qachchanaa'n Gele'adi qico'n hedheeke qachchuwwinaa'n mittikinna midde no'oo dande'e hoyyeba'a; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti no'ok Mageni duuchchiinga no'o'n sa'isse uwwe. <verse eid="DEU 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 2:37" />Kaddo malee'e Duuchchi Woddik Gootti no'ok Magen no'oo ajajemmashsha Amoonitotike hoone bogibaa yookaan Yaaboqi galaan ya'ammabaa hedheeke boga'n yookaan tullichuwwake'n hedheeka qachchuwwa dootine me'itinebaan.<verse eid="DEU 2:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DEU 3" />
  <para style="s1">Baasanika Moyanjo Oogixxa Injifatensha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 21:31-35">Lak. 21:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 3:1" />Ookkoneechchi uduma illee iima hinge'e alalle Baasaanika ora abixxine me'inenne; Baasaak moyanji Ooginna ifike sannachchuwwi welti Edire'i hiyyemaake booncho'n no'oo lolatee ke'e. <verse eid="DEU 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 3:2" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anee, «Isoo, boga isikanna sannaachcha isika duuchcha anga atixxe'ni sa'isse uwwe'ennaxxee isoo sodaattoxxe'e. Haseeboni hedheexxi galchaammaka Amooritotika moyanjo Sewooni'ni assitettaxxa iso'ninna assi.»<verse eid="DEU 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 3:3" />Tennexxe Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti no'ok Mageni Baasaanika moyanjo Ooginna isika sannaachcha duuchcha anga no'oxxe'ni sa'isse uwwe; no'onna mitte midde gatinsebe'nongi insa'ne'e birrenne. <verse eid="DEU 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 3:4" />Eettene yanna qachchuwa isika duuchcha abindenne; Oogixxa galcha, Baasaani giddo Argobixxe galcha'ni duuchca'n hedheeke jaane tomme qachchuwwinaa'n no'o abindebe'noki gateek mitti qachchinna hedhemabaan. <verse eid="DEU 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 3:5" />Kunni qachchuwwi duuchchi qeerrarramma kinjiinke dalla'uwwike cufanuwwikenna danqarisanjuwwik giissemeemmakemman; Iittanni dalla'i belok heddi olla'uwwinna hedhemman. <verse eid="DEU 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 3:6" />Mitte mittenge qachcha'n hedhemmaka labba meyyaka, oose insa'neexxanna mitteba kutti assati Haseebonke moyanjo'ni Sewooni'ni assinenneshsha konneeranna bakka insa'ne'e balleessinenne. <verse eid="DEU 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 3:7" />Hore duuchchanna qachchuwwakenaa'n boojineechcho duuchcha kinni ifi ifi'aa adhdhinnenne.<verse eid="DEU 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 3:8" />Eettene yanna'ni kunni lamiing Amooritotike moyanjuwwi Yordaanoosinaa'n boroti darre'ni hedheeka, Arinoonik galaanana'ni Herimoonxxe kooba qico'n hedheeka boga duuchcha abixinennen. <verse eid="DEU 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 3:9" />Sidoonito Harmoonni'eemi'i Siiriyooni hite yexxa wodda Amoorito kinni Saaneer hinaan. <verse eid="DEU 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 3:10" />Suubbichcha boga'n hedheeka qachchuwwa duuchcha, Gele'adika boga duuchcha, Salkaani qico'ninna Edire'i qico'n hexxeexxa Baasaan duuchcha, iittanni Baasaani giddo afemaaka Oogixxe galchaka qachchuwwa anga iblsinenne. <verse eid="DEU 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 3:11" />Raafayitotenaa'n hafi gate'eemmak Baasaanike moyanjo Oogi callaman. Isixxi taqenna sibljik giissedeexxe, ejjuma sallane ciqile, ba'linni kinni shoole ciqilemman. Isenna techchi qico'n Reebaat hiyyemaake Amoonitotike qachcha'n afendaan.<verse eid="DEU 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isira'eelitotixxa Boga Qodensha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 32:1-42">Lak. 32:1-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 3:12" />Eetennee yanna abixinenneke boganaa'ni Arinoonixxe dhooqa bira hedheeke Aro'eerii'ni ke'isse middi darre'ni hedheeka boga, higgeen lebeexi tullichiinka Gele'adika boga gamisa qachchuwwi insa'neenginninni welti Roobelitotenna Gaadike gosake mini hadi'a uwwenen. <verse eid="DEU 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 3:13" />Gateemmaka Gele'adika boganna Oogixxe galcha giddo hedhaaka Baasaanika boga duuchcha Minaasexxe horteka gamisa uwwennen. Baasani hedheeka Argobbixxi kuta duuucha Raafayitotike boga hiyyeme ege'nemeekeman. <verse eid="DEU 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 3:14" />Minaasexxe horte kadeeki Iyya'iiri, Geshuure qico'ninna Ma'ikatitotixxe gabala qico'ni hedheeka Argobika boga duuchcha adhdhe; iikki boginna isike summinni ye'eeme; tennenaa'ni kexxaaxxa Baasaani techchi qico'ni Haabooti Iyya'eerite hiyyenda'neen. <verse eid="DEU 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 3:15" />Gele'adi'ninna Maakiiri'aa uwwenen. <verse eid="DEU 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 3:16" />Yaane kinni dhooqatika gamisa gabalate assati Gele'adii'ni Arnoonixxe dhooqa qico'ni, ookko'ninna Amoonitottixxe gabala kadeeke Yaaboqike galaani qico'ni hedheeka galchatika boga Roobelitoteenna Gaadike gosak mini hadi'a uwweennen. <verse eid="DEU 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 3:17" />Dhidhimi darreke bogixxi gabala, Arabi afema'neek Yordaanoosi kadaa wodda, tinninna Feesikaxxe koobbuwwa hunda Kineeretinaa'n maxinetixxe abbaayya hiyyenda'neexxe Arabixxe abbaayya qico'niten.<verse eid="DEU 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 3:18" />Eettene yanna'ni ani hiyye insa'nee ajajene qici «Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti no'oki Magen konne boga qadaada asse'e ha'no'aa uwween; kaddo malee'e hunna afeek ha'nook manni duuchchi lolakee qophpheeffante ha'nooke dayyuwwi Isira'eel edo fule foofa hasissaan. <verse eid="DEU 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 3:19" />Kaddoolna are ha'nooxxinna oose ha'nooxxi heddo hore affineexxa ege'neennaxxee hori ha'nookinna ha'no'aa uwwennake qachchuwwi giddo hedhowwaal; <verse eid="DEU 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 3:20" />tinninna Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti kaba ha'no'aa assemmashshanni dayyuwa ha'nookanna hafuura adhdhiso'aanna Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ha'nooki Mageni Yordaanoosi widii'ni insa'ne'aa uwwa'neeka boga insa'nenna iittanni dhaalla qico'niteni. Ookkoneechchi uduma ha'no mitti mittingi ha'no'aa uwwenneeke qadaadibaa higginaani.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:12-15">Iya. 1:12-15</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muuse Yordaanoosika Galaana Foofabaashsha Hoyyemeexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 3:21" />Ookkonne wodda Iyyaasuu'u hiyyee ajajenne qici, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'nooki Mageni konne lame moyanjuwwa'ni asseexxa duuchcha ille atixxinni uuddeeteni; ta'anna saxxe me'itaatteke moyanjuwwa duuchcha'ni Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti tenneenni lebe assaani. <verse eid="DEU 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 3:22" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ha'nook Mageni ha'no'aa lolaammaxxe insa'nee sodaattinoqqe'e.»<verse eid="DEU 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 3:23" />Eettene yanna hiyyeennexxi Duuchchi Woddika Gootta soodateenna qici, <verse eid="DEU 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 3:24" />«Dada duuchchike Duuchchi Woddike Goottaa! Atika lumminnenna atixxa jabaxxa hirre anee garbichcha atike'n leellisha saffeeten; iimate'ninna buttate'n ati assitatoxxa yaane assa dande'aak magen ayyeete? <verse eid="DEU 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 3:25" />Duuchchi Woddike anike Goottaa! Yordaanoosi widi darre hedheeka ookkonee shaqqaka boganna eloxxa Libaanosixxa kooba uudonnaa ani'a eeti uwwi» <verse eid="DEU 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 3:26" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti kinni ha'nooxe buuttonni ane'ni mufatemmaxxee anika hiyyichcho laqebaani; Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anee hiyyee qici, «Gelte'eni yoona» konneechchi uduma «tenne yaanexxee ane'n haasottoxxe'e. <verse eid="DEU 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 3:27" />Kexxe Feesigaxxe kooba hana qabat dhidhimi darre'ni middi darre'ni bita'i darre'ninna boroti darre'ni uudi. Ati Yordaanoosi'i foofa gophphaattaxxee ookkonee boga iile callinni uudi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:12-14">Lak. 27:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:48-52">Lan. 32:48-52</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 3:28" />Yaane kinni arda akeekeexxi ookkone boga'ni e'ye dhaallaashsha assaaka Iyyaasu ergite tirittirisita'n, jajjabeesi.» <verse eid="DEU 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 3:29" />Tennenaa'ni kexxexxa Beetipe'ori qarqara hexxeexxe dhooqa giddo turrennen.<verse eid="DEU 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4" />
  <para style="s1">Muusse Isira'eelito Ajajendaashsha Xexxe'achchiiseexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 4:1" />Ta'anna koo Isira'eelike arda hedhoti hexxinaashsha ha'noke annuwwiki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Mageni ha'no'aa uwwaake boga'ni e'yitinaashshanna Dhaldinaashsha ha'noo ani barachchiisaanneka seeruwwanna aada laqqine heqqeedhdhe. <verse eid="DEU 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 4:2" />Ani ha'noo ajajenneke ajaja'ni lebbinoqqe'e; isinaa'ninna xe'yishshinoqqe'e; yaane kinni ha'no'aa uwwaanneka Duuchchi Woddike Gootta ha'nooke Magenoka ajajuwwa heqqedhdhe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:18-19">Wal. 22:18-19</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 4:3" />Peeritsoorixxe kooba'ni Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti asseexxa duuchcha ha'no uudine'een; tinninna tenne kooba'ni Ba'aalte hine he'na'neexxa misile magenoonfataaka duuchcha isi olete asse'een.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:1-9">Lak. 25:1-9</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 4:4" />Duuchchi Woddika Gootta Mageno ha'nooka hordoffineek ha'no duuchchiing kinni kunni techchi qico'ni hedhoti hexxineeni. <verse eid="DEU 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 4:5" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anki Mageni ha'noo'n kulonna'a anee ajajeemmaka seeranna aada duuchcha ha'no'n barachchiise'eennen; ookkone dhaaldino'a e'yitina'neeke boga'n hexxinaa wodda konne ajajuwwa ajajemme. <verse eid="DEU 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 4:6" />Konne seeruwwa uuddaaxinni laqeek, «Dhugaandinni kunni lumok ard beekakenna qalbeeffachchotiken» hiyya'neeke gosa gosake arda'n tinni ha'nooxxi xexxe'achchonna ha'nook beekumi ha'nooxxa qalbeefachcho leellishshaammaxxee konnee seeruwwanna tennee aaduwwa xexxe'achchoti heqedhdhe. <verse eid="DEU 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 4:7" />No'o isoo soodantanno wodda duuchcha Duuchchi Woddik Gootti no'ok Magen no'aa shiqaashsha, hoone gosake lumoke arda isik magenuwwi isi'a shiqaak? <verse eid="DEU 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 4:8" />Techcho ani ha'noo edo uggeenekee seerishsha hexxeexxa, qullte kaddeexxa aadanna seera afeek weli lumok gosatik ardi hoontesi? <verse eid="DEU 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 4:9" />Ille ha'nooxxinni uudineexxa yaanuwwa deetinoqqe'e; iittanni hedhoti hexxineeke barro'n tinni yaanuwwa godoba ha'nookenaa'n baxxabaashsha calla heqqedhdhe; ifinna xonxoommatte; tennee yaanuwwa ha'nooxxe oose'ninna ha'nooxxe oosexxe oose'n barachchiisse. <verse eid="DEU 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 4:10" />«Insa'nenna ookkone boga'ni he'naa wodda duuchcha anee ulfeessa barantaashsha oose ifixxe'ninna barachchiinssaashsha hiyyichcho anika laqo'a arda ani edo bukki assi» anee hiyyee wodda Koorebi Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ha'nook Mageni edo uurritineemmaxxa barra qalli hiyye. <verse eid="DEU 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 4:11" />Kooba dimma dukkananna raachcho'eeki duummanchinni buqqemee'na'a bubenikinna iima geyaa qico'n gubattaamma wodda dagineexxi koobati hunda uurritine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:16-18">Fula. 19:16-18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:18-19">Ibr. 12:18-19</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 4:12" />Ookkenee wodda Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti giirati giddo ha'no'n haaso'e; ha'noonna isika haaso'iinka hafuura laqqinee malee'e bifa uuddinebaan. <verse eid="DEU 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 4:13" />Isi eettene ifixxa kako tinninna hordoffino'a ha'noo ajajeemmaka ookkonee tomme ajajuwwa ha'no'n kule; isoonna lame bocendeexxe kino hananna borreesse.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 31:18">Fula. 31:18</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:28">34:28</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 9:10">Lew. 9:10</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 4:14" />Yordaanosii'i fooffineexxi dhaalidinaa bogi giddo hordofinaaxxa aadanna seera ha'non barachchiisonnaa ookkonee wodda Duuchchi Woddik Gootti anee ajaje.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:1">Fula. 21:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fakke Miseechchixxa Magenoonfachcho Hoyyendeexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15" />Siinaxxe kooba hana Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti giira giddo ha'noo'n haaso'eexxa barra mitte bifanna haranga affineemmabaan; tennexxee ha'no umo ifika heqqedhdhe. <verse eid="DEU 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 4:16" />Tennexxee labbakixxe yookaan meyyaxxixxe bifaxxa fakke giissexxine battoottinabaashsha heqqedhe'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:4">Fula. 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 26:1">Fula. 26:1</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 5:8">Lew. 5:8</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 27:15">27:15</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 4:17" />Yookaan Buttate'n hedheeke hoone hori biniinchixxa iittan heene keelik phirri hitaaxxe ci'axxa fakke, <verse eid="DEU 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 4:18" />Yookaan hoone godobik me'aachuwwixxa fakke, wode'i giddo hexxaaxxe heene qulxu'muwwa fakkee giissexinoqqe'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:23">Rom. 1:23</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:19" />Iimi'aa qokki hite'e arishsho, bagenjokanna urjuwwa, iittanni iimattixxa daduwwa duuchcha uudato wodda sobende konnechchuwwa magenoonfataboxxoshsha, Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni iimati butti'a hedheeke gosa gosake ardi duuchchi'a qoobbo asseexxi uwweemmaxxa yaane duuchchanna magenoonfattaboxxoshsha heqqedhi. <verse eid="DEU 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 4:20" />Ha'noo kinni iitta telcho hexxineeshsha qadaada isike kaddino'a Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'nook Mageni ha'noo sibilo baqinsammaxxe boosumma fakkaataak Gibtseke boginaa'n fulcheexxi iyyedage.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5">Fula. 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:6">Lew. 7:6</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 14:2">14:2</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:18">26:18</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tit. 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1 Phex. 2:9</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 4:21" />Ha'nooxxe buutonni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ane'n aareemmaxxee Yordaanoosi foofabe'noshshanna Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'nook Mageni ha'no'aa qadaadake asse uwwaake ookkone eloke boga'n e'yabe'noshsha afo'o sa'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 20:12">20:12</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 4:22" />Tennexxee ani Yordaanoosi'i foofabe'no; ha'no kinni fooffineexxi ookkonee eloka boga dhaaldino'aaten. <verse eid="DEU 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 4:23" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ha'nook Mageni ha'no'aa aageexxa kako deetinoqqe'e heqqedhdhe; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'nook Mageni ha'noo hoyyeemmaxxa hoonchixxa fakke ifi'a giissexxinoqqe'e. <verse eid="DEU 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 4:24" />Duuchchi woddik Gootti ha'nook Mageni ittaaxxe giiran; hinaattichcha Magenon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:29">Ibr. 12:29</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 4:25" />Oose i'litinee oosetixxa oose uudineexxi ookkone boga'n qeerraxxa wogga ofoldinaaxxa yanna Duuchchi Woddike Gootta ha'nooke Mageni edo fuggoxxe kaddeexxa heene bifaxxa fakke giissedhati ifi battossitineexxi Mageno mufachchiissinoqqe'e. <verse eid="DEU 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 4:26" />Tennee assitinoole Yordaanoosii'i fooffineexxi dhaaldinaake boganaa'n iikki woddi baxxinaaxxa telchixxa barra ha'noo'n iimatanna butta dhugaa abixxeennen; ookkone booncho'n qeeraka baro hexxinabaan; muda ha'nooxxi dhugaaten. <verse eid="DEU 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 4:27" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti gosa gosake ardi giddo ha'noo xeeraan. Duuchchi woddiki Gooti ha'noo xeeraake gosa gosake arduwwi giddo ha'noo'n lubbo galaak hee'noke manna callan. <verse eid="DEU 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 4:28" />Ookkonna afabaake yookaan laqabaake yookaan itabaake yookaan ulatabaake manjixxi anga giissiteeka haqichchiinkanna kinjiinka magenuwwa magenoonfattinaan. <verse eid="DEU 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 4:29" />Yaane kinni ookko hexxineenbaa'n Duuchchi woddika Gootta ha'nooka Mageno mitte godobinninna wo'ma hedhonni halsitinoole isoo alfitinaan. <verse eid="DEU 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 4:30" />Wixxirri hine'naa tinni yaane duuchcha ha'no'n geltaa wodda eettenee yanna udumike baro'n Duuchchi woddike Gootta ha'nooke Magenibaa ille iima higgineexxi isi'a ajajendinaan. <verse eid="DEU 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 4:31" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'nook Mageni uwwaake Mageno kadeemmaxxee ha'no waalabaan yookaan balleessabaa yookaan annuwwa ha'nookee kakateexxi kokkeesseemmaxxa kako dedhabaan.<verse eid="DEU 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 4:32" />Mageni manjo buttate'n dadeexxe barranaa'n ha'noo hexxinemmabaa edi darre hedhemmake edike barixxe qorre; iimatike mitte darreke kasinaa'n wele darreke kasi qico'n qorre; iitta hexxeexxi lumoxxi yaane kadde yookaan laqende egendeesi? <verse eid="DEU 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 4:33" />Giirati giddo ha'noo Mageniinka haaso'a laqinemmashsha wel ardi laqeexxi lubbo galaasi? <verse eid="DEU 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 4:34" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ha'nook Mageni ille ha'nooxxinni uuddinaa ha'noo'n Gibtse assemmashsha hega uushshoti, mambe'anna masso yaanuwwa assati, bagedik, isixxe hunnaameette anganninna jabaxxe isixxe hirrenni, yookaan lumoxxa bara bara assitaaxxa yaane assati wele gosake ardi giddii'n mitte gosaka arda ifike assedhe adhdheek weli mageni hedheesi?<verse eid="DEU 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 4:35" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti is Magenoke kadeexxa isi gadhi darre weli mageni hedhebaaxxa egendino'a tennee yaanuwwa egendino'a assende.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 12:32">Mar. 12:32</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 4:36" />Ha'noo barachchiiso'a iimatenaa'n haaso'a ifka laqqinaashsha asse; buttate'ninna sodaachchissaaxxa ifixxa giira uuddinaashsha asse; giira giddi'ninna haaso'a isika laqqine. <verse eid="DEU 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 4:37" />Ha'nooka annuwwa eeyeemmaxxee, insa'ne uduma horte insa'neexxa ha'noo fi'leemmaxxe'e ifixxe jabaxxe hunnanni Gibtsee'n ha'noo fulcheen. <verse eid="DEU 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 4:38" />Telcho bogi ha'nooke kadeemmashsha ha'noo caala lumollammanna jajjabba gosa gosaka arda ha'no edii'n fulchiyyoti ha'noo insa'neeke boga'n e'yisheexxi qadaada ha'no'aa uwwo'aaten.<verse eid="DEU 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 4:39" />Yoonaa iimate'n buttate'n Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Magenoke kadeexxa telcho ege'ne; godobanna galchedhdhe isoo malee weli Mageni hedhebaan. <verse eid="DEU 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 4:40" />Ha'no'aanna ha'noo uduma ha'nooxxe oose'a eloxxi kaddaashsha Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'nook Mageni ha'no'aa duuchchi woddi'a uwwaake boga'n wogga ha'noxxi qeerrexxaashsha telcho ani ha'no'o ajajaanneka isika seeranna aada heqqedhdhe.<verse eid="DEU 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gollatatika Qachchuwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 4:41" />Eettenee yanna Muuse Yordaanoosii'ni boroti darre'n hedheeka sase qachchuwwa foyye. <verse eid="DEU 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 4:42" />Tennee asseechchinna edi wodda naaphake kadeebaaka manjo danoti shiyeek manji konne qachchuwwi giddi'n mittinbaa baajeexxi lubbo gataashshaten. <verse eid="DEU 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 4:43" />Kunni qachchuwwinna; Roobelke gosatike mini'a qiilla gammooje giddo goorote'n hedheeka Beetsoorka qachcha, Gele'aditotike gosatike mini'a Gele'adi giddo hedheeka Raamotika qachcha, Minaaseke gosatike mini'a Baasaani giddo hedheeka Golaanike qachchinaa'ni gargar hinigaasha asseen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 20:8-9">Iya. 20:8-9</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mageniink Seeri Ifisemeexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 4:44" />Kunni Isira'eelitote'n Muuse kuleek seeruwwi konnee butti'a hedheeken; <verse eid="DEU 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 4:45" />Kuninna Gibtsee'n fullee wodda Muuse Isira'eelitotee uwweemmaxxi akeette, aaduwwanna seeruwwi konneeraman; <verse eid="DEU 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 4:46" />kunninna insa'ne Gibtsee'n fullee wodda Muusenna Isira'eelito injifateemmake Haseeboni hedhaammake Amooritotika moyanjo Sewoonike bogi giddo Yordaanoosinaa'n borot darre'n Beetipe'ori bira hexxeexxe dhooqa giddo he'nemma woddan. <verse eid="DEU 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 4:47" />Insa'nenna Yordaanoosi'ni boroti darre'n hedheeka isika boganna Baasaanika moyanjo Oogika, lamiinge Amooritotike moyanjuwwika boga adhdhine qadaada ifike asse'ne. <verse eid="DEU 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 4:48" />Kunni bogi Aroonixxe dhooqake kasa'ni hedheeke Aro'eerike qachchinaa'n Seewoonixxe kooba qico'n, kunninna Harmooni'eemike galaani qico'n geyaake kada wodda <verse eid="DEU 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 4:49" />Yordaanoosii'n boroti darre'ni hedheeka Araba duuchchanna Feesikixxe koobuwwa butti darre hexxeexxa Arabaxxa abbaayya mittenba abideeken.<verse eid="DEU 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DEU 5" />
  <para style="s1">Tomme Ajajuwwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 20:1-17">Fula. 20:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 5:1" />Muusenna Isira'eelika arda duuchcha ye'eexi koo Isira'eelke arda, telcho kulaanneka seeranna aada duuchcha caqasse; isoonna baratte; xonxoommachchotinna heqqedhdhe. <verse eid="DEU 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 5:2" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti no'ok Mageni Koorebii'n no'a kako aageedheen. <verse eid="DEU 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 5:3" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti kako aage'eek annuwwi no'okinnitekaddebaak telcho kaba lubbo he'nenneke no'o duuchchiingennten. <verse eid="DEU 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 5:4" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti koobati hana giira giddii'n alba ha'nook edo hedheexxi ha'no'n haaso'een. <verse eid="DEU 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 5:5" />Ha'noo kinni giira sodaattineexxi koobati hana fula gophphineemmaxxe'e eettenee yanna Duuchchi Woddike Goottika hiyyichcho ha'noo'n kulonnaa ani Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxe'ninna ha'nooxxe oddo'n uurreenne; isinna ane'n hiyye haaso'e qici:<verse eid="DEU 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 5:6" />«Garbummatike boginaa'n, Gibtsee'n fulchennek Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ani atike Magenon.<verse eid="DEU 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 5:7" />«Ani gadhi darre wele magenuwwi ati'aa kadoqqe'e.<verse eid="DEU 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 5:8" />«Iimate'ninna buttate'n yookaan wodi'i giddo hexxeexxa heene dadaxxe bifa'n fakke ifi'a giissexxoxxe'e. <verse eid="DEU 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 5:9" />Ani Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atiki Mageni anee gibaakara annuwwi insa'neekixxe cubboxxee sasenna shoole ila qico'n oose insa'neexxa mura woxisanok hinaattichcha Mageno kadeennaxxe'e konnechchuwwi'a kumbu hitoxxe'e yookaan magenoonfattoxxe'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:1">Lew. 26:1</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 4:15-18">Lew. 4:15-18</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 27:15">27:15</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 5:10" />Anee eeyaakeri'aanna seera anika heqqedhaaka kinni kuma ila qico'n jaalala anixxa leellishannon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:6-7">Fula. 34:6-7</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:18">Lak. 14:18</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:9-10">Lew. 7:9-10</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 5:11" />«Duuchchi Woddike Gootti summa isika tola ganaaka mura woxisa waala gophaammaxxee Duuchchi Woddika Gootta atike Mageniinka summa dhariinxenni gandoxxe'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:12">Lew. 19:12</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="DEU 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 5:12" />«Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni atee ajajemmashshanni Edi Sanbatixxa barra woyyoonsite'e ulfeessi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:23-30">Fula. 16:23-30</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 31:12-14">31:12-14</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 5:13" />Jaane barra giddo hujjatochcho hucci. <verse eid="DEU 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 5:14" />Torbaxxi barra kinni Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Magenike Edi Sanbatan. Eettenee barra ateteenna kadi atixxe labbaxxi yookaan meyyaxxi belto yookaan atik labbak erganjinna atixxe meyyaxxi erganjo yookaan atik qotiyyichchi, harrichchi yookaan huuni atik horinna yookaan atike bitumi giddo hedheek keessuntichchi heene hujenna hujjinoqqe'e; tinninna ati hafuura adhdhiteteshshanna atik labbakinna atixxi meyyaxxi erganjo hafuura adhdho'aaten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:12">Fula. 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 31:15">31:15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:21">34:21</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 35:2">35:2</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:3">Lew. 23:3</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 5:15" />Gibtse hexxetta wodda atinna garbake kaddeettaxxanna ookkooni'nn Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageni ifixxe hunnameette anganninna jabaxxe ifixxe hirrenni ate'e fulcheexxa qalli hiyyi; tennexxee Duuchhci Woddik Gootti atik Mageni Edi Sanbatixxa barra ulfeessitattoshsha atee'e ajaje'een.<verse eid="DEU 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 5:16" />«Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageni ati'a uwwaake boga'n wogga atixxi qeerrexo'anna eloxi ati'a kaddo'a Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageni ajajemmashshann annakanna ama ifixxa ulfeesi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:16">Lew. 27:16</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 15:4">Mat. 15:4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:19">19:19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 7:10">Mar. 7:10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:19">10:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:20">Luq. 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:2-3">Efe. 6:2-3</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 5:17" />«Shiltoxxe'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:6">Dada. 9:6</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 9:6">Lew. 9:6</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:17">Lew. 24:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:21">Mat. 5:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:18">19:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:19">Mar. 10:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:20">Luq. 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:9">Rom. 13:9</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:11">Ya'i. 2:11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 5:18" />«Yabaabuldoxxe'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Lew. 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:27">Mat. 5:27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:18">19:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:19">Mar. 10:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:2">Luq. 18:2</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 5:19" />«Moortoxxe'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:11">Lew. 19:11</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:18">Mat. 19:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:19">Mar. 10:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:20">Luq. 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:9">Rom. 13:9</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 5:20" />«Ayye'ninna dharik dhugaa kuldoxxe'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:1">Fula. 23:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:18">Mat. 19:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:19">Mar. 10:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:20">Luq. 18:20</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 5:21" />«Wele manjixxa are yookaan mine yookaan erganjuwwa isika, lalo isika harruwwa isixxanna kadi afeexxe karra duuchchanaa'n hoonechchonna gaabbitoxxe'e.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:7">Rom. 7:7</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:9">13:9</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 5:22" />Duuchchi woddik Gootti kooba hana giirati, dimma dukana raachcho'eeke duumanchi giddo ha'nooxxe tuuta duuchcha'n hafuura gikki asseexxi haso'eek isik ajajuwwi konneten. Wele lebeechchi hedhebaan; konnee ajajuwwanna lame bocendeexxe kino'n borreesseexxi ane'n uwween.<verse eid="DEU 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ardiinxa Soda'a</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 20:18-21">Fula. 20:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 5:23" />Koobate'n giira bubbaamma wodda, dukkana giddii'n hafuura isika laqqinee wodda ha'no ha'nooxxe gosa gosake mini mini hadik sooresuwwinna geedhe anibaa daggineexxi, <verse eid="DEU 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 5:24" />hitinee qici, «Duuchchi woddiki Gooti no'ok Mageni ifika ulfinna gaachchanna no'o'n leellishe'een; giira giddi'ninna hafuura isika laqeennen; Mageni manjoke'n haaso'ee'naa manji lubbo galaaxxa midde telcho uundeennen. <verse eid="DEU 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 5:25" />Ta'anni elqi'a Duuchchi Woddike Gootta no'oke Mageniinka hafuura lanqonnole reya rennannon; tinni jabaxxi giiranna no'o itte balleessitaaxxen; mayeeta rennanno? <verse eid="DEU 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 5:26" />Giira giddo hedhe haaso'aa wodda no'o lanqenneshsha hedhaake Mageniinka hafuura laqeexxi lubbo galeek manji isi ayyete? <verse eid="DEU 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 5:27" />Ati marte biri'a shiqqettexxi Duuchchi woddiki Gootti no'oki Mageni hiyya'neexxa duuchcha laqi. Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti no'ok Mageni no'oo hiyyaaxxa duuchcha no'o'ni kul; no'onna lanqennexxi ajajemmannon.»<verse eid="DEU 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 5:28" />Tennee ane'n haasottinaa wodda Duuchchi Woddik Gootti laqeexxi Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ane'e hiyyee qici, «Kunni ardi ate'e maa hiyyeexxa laqeennen; insa'ne hineexxi duuchchinna eloxxen. <verse eid="DEU 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 5:29" />Insa'ne ifi'anna ifixxe oose'a duuchchi woddi'a eloxxi kaddo'a, anee'e sodaanto'anna duuchchi wodda ajajuwwa anka duuchcha heqe'no'a insa'ne'e iitta hedheeka godoba anfa'neele silaati maachcho hedhemma'a!<verse eid="DEU 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 5:30" />«Martettexxi ifi ifike duunkaanibaa ille iima hingo'a insa'ne'n kul. <verse eid="DEU 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 5:31" />Ati kinn dhaallaashsha insa'ne'a uwwannoka boga heqqinaasha insa'ne'n heqqe'no'a barsiissattoka ajajuwwa, seeruwakanna aada duuchcha ati'a uwwona'a kaba ani bira turi.»<verse eid="DEU 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 5:32" />Yoona Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ha'nooki Mageni ha'no'ni ajajemmaka ajaja muuxaaxxee qophpheeffatte; konne seerinaa'ni elqenna kayya higginoqqe. <verse eid="DEU 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 5:33" />Dhaaldinaake boga'ni hedhoti hedha dandeettinaashsha, eloxxii ha'no'a kaddaashanna wogga ha'nooxxi qeerrexxaashsha Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ha'nooki Mageni ajajemmake ora duuchcha'ni me'e.<verse eid="DEU 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DEU 6" />
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi woddika Gootta Atika Mageno Eeyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 6:1" />Yordanosi'i fooffine'e ha'no dhaaldinaaka boga heqqitinaashsha ha'no barsisonna'a Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ha'nook Mageni ane'ni uwwe'eki ajaji, seerinna aada konneeran. <verse eid="DEU 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 6:2" />Kunninna konne'e ha'no'aa uwwaannexxa aadanna ajaja isika duuchcha heqqexxine wogga ha'nooxxi qeerrexxaashsha, ati, atixxi oosenna insa'nexxe oosexxi oose hedhoti hexxineeke baro duuchcha'ni Duuchchi woddika Gootta ha'noka Mageno sodaattinnaashshaten. <verse eid="DEU 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 6:3" />Koo Isira'eelike arda laqqee! Edike annuwwi ha'nookik Duuchchi Woddike Goottik Mageni ha'noo addachiiseemmashshanni elokenna shamake boga'ni eloxxi ati'a kaddaashshanna horte bira saxxotta'a ajaja isika xexxe'achchoti heqqedhi.<verse eid="DEU 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 6:4" />Koo Isira'eelike ardaa laqi! Duuchchi woddiki Gooti no'oki Mageni mitte Magenon. <verse eid="DEU 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 6:5" />Duuchchi Woddika Gootta atika Mageno mitte godobin, shenitte hedhonni, shenitte hunnanni eeyi. <verse eid="DEU 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 6:6" />Telcho ati'a uwwaanneka konnee ajajuwwa godoba galchedhi. <verse eid="DEU 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 6:7" />Atixxe oose'ninna barsiisi: mine atike'ni ofoldato woddanna: ora me'itatto wodda; diiphphatto woddanna kexxatto wodda konne ajajuwwixxe'e jabeesite barisiis. <verse eid="DEU 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 6:8" />Atixxe anga'ninna beessisiinsha konnee ajajuwwa usu'dhdhi; kallachake'ni uggudhdhi. <verse eid="DEU 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 6:9" />Mine atikixxe gubane'ninna dalla'iinxe huluwa'ni konne ajajuwwa borreesi.<verse eid="DEU 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 6:10" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni ati'a uwwo'a edika annuwwa atike'e Abiraami'a, Yisaaqi'anna Ya'iqoobi'a kako aageemmake boga'ni ate'e e'yishaa wodda ookko'o ati ijaartebexxoka lumollakanna elolla qachchuwwa,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Dada. 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:3">26:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 28:13">28:13</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 6:11" />Atike kadebaaka elolla yaane duuchchinni wo'meeka minuwwa uuddeebexxoxxa wode'iinxa baluwwa, kaassebexxoka woyinetika hiddichchuwwanna ejersiinka haqichchuwwa ati'a uwweena'a itte godditatto wodda, <verse eid="DEU 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 6:12" />garbu hexxaattak Gibtseke boganaa'n ate'e fulcheeka Duuchchi Woddika Gootta deetabexxoshsha ifi heqqedhi. <verse eid="DEU 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 6:13" />Duuchchi Woddika Gootta atika Mageno sodaati: isi calli'aanna ergatemi; summi isikinni kakati.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:10">Mat. 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:8">Luq. 4:8</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 6:14" />Qarqara atike'ni hedheeki ardi magenooffata'neeka wele magenuwwa hordoffoxxe'e; <verse eid="DEU 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 6:15" />oddo atixxe'ni hedheeki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti atik Mageni hinaatticha Mageno kadeemmaxxe'e ate'ni mufe isixxi ha'itaammaxxe'e bogi iimii'ni atee balleessoqqe; <verse eid="DEU 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 6:16" />Maasahi'n hiyyemaammake booncho'n hega uuddinemmashsha Duuchchi woddika Gootta ha'nooka Mageno hega uudinoqen;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">Fula. 17:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:7">Mat. 4:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:12">Luq. 4:12</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 6:17" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'nok Mageni ha'no'a uwweemmaka ajajuwwa, akeettuwwanna aaduwwa xonxoommachchoti heqqedhdhe. <verse eid="DEU 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 6:18" />Eloxxi ati'a kaddashshanna Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti edike annuwwa atike'e uwwo'a kakate'e addachchiiseemmaka ookkone'e eloka boga e'yite dhaaldota'a Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo qajeelanna eloxxa yaane assi, <verse eid="DEU 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 6:19" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti haaso'emmashshanni naapha atika duuchcha ifi edii'ni shorritatton.<verse eid="DEU 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 6:20" />Dagaake baro'ni belti atiki «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ho'nook Mageni ha'noo ajajeemmaxxi akeettuwwa, galdumikinna seeruwwixxi tika maachcho?» Hiyye atee'e qoroole, <verse eid="DEU 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 6:21" />hitato qici; «No'o Gibtse boga'ni Feri'oonike garbuwwamman: Duuchchi Woddik Gootti kinni jabaxxe hirre ifixxenni Gibtsee'ni ho'oo fulcheen. <verse eid="DEU 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 6:22" />No'o ille no'oxxinni uundaa'naa Duuchchi Woddik Gootti lumollammanna sodaachchisaaka, mambe'uwwa beessisuwwakanna maso yaanuwwa Gibtse'ni, Feri'oonininna mini hado isike duuchcha'ni asse. <verse eid="DEU 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 6:23" />No'oo kinni edike annuwwa no'okee'e uwwo'a kakate addachchiseemmake bogiba'a no'oo e'yisho'anna uwwo'a ookkoo'ni no'oo fulcheen. <verse eid="DEU 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 6:24" />Telcho kaddeemmashshan duuchchi wodda eloxxi no'o'aa kaddaashsha lubboti he'noo'naa konnee galduma muunxonna'a Duuchchi Woddika Gootta no'oka Mageno sodaantannoshsha Mageni no'oo ajajeen. <verse eid="DEU 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 6:25" />Yoona konnee seera duuchcha isi no'oo ajaajeemmaxxe qixxe'ni Duuchchi woddiki Gootti no'ok Mageni edo xonixxoommante heqqe'nonnole itti no'o'a qullummate kaddaani.»<verse eid="DEU 6:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DEU 7" />
  <para style="s1">Gosa Gosaka Arda Bogakena'ni Fulcha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:11-16">Fula. 34:11-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 7:1" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni dhaaldotta'a e'yitattoke boga'ni ate'e iyyedagaa wodda heddo manna ate'e sa'aaka lumolammanna jajjabba kadeeka torbaane gosa gosaka arda: Keexito, Gergerisiito, Amoorito, Kenaanito, Feeriizito, Hiititotinna Iyyaabusito ati edii'ni insa'ne'e fulchano wodda;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:19">Erga. Huj. 13:19</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 7:2" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageni insa'nee atixxe anga'n sa'isse uwwee'na atinna injifatte duuchchiinga kutti assite biri; atinna insa'nenni weli aaggoxxe'e; insa'ne'aanna o'ittoxxe'e. <verse eid="DEU 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 7:3" />Ati dubara atika insa'neexxe labbaxxe oose'a heerunsiisse yookaani labbaxxe atixxe oose'a dubarra atika aadhisse insa'nenni balloondoxxe'e. <verse eid="DEU 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 7:4" />Tenne assitottole oose atixxi anee hordofa waalde wele magenuwwa magenoonfattaashsha assinammaxxe'e tennenaa'ni kexxeexxa Duuchchi Woddik Gootti yo'oshsha ate'ni mufate iikki woddi atee balleessammaxxeeten. <verse eid="DEU 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 7:5" />Yoona insa'ne'e assitinaaxxi, tolchimalchuwwa insa'neeka findigge, magenoonfatammaxxa fakkuwwa insa'nexxa butuchche; Asheera hiyyemmaka meyyake magenixxa fakke diige; magenuwwa insa'neekixxa fakkuwwa giirati gubbe;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:3">Lan. 12:3</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 7:6" />Ati Duuchchi woddike Gootta atike Mageni'a woyyichcha arda kaddeettaxxee; Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti atiki Mageni ifike ardanna geego isi'a kaddotta'a buttatike arda duuchchanaa'ni ate'e fi'leeni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5">Fula. 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 4:20">Lew. 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 14:2">14:2</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:18">26:18</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:4">Tit. 2:4</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1 Phex. 2:9</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 7:7" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ha'noo eeyeekinna fi'le'eki wele mannanaa'n laakkoossiki bira saxxineexxetebaan; laakoossi ha'nooki arda duuchchanaa'ni hara shiixxokemmani. <verse eid="DEU 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 7:8" />Yaane kinni Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ha'noo jabaaxxe hirre ifixxenni fulchcheki; garibummati hexxinaamake boganaa'ninna Gibtseke moyanjixxe anganaa'ni ha'noo wodeeki Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ha'noo eeyemmaxxeenna edike annuwwa ha'nookee aageemmaxxa kako heqqedheemmaxxeeteni. <verse eid="DEU 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 7:9" />Tennexxe Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atiki Mageni Magenoke kadeexxa ege'ni; isoo eeyaakaranna ajajuwwa isikanna heqqedhaake jaalala isixxixxa kaako kuma ilaaqico'ni heqqedhaake xuurameesa Magenoni. <verse eid="DEU 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 7:10" />Yaane kinni isoo gibaakara insa'ne uundaa'naanni halo insa'ne'ni fulaani; turebaangi halo insa'ne'ni fulaani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:5-6">Fula. 20:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:6-7">34:6-7</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:18">Lak. 14:18</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 5:9-10">Lew. 5:9-10</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 7:11" />Tennexxee ani telcho ati'a uwwaanneka ajaja; aadanna seera anika xexxe'achchoti horidofi.<verse eid="DEU 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Magenokee Aajajemati Daggaaxxa Eebba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 28:1-14">Lan. 28:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 7:12" />Konnee seeruwwa laqqottolna xexxe'achchoti heqqexxottole; Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atiki Mageni edike annuwa atike'e kaako aagemmashshanni; atinninna welti aageemmaxxa jaalalatixxa kako heqqedhaani. <verse eid="DEU 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 7:13" />Isi atee eeyaan, atee eebbisaani, bira saxxe hortattoshsha assaani. Ati'a uwwo'a edike annuwwa atikee kakateemmake boga'ni i'litattoxxa oose, atike bogixxa karra, midhdhuwwa, haaroxxa woyyinenna ejersiinxa zayite, hore atikika, laluwwa, gedhebokanna re'e eebbisaani. <verse eid="DEU 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 7:14" />Ardi duuchchi irra ati eebbisendattoni; atiki labbakinna meyyaki mannji yookaani hori atiki labbakinna meyaaki horabaaki hedhabaani. <verse eid="DEU 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 7:15" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti huuni dhukubi duuchchi ate geyabaashsha heqqaani; Gibtseke boga'n hexxetta wodda ookkonee egendetteka elobaaka dhukkuba atee gibaake duuchcha'ni male'e ate'ni idagabaani. <verse eid="DEU 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 7:16" />Duuchchi woddki Gootti atiki Mageni atixxe anga'ni sa'isse uwwaaka arduwwa duuchcha mararteboxxongi bira hasissaani; insa'ne magenoonfantaammaxxa fakkuwwa magenonfatati fonxorote'ni e'yitoxxe'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 11:13-17">Lew. 11:13-17</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 7:17" />«Kunni gosa gosatiki ardi no'o irra jajjabbake kadeemmaxxe'e hitta assinee insa'nee bogakenaa'ni fulchinanno?» Hite'e godobi atik giddo heddattoxxe hexxeeni.<verse eid="DEU 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 7:18" />Yaane kinni Insa'nee sodaattoxxe: Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni Feri'ooni'ninna Gibtseke arda duuchcha'n asseexxa adda qalli hiyyi. <verse eid="DEU 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 7:19" />Lumollamma bala, mambe'inka beesisuwwanna maso yaanuwwanni Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti atiki Mageni hunnaameete anganninna jabaxxe hirre isixxenni fulcheexxa ille atixxenni uuddeetteni. Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti atiki Mageni ati ta'a sodaattaatteke gosa gosake ardi duuchchi edo assemmashshanni ta'anna assaani. <verse eid="DEU 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 7:20" />Iittani Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni lubbo gate'e atenaa'ni sho'omeekiir midde ba'aaqico'ni insane'ni alayyonna soda'a uggannon. <verse eid="DEU 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 7:21" />Atinni hedheek Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni lumokenna sodaachchisaake Mageno kadeemmaxxe'e kunni arduwwi atee'e sodaachchisoqqe'e. <verse eid="DEU 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 7:22" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atiki Mageni konnee gosa gosaka arda shiixxishe shiixxishee ati edii'ni insa'ne'e fulchaan: biniichuwwiink laakkoossi atikee loola'ni heddatabaashsha duuchchiinga mitte yanna'n ati bira hasissabaan. <verse eid="DEU 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 7:23" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni kinni insa'ne ba'naa qico'ni alayyo jabaka ugge anga atixxe'n insa'ne'e sa'issee uwwaan. <verse eid="DEU 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 7:24" />Mowonjuwwa insa'neka anga atixxe'n sa'issee uwwaan: summi insa'nek dedhemaashsha assitatton. Insa'nee'e birtatto qico'ni atee'e injifata dande'aaki mitti manjinna hedhebaan. <verse eid="DEU 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 7:25" />Insa'ne magenooffantaammaxxe fakkuwwa'ni giira wori: ise'ni hana hedhemmaka birretika sibljonna worqe gaabbite ifi'a gatilsitooxxe'e: iitta assa gophphottole Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Mageno'ni diqachchiissaaxxe'e kaddeemmaxxe'e ate'e gugguffachchiissaan. <verse eid="DEU 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 7:26" />Battitte yaane mine atikibaa'a yookaan ifi'a adhdhitoxxe'e: iitta assitottole atinna isishshanni baxxabexxoshsha haranga gibi: isinna ba'nete'e foyemeeke kadeemmaxxe'e boshshedhi.<verse eid="DEU 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DEU 8" />
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi woddika Gootta Deetoxxe'e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 8:1" />Lubboti hexxinaasha, hortinaashanna Duuchchi woddiki Gootti edike ha'nooke annuwwi'a kakate addachiisemmake boga'n e'yitine dhaaldino'a, ani telcho ati'a uwwaanneka mitti mittinga ajaja hordofatee'e xexxe'atte. <verse eid="DEU 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 8:2" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni ajajuwwa isika ati heqqexxettexxanna godobi atiki giddo hexxeexxa ege'nate'e, ate'e shaqqake asso'aanna hega uudo'a tenne shoole tomme wogguwwa'ni konne qiilla gammooje bogike orika googeessa duuchcha hitta ate'e akeekeexxa qaabbati. <verse eid="DEU 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 8:3" />Manji Duuchchi woddike Goottike afo'inaa'ni fula'neeke mitti mitti hiyyichchinnite malee'e ita callin hedha'nebaaxxa ate'e barsiiso'a atee'e sololse: atinna kadi atik edik annuwwi egedinebaaxa menna atee'e itise: <verse eid="DEU 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 8:4" />Konne shoole tomme wogga giddo seema atixxinna muddeeban: lekka atixxinna luquluqu hiteeban. <verse eid="DEU 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 8:5" />Tennexxee manji ifika belto xixammashsha Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageninna ateenna xixaaxxa godoba galchedhi.<verse eid="DEU 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 8:6" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Magenike ora'ni me'ita'ni isoonna ulfeessita'ni ajajuwwa isika heqqedhi. <verse eid="DEU 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 8:7" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageni koobatena'ni butti'a yaa'ammake wode'ina'ninna baleessiinxi muummuwwa hexxeeke dhooquwwatena'ninna tulluchuwwakenaa'ni wodi'i yaa'a'neke shamoke bogibaa'a atee'e e'yisho'aten. <verse eid="DEU 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 8:8" />Dinnenna so'a, woyinenna odiink haqqichchuwwa, roomaane, ejersiinxi zayitenna malebi afemaake bogan: <verse eid="DEU 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 8:9" />Mittichchinna gophemabaaxxe kebbo gophendabaaba, rassuwwa sibilo kaddaaba, tulluchuwwa iseka uunde sageetto qote fulcha dandeettattoke bogani. <verse eid="DEU 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 8:10" />Atinna ittee godditatto wodda iitta hedheeka shamoka boga ati'a uuwweemmaxxe'e Duuchchi woddika Gootta atika Mageno galteeffati. <verse eid="DEU 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 8:11" />Ani telcho ate'ni uwwaaneka ajaja isika, aadanna seera isika heqqedha gophphee Duuchchi Woddika Gootta atika Mageno deetaboxxoshsha heqqedhi. <verse eid="DEU 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 8:12" />Itte godditatto woddanna elo eloka minuwwa ijaadhdhite hexxatto wodda; <verse eid="DEU 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 8:13" />Iittanni lali, gedhebikinna, re'e, hore bira sa'aa wodda, birretiki sibljinna worqe, ati'a bira saxxaa wodda, affettelichchi duuchchi itti lebemaa wodda, <verse eid="DEU 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 8:14" />hollitettexxi garbumma hexxattake boganaa'ni Gibtsee'ni atee fulichchemmaka Duuchchi Woddika Gootta Mageno atika deetattoni. <verse eid="DEU 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 8:15" />Eetenne ba'laaxxe, sodaachchiissaaxxenna dheebeessitaaxxe qiilla gammoojje'ni; wodi'i afe mabaake bagoke boga'ni; ha'la calliki bofinna gaado hexxexxe qiilla gammooje'ni ate'e akeekeni; jabaxxe rassanaa'ninna wodde'e ati'a fulichcheeni. <verse eid="DEU 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 8:16" />Uduma ati'a eloxxe kaddaashsha atee saliphphisso'a manjo asso'aanna hega uudo'a; ediki annuwi atiki hara egenebaachcho menna hinaacho qiilla gammoojjeke boga'ni atee itiseeni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 13:5-6">Hos. 13:5-6</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 8:17" />Dedha «Ani duroomenneki hunna anxenni jabaate hujeeteni» hitee godobi atiki giddo heddattoxxe hexxeeni. <verse eid="DEU 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 8:18" />Yaane kinni karra horatattoshsha hunnanna ati'a uwweek, edike atike annuwi'aanna aageemmaxxa kako muuxeeki isote kadeemmaxxe'e Duuchchi Woddika Goottta atika Mageno hedi: <verse eid="DEU 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 8:19" />Duuchchi Woddika Gootta atika Mageno deetottolenna wele magenuwwa hordoffe kumbu hita'ni ookkone magenuwwi'a magenooffattottole, dhugaandinni baxxinaaxxa ha'no'a techcho kokeessaannen. <verse eid="DEU 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 8:20" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ha'no edii'ni hedhemmaka gosa gosaka arda biremmashshanni Duuchchi Woddike Gootta ha'noke Mageni'a ajajama gophphinemmaxxe'e ha'nonna muddinaani.<verse eid="DEU 8:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DEU 9" />
  <para style="s1">Isira'eelike Ardixxa Ajajema Gopha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 9:1" />Koo Isira'eelike ardaa Laqi: iima geyaaka dalla'a afeeka lumolla qachchuwwa afeekara ati irra lumokenna jabake kadeeka gosa gosaka arda fulchite e'yitotta'a Yordaanoosii ta'a fooffatton. <verse eid="DEU 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 9:2" />Enaaqito jajjabakenna qeerrarrama ardamman: insa'neenna egendeeten «Enaaqito ayyete insa'ne'e injifata dande'aa?» Hinaa'na'a laqqeeten. <verse eid="DEU 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 9:3" />Kaddo malee'e bubbaaxxe giirashsha ati edii'ni edise foofaak Duuchchi woddike Gootta atike Mageno kadeexxa telcho ege'ni: insa'neenna balleessaan ati edonna insa'nee'e injifataan: atinna Duuchchi Woddok Gootti ate'ni hiyye addachchiisemmashanni insa'nee'e fulchitatton: ikki woddi insa'ne'e kutti assite birtatton. <verse eid="DEU 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 9:4" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni inisa'nee ati edii'n fulcheechchi uduma «Konne boga dhaalona'a Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ane'e kaba'a aadhedageechchi qullumma anxeetebaan» hite godobi giddo heddoxxe'e. Duuchchi woddiki Gootti konne gosa gosake ardaa ati edii'ni shorra'neeki insa'neexxe fuggo hujexxe buuto'ate malee'e atixxe qullummaatebaani. <verse eid="DEU 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 9:5" />Boga insa'neke'n e'yite dhaaldatok atixxe qullumma yookaan qaajeelumma atixxeete kaddebaangi edike annuwwa atikee Abirihaami'a, Yisaaqi'anna Ya'iqoobi'a aageemmaxxa kako muuxatee'e Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni konnee gosa gosaka arda insa'neexxe fuggonaa'ni kexxeexxa ati edii'ni insa'ne'e shorraammaxxeten. <verse eid="DEU 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 9:6" />Tennexxe'e Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni konne shamoka boga dhaaldota'a ati'a uwwa'neeki qulumma atixeete kaddeebaaxxa ege'ni; ati gooba micciirteetteken.<verse eid="DEU 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jabbe Worqetixxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 9:7" />Duuchchi woddika Gootta atika Mageno qiilla gammoojje'ni hitta isoo mufachchiissettexxa kassi hiyyi; hara deetoxxe'e. Ati Gibtsee'ni fuldettexxe barranaa'n ke'isse'e konne booncho'ni geltattoxee Duuchchi woddike Gootta'n jallattetteshshanden. <verse eid="DEU 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 9:8" />Koorebike booncho'ni Duuchchi Woddika Gootta mufachchiissine'en isinna ha'no'o biro'a yo'osha mufate ke'e. <verse eid="DEU 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 9:9" />Aninna bocendeexxa kinuwwa Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ha'noonni welti ageemmaxxa kakottixxa bocendeexxa kinuwwa aadhdhona'a koobati hana fulenne wodda mitechchonna itebe'nongi, wodeekanna hawweebe'nongi shoole tomme barranna hashsha turenen:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:18">Fula. 24:18</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 9:10" />Duuchchi Woddi Gootti lame bocendeexxe kino'ni anga ifixxenni borreesseexxa borro ane'ni uwwe: ha'no bukki hitineemmaxxe barra'ni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti koobate'ni giira giddo hedhe'e ha'no'a kuleemmaki ajajuwwi duuchchi eettene lame bocendeexxe kino'ni hana hedheman.<verse eid="DEU 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 9:11" />Shoole tomme barranna hashsha muuxendeechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti lame bocendeexxa kino iittanni bocendeexxa kakotixxa kino ane'ni uwwe. <verse eid="DEU 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 9:12" />Ookkoneechi uduma Duuchchi woddiki Gootti, «Kexxettexxi, Gibtse'n fulchiteettak atik ardi batto'eemmaxxe'e rakke'e butti'a dirri: ani insa'ne'e ajajeennake ajajanaa'ni ikki woddi bayyante'en: baqinseexxa fakkuwwa ifi'a giisse'nen» hiyye ane'ni kule. <verse eid="DEU 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 9:13" />Higgeenn Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ane'ni hiyyeeqic, «konnee arda uudenne: dhugaanda kunni ardi gooba miccireeke ardani: <verse eid="DEU 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 9:14" />Ani insa'ne'e balleesse summa insa'neekanna buttatenaa'ni balleesse'e birona'a ane'ni waali: ateena insa'nee irra jabakenna heddo arda atee'e assannon» hiyye. <verse eid="DEU 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 9:15" />Tennexxee eettene kooba'ni giira bubbaa'naa eettenee lame bocendeexxa kakotixxa kino lamiinxe anganni abixxenneshshanni eettene koobanaa'n illee iima hige dirreennen. <verse eid="DEU 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 9:16" />Dhugaandinni Duuchchi woddik Gootti ha'no Mageno ajajeemmake oranaa'ni ikki woddi fuldine worqe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Worqe </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fula. 32:2-4 uudi. </char></note> baqinseexxa jabbetixxa fakkenna ifi'a giissexxine Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'n ha'no cubbo hujjineexxa aninna uudennen. <verse eid="DEU 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 9:17" />Tenneexxee lamiinxa bocendeexxa kino anga anixxe'ni abixeennaxxa aadhdhe ha'no edo butta darebbe butuche birenen. <verse eid="DEU 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 9:18" />Ookkoo'ninna Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo fuggoxxa yaane hujati mufeti ke'aashsha assitaaxxa cubbo hujjineemmaxxe'e mittechchonna afo'o anke'ni maqeebe'noggi shoole tomme barranna hashsha higgeenni Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo albik gonbisemennen. <verse eid="DEU 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 9:19" />Ha'noo'o biro'a fuggo aaremeemmaxxe'e: aninna Duuchchi woddike Goottixxa mufenna aare sodaatttinaan: yaane kinni Duuchchi woddiki Gootti higgeenna anixxa soodachcho laqe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:21">Ibr. 12:21</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 9:20" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Aarooni'i balleesso'a fuggo aareemman: ookkone wodda Aarooni'anna soodatennen. <verse eid="DEU 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 9:21" />Ha'no eettene jabbexxa fakke giissiyyo cubbo hujjineemman; tennexxe'e eettenee jabbexxa fakke aadhennexxi giirate'n baqqaashsha assennen. Ookkonechchi uduma baqqemmaxxa buttuchche bullete kaddaa qico'n dayennexxi eettene bulle koobatenaa'n adadee yaa'anemake wodi'i giddo xeerrenne. <verse eid="DEU 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 9:22" />Tebeerraa'ni, Maasahiinna Qiibiro Hataawwi'n Duuchchi woddika Gootta mufachchiisennen. <verse eid="DEU 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 9:23" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Qaadesi Barinnee'ni ha'no'o, «Alalle qabattine ha'no'a uwweennaka boga dhaaldine qadaada ifike assedhe» hiyyeexxi ergee wodda ha'no kinni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'nooke Magenike ajaja'ni jallattine; isi hiyyeexxa dhugaate hitine adhdhitineba'a; isi'aanna ajajendineba'a.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:25">Lak. 13:25</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:38">14:38</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:21">Lan. 1:21</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 3:16">Ibr. 3:16</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 9:24" />Ani ha'noo'o ergennexxe yannanaa'n telchi qico'n Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'n jallitineeshshann hexxineen.<verse eid="DEU 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 9:25" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ha'noo'o biraaxxa haaso'emmaxxee eettene shoole tomme barranna hashsha Duuchchi Woddik Gootti edo albik gonbiisemennen. <verse eid="DEU 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 9:26" />Hiyya'ni Duuchchi woddike Goottibaa'a soodatene qic, «Ee, Lumike Duuchchi Woddik Gootta Magenoo atixxe lumoxxe hunnanni woddettekanna jabaxxe hirre atixxinninnaa Gibtsee'n fulchitettaka atike geego kadeeka atika arda birtoxxe'e. <verse eid="DEU 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 9:27" />Erganjuwwa atika Abirihaami, Yisaaqinna, Ya'iqoobi hedi: konne ardixxa gooba micciira, fuggonna cubbo insa'neexxa uuddoxxe'e. <verse eid="DEU 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 9:28" />Iitta kada gophphoole kinni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti insa'ne addachchiisemmashshanni arda ifika ookkone bogiba'a e'yisha dande'a gophemmaxxeenna insa'ne'e gibeemmaxxe'e, ‹Qiilla gammoojje'ni insa'nee shiyo'a aadhe fulche› hinaani. <verse eid="DEU 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 9:29" />Yaane kinni insa'ne atixxe jabaxxe hunnanninna jabaxxe hirre atixxenni aaxxe fulchiteettakenna geego kadeeka arda atiken» hiyye.<verse eid="DEU 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DEU 10" />
  <para style="s1">Langaxxa Uwwendeexxa Tomme Seerixxa Bocendeexxa kino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:1-10">Fula. 34:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 10:1" />Eettenne yanna Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anee hiyyee qici, «Edi woddixxishsha hexxeexxa lame kino boccetteexxi aniba'a koobbati hana fuli; saaxinetanna haqichchik giisi. <verse eid="DEU 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 10:2" />Ani atii enqitettexxe edi woddixxe bocendeexxe kino'ni hedhemmaka hiyyichchuwwa tenne bocendeexxe kinuwa'ni borreessannoni; atinna tenne bocendeexxa kino saaxine giddo uggitatoni.»<verse eid="DEU 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 10:3" />Tennexxee ani waaccotike haqichchika Taabota giissennen; ediwoddixxishsha hexxeexxa lame kino boce'e giissennen; lamiinxa bocendeexxa kino anga abixxennexxi koobate'ni fulenne. <verse eid="DEU 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 10:4" />Duuchchi woddiki Goottinna koobati hunda bukki hitineemmaxxa barra giirati giddo hedheexxi ha'no'a haaso'emmaka edi wodda borreessemmanga tomme ajajuwwa tenne bocendeexxe kino'ni borreesse. Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna tennee bocendeexxa lame kino ane'ni uwwe. <verse eid="DEU 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 10:5" />Ookkonechchi uduma koobatenaa'ni hige dirrenne; Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ane'e ajajemmashshanni saaxine giddo tenne bocendeexxa kino uggenen; eetene yannannaa'ni saffe'e yoonna ookkonni hexxeeni. <verse eid="DEU 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 10:6" />Isira'eeliki ardi Bi'eeroti'ni Bine Ya'iqaani hiyyemaake wode'inke baleessuwwibaa'ni ke'eexxi Moosera'a me'ine; Aarooninna ookko re'e moogeme; beleti isik Ali'aazaarinna isixxe bakka'ni qeesome. <verse eid="DEU 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 10:7" />Isira'eelik ardinna ookkoo'n ke'neexxi Gudigaada hiyyemaake boonchiba'a me'e; ookkoo'ninna heddo wode'inxi muummuwwa hexxemmaba Yooxibaata hiyyemaake bogiba'a me'e. <verse eid="DEU 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 10:8" />Eettene yanna Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a ergatemo'a isike ardi edo uurro'a summi isikenni arda eebiso'anna isika kakotika taabota duko'a Duuchchi Woddi Goottik Leewwika gosatika mine gargar foye; techchonna Leewike gosatike minike ardixxi ergatensha tennende.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:5-8">Lak. 3:5-8</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 10:9" />Leewwito dayyuwwi ifikixxe oddo'n qadaada yookaan qoobbo afagopheechchi tennenaa'ni kexxeexxen; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageni insa'ne'n kulemmashshanni issa'nek qadaad Duuchchi Woddike Goottan. <verse eid="DEU 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 10:10" />Aninna siretixxe yannashshanni, koobate'n shoole tomme barranna shoole tomme hashsha turennen; eettenee yanna Duuchchi woddiki Gootti higgeenni soodachcho anixxa laqeen; ha'noonna bira eeyyeba'a.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:28">Fula. 34:28</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 10:11" />Tennexxe'e Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ane'e, «Missi, insa'neeke edike annuwwaa uwwonaa kako aagennaka boga e'ye'e dhaalashsha konne adara akeeki» hiyye.<verse eid="DEU 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi woddika Gootta Sodaati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 10:12" />Ta'anna koo Isira'eeli Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atiki Mageni atenaa'ni hasa'neechchi maachcho? Duuchchi Woddika Gootta atka Mageno sodaattottaa'a, isika ora duuchchanna me'itottaa'a, isoo'o eetotta'a, mitte godobinninna, shenitte hedhonni isi'a ergattottaa'a, <verse eid="DEU 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 10:13" />eloxxi ati'a kaddo'anna techcho Ani ati'a uwwaanneka ajajuwwanna aaduwwa heqqexxottaateba?<verse eid="DEU 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 10:14" />Iima, iimati iimidarre hexxeexxi iimuwwa, buttanna ise giddo hedheechchi duuchchinna Duuchchi woddike Gootta atike Mageniken. <verse eid="DEU 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 10:15" />Yaane knni Duuchchi woddiki Gootti edika atika annuuwwa ifike assedho'a haseexxi insa'ne'e eeye; techchonna kaddeeshshanni insa'neexxe horte ha'no'o gosa gosake ardi duuchchana'ni gargar foye fi'le. <verse eid="DEU 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 10:16" />Tennexxee qalbe ha'nooxxa jila ofo'le; ta'anni udumi'a yoona gooba ha'nooka micciirtinoqqe'e. <verse eid="DEU 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 10:17" />Mayee? Duuchchi woddik Gootti ha'nooki Magen magenoke hiyyemeechchi duuchchike Mageno, gootoletike gootta, Lumoke Magenon, hunnaameessakenna sodaateme'eke, gamisabaake, mattakanna adhdhabaaken.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:15">1 Xim. 6:15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 17:14">Wal. 17:14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:16">19:16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 10:34">Erga. Huj. 10:34</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:11">Rom. 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:6-9">Gel. 2:6-9</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 10:18" />Isi anna affebaaxxe oose'anna aro'i reyeexxe melaalle'a dhuga'a muraaken; isi annafee boga'n hedhaaka manna eye'e itaachchonna oddoonno uwwaaken. <verse eid="DEU 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 10:19" />Tennexxee ha'nonna Gibtse annafee boga'n hexxinemmaxxee ha'nooke boga'n hedheeka annafee bogi manna eeyye. <verse eid="DEU 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 10:20" />Duuchchi Woddika Gootta atika Mageno sodaati; isoona magenooffat; isinninna mittoomi; summi isikenni kakati. <verse eid="DEU 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 10:21" />Saaddattok isoten; ille atixxenni uudettexxa eettenee lumollanna sodaachchissaaxxa yaanuwwa ati'a asseek atike Mageno. <verse eid="DEU 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 10:22" />Atike edik annuwi aade Gibtse me'e wodda torbaane tomme mannaman; ta'a kinni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageni atee'e iimixxe urjeshsha horte faqqattoshsha asseen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Dada. 15:5</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17">17</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 46:27">46:27</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DEU 11" />
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddika Gootta Eeyyi Isi'aana Ajajemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 11:1" />Yoona Duuchchi woddika Gootta atika Mageno eeyyi; isi atenaa'ni hasaaxxa, aada isixxa:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 11:1">Isika seeranna ajaja isika duuchchi wodda heqqedhi. <verse eid="DEU 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 11:2" />Duuchchi woddike Gootta ha'nookee Mageniinka xixichcho, tinninna isixxa hunnaamette anga, jabaxxa isixxa hirre uuddee baretteexxi oose ha'nooxxee kaddebaak ha'note kaddinemmaxxe'e techcho qalliyye. <verse eid="DEU 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 11:3" />Gibtse giddo, Gibtseke moyanjo Feri'ooni'ninna sike boga duuchcha'n assemmaka beessisuwwanna hujeexxa yaanuwwa,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:8-12:13">Fula. 7:8—12:13</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 11:4" />Gibtseke sannachuwwa'n, fadhaduwwa insa'neeke'ninna fadhadiinxe insa'nexxe gaarruwwa'ni ha'no'o shorraamma wodda Eritiriinxe Abbaayya giddo insa'nee Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hitta liqiinsemmaashsha asseexxi bireexxa qaabbatte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 14:28">14:28</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 11:5" />Qiilla gammoojjenaa'ni kaba geltinaa qico'ni ha'no'a asseexxa uuddeexxi ha'nooxxe oossebaan. <verse eid="DEU 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 11:6" />Roobelka belto Eeliyaabixxe oose Daataninna Aberoomii'i insa'neeke mini hadinninni, insa'neeke duunkaanuwwinninna insa'neeke hor duuchchinninni Isira'eelike ardixxe ille edo butta hitta haanniteexxi insa'ne'e liqiinsiteexxa ha'noxxe oosebaan uuddeexxi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:31-32">Lak. 16:31-32</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 11:7" />Ha'nooxxi ille kinni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hujeexxa huje duuchcha uudde'een. <verse eid="DEU 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 11:8" />Tennexxee Yoordaanosi fooffine'e dhaaldinaaka boga e'yitino'anna abixxitino'a hunna alfitinaashsha ani techcho ha'no'aa uwwaanneka ajajuwwa duuchcha heqqedhdhe. <verse eid="DEU 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 11:9" />Seera isikanna heqqexxinoole Duuchchi Woddik Gootti edike annuwwa ha'nookeenna horte insa'neexxee duuchchi'a uwwo'a kakateemmaka ookkone elokenna shamoke boga'n qeerraka baro hexxinaan. <verse eid="DEU 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 11:10" />Kunni dhaaldaatteki bogi ookkone giddii'n fuldetake hiddichuwwaken wode'e ha'wisammashsha sanne rolkitetteke fichchi giddo mammarenda'n wode'e ha'wilsitaattake Gibtseke bogishshatebaan. <verse eid="DEU 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 11:11" />Yordaanosi'i fooffettexxi dhaaldotta'a me'itaattek bog kinni xeena iimi'n ha'wa'neeke koobuwwatikenna dhooquwwa callike bogan. <verse eid="DEU 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 11:12" />Kunni bogi Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageni isi'a xexe'ata'neeke, woggatike ke'itonaa'n woggatike muuxami qico'n Duuchchi woddik Gootti ifixxen uuda'neeke bogan. <verse eid="DEU 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 11:13" />Ani techcho ha'no'asa uwwaneeka ajajuwwa addatensha heqqexxinoole, tinninna Duuchchi woddika Gootta ha'nooka Mageno eetinoole, mitte godobinni, shenitte hedhonni isi'a ergatendinoole, <verse eid="DEU 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 11:14" />Midha ha'nooxxa, woyyine ha'nooxxanna, ejersiinxe zayiteka haqqichcho bukki assexxino'aa mayetikanna haarsika xeena boga ha'nooke'ni ganaaxxe yanna'inni gansiisannon. <verse eid="DEU 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 11:15" />Hore ha'nookee arso bira saxxe'e hexxaashsha assanon; ha'nonna godditine'e ittinaan. <verse eid="DEU 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 11:16" />Yaadi ha'nook ha'noo dedhisee'na'a wele magenuwwa magenooffattine sagadinabaashsha heqqedhdhe. <verse eid="DEU 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 11:17" />Wele magenuwwa magenooffattinoole Duuchchi woddike Goottixxi mufe ha'no'n bubbaan; isinna xeeni ganabaashsha, buttinikinna midha fulchabaashsha iima cufaani; ha'nonna Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'no'a uwwa'neeke eloke boginanaa'ni ikki woddi baxxinaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:3-5">Lew. 26:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:12-16">Lan. 7:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:1-14">28:1-14</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 11:18" />Konne anika hiyyichchuwwa godoba ha'nooke'ninna sammo ha'nooxxe'n galchedhdhe; iso'o anga ha'nooxxe'ni beessisiinshanna usudhdhitine'e kallachcha ha'nooke'ninna uggudhdhe. <verse eid="DEU 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 11:19" />Konnee ajajuwwa atixxe oose'ninna barsiisi; mine atike'n ofoldato woddanna, ora me'itatto wodda, dhiiphphato woddanna, kexxatto wodda konne ajajuwwixxa haaso'we. <verse eid="DEU 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 11:20" />Mine atikike mikkilanjo'ninna atike dalla'ixxe hulluwwa'n konne ajajuwwa borreessi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:6-9">6:6-9</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 11:21" />Tenne'e assitinoole Duuchchi Woddik Gootti edike ha'nooke annuwwi'a uwwo'a kakateemmake boga'n ha'nookinna oose ha'nooxxik bari buttati iimi darre hexxeexxe iimuwwatike barishsha qeerredhdhaan. <verse eid="DEU 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 11:22" />Duuchchi woddika Gootta ha'nooka Mageno eetinashsha, ora isike duuchcha'ni me'itinaashanna isinni mittoondinaashsha hordoffino'a ha'no'a uwwaaneka konnee ajajuwwa duuchcha xonxoommachchot heqqedhdhe. <verse eid="DEU 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 11:23" />Ookkonechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti konne gosa gosaka arda duuchcha ha'no edii'ni fulchaan; ha'nonna, ha'noo irranna lumookenna jabake kadeeke gosa gosake arda dhaaldinaan. <verse eid="DEU 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 11:24" />Lekka ha'nooxxenni hexxineek bogi duuchchi ha'nooke kadaan; ha'nookee bogixxi gabalanna qiilla gammoojjenaa'n Libaanosi qico'ni, Efiraaxisike galaanibaa'ni kexxe'e dhidhimi darre'n hexxeexxe abbayaqico'n geltaan. <verse eid="DEU 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 11:25" />Huuni manjinna ha'no'o dande'e injifatabaan; Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ha'nook Mageni ha'no'a uwweemmaxxe addachchiisashshanni ha'nooxxa alalshanna ha'noxxa sodaachchisa martine geltineeke boga duuchcha'ni uggaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:3-5">Iya. 1:3-5</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 11:26" />Kunnise ani, techcho eebbatenaa'ninna yowwichchokenaa'ni mitte fi'litino'a ha'no'o edo uggeennen <verse eid="DEU 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 11:27" />Ebisema techcho ani ha'no'a uwwaanneka Duuchchi woddike Gootta ha'nooke Magenika ajajuwwa duuchcha muuxxinoolte kadda wodda, <verse eid="DEU 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 11:28" />Yowwensha kinni Duuchchi Woddike Gootta ha'nooke Magenika ajajuwwa muuxa gibiyyo, egendinebaaka ha'no wele magenuwwa hordofatee'e ani ha'no'o ajajaanneke orinaa'ni fuldinooleten. <verse eid="DEU 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 11:29" />Dhaaldota'a martaatteke ookkone boga'n Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni atee'e aassaa wodda eebisa isixxa Geriizanixxe kooba hana, woyya isika kinni Geebaalixxe kooba hana lallabbatton.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:11-14">Lew. 27:11-14</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 8:33-35">Iya. 8:33-35</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 11:30" />Tinni koobuwwa afendaabi Yordaanoosi wido arishsho e'yitamma darre'n hedheeke oranaa'n dhidhimi darre'ni Araba giddo hexxaammaxxe Kenaanitotike bogi giddo Geligeela albi edo Moorexxe lumolla haqquwwa birabaan. <verse eid="DEU 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 11:31" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'nok Mageni ha'no'a uwwa'neeke boga'ni aagineexxi giddo hexxino'a Yordaanoosi'i fooffino'ate kaddeemmaxxe'e, boga ookkone'e dhaaldineexxi isi giddo hexxinaaxxa yanna, <verse eid="DEU 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 11:32" />techcho ha'no'a ani uwwaanneka seeruwwanna aaduwwa duuchcha muuxiyyotee xexxe'achcho asse.<verse eid="DEU 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DEU 12" />
  <para style="s1">Qofika Magenoofachchoti Booncho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 12:1" />Edike annuwwi ha'nook Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ha'nook Mageni dhaaldino'a ha'no'aa uwweeke boga'n hexxinaaxxi yanna duuchcha xonxoommachoti heqqedhiyyo hasissaaxxi aaduwwanna seeruwwi konneechchinn butti'a hedheekeran. <verse eid="DEU 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 12:2" />Ookkone dhaldina'neeke boginaa'n fulchitinaak gosa gosak ardi qeerrarramma koobbuwwa'n, gooruwwate'ninna mitte mittenge barqaaqeeke haqichchi hunda magenuwwa ifika magenooffatammaka boonichchuwwa duuchcha balleessitine birre. <verse eid="DEU 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 12:3" />Tolchimalchuwwa insa'neeka findigge magenooffantammaxxa insa'neexxa soodduwwanna butuchche; Asheera hiyyemaaka meyyake magenixxe fakkeka insa'neeka utuphuwwa giirate'n gubbe; insa'neeke magenuwwixxa fakkuwwa kukkuttine hindineexxi summa insa'neeke magenik ookkone boonchuwwa'n dedhemaashsha asse.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:5">Lew. 7:5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 12:4" />Ha'no Duuchchi Woddika Gootta ha'noka Mageno magenooffattina'neekir kunni addatebaak ardi insa'neeka dharichcha magenuwwa magenooffantammashsha kaddinoqqe'e. <verse eid="DEU 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 12:5" />Yaane kinni Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ha'nook Mageni summa isike'e galduma kadaasha gosa gosa ha'nooxxi giddo isi fi'laaka booncho harse; ha'noonna ookkone boonchiba'a me'we. <verse eid="DEU 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 12:6" />Ookkone booncho'ni ciiceessemaaka ha'nooka tolchuwwinna wele tolchuwwa ha'nooka tommekena'ni mitte, gargar hexxeexxa uwwa, werrega ha'nookanna eeti ha'nooxxenni uutinaaxxa uwwuwwa, lalo ha'nookenaa'n gedhebokenaa'ninna, re'etennaa'ni edise ilemeeka idagge. <verse eid="DEU 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 12:7" />Ookkonna Duuchchi woddike Gootta ha'nooke Mageni edo ittinaani; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'nook Mageni ha'noo eebiseexxe hujinaaxxe duuchchinni atinna atik mini hadi gammaddinaan.<verse eid="DEU 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 12:8" />Telcho assinannashsha, mitti mittinig ifi'a fakkaatteexxa assemmashsha ha'nonna assitinoqqe'e, <verse eid="DEU 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 12:9" />Mayee'e? Hafuura adhdhitinaake Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ha'nook Mageni ha'no'a uwwaneeke geegiba'a ta'anna geltineebaan. <verse eid="DEU 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 12:10" />Kaddo malee Yordaanoosi'i fooffineexxi Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ha'nook Mageni geegoke asse ha'no'a uwwa'neeke boga'ni ofoldinaa wodda, soda'a belo hexxinaashsha, qarqara ha'nooke'ni hedheeke naapha duuchchanaa'ni ha'no'o hafuura adhdhisaan. <verse eid="DEU 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 12:11" />Okkoo'ninna Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ha'nook Mageni summi isikenni eyyemmashsha fileemamke booncho'ni ani ajajennechchuwwa ciinceessemaaka tolchuwwanna wele tolchuwwa, tommittettanna wele uwwa duuchcha iitanni eeyyanite ifixxinni Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a uunannon hineexxa geego duuchcha bukki assitine'e idagginaan. <verse eid="DEU 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 12:12" />Ookonna ha'no, labbaxinna meyyaxi ha'nooxxi oose, ha'no'a erigatemaake labbakinna meyyakenninni, iittanni qadaada mitte afebaang ifi ifinge qachchuwwi giddo hedhaammakee Leewwitondinni welti Duuchchi Woddike Gootta ha'nooke Mageni edo gammaddinaan. <verse eid="DEU 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 12:13" />Ciinceessitattoka tolcha futti hitetteba shiqishshoxxe heqqedhi. <verse eid="DEU 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 12:14" />Tolcha atika duuchcha shiqishshatto boonni gosa atixxi giddo hedheeke mitte manjike boga'inna Duuchchi Woddik Gootti fileeke booncho'n calla'ni kaddowaal; ciiceessinaake tolchanna kaddo welekanna ani kulenneke boonno calla'n tolchitatton.<verse eid="DEU 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 12:15" />Kaddo malee'e Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'nook Mageni karra uwweexe qixxe'n, hoonee qachchuwwa'ninna kaddo'o sano hanooxxi eeteeba halchitineecho duuchcha du'litine ita dandeettinaan; gadansiinkanna geedummatika maala indammashsha qullichcha kadeek yookaan kadebaak manji ookkonee maala ita dande'aan. <verse eid="DEU 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 12:16" />Yaane kinni munde butta duni malee'e ha'wittoxxe'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:4">Dada. 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:26-27">Lew. 7:26-27</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:10-14">17:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:6">19:6</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 15:23">Lew. 15:23</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 12:17" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a huccitettexxe midhanaa'n, woyinetika bulbulo, ejersiinxa zayite yookaan horatettechchonaa'n lalo, gedhebo, angafa kadeechcho Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a ifixxe eeyyanni uwwanno hite'e ofo'o saxxettechcho duuchcha futti hitette booncho'n ittoxxe'e. <verse eid="DEU 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 12:18" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageni ati'a filaake boonno'n, labbaxxenna meyyaxxe oose atixxenni, mini giddo ergatenda'neexxe labbaxxenninna meyyaxxe oosenninni iittanni atike qachchuwwi giddo hexxa'neexxe Leewwitoninni welt tennee ita itatton; ookko hujje alfitetlcho elochcho duuchcha'n gammaddatton. <verse eid="DEU 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 12:19" />Boga atike'ni hexxaattoke baro duuchcha'n Leewwito mee waali.<verse eid="DEU 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 12:20" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni uwwanno hiyye addachchisemashanni boga atika ba'lisaa wodda, maali atee halchisaa wodda «Heena fuldatto qico'n iti» hiyye. <verse eid="DEU 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 12:21" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti fi'leek boonchi ikki ati birii'n bayyato'oole halchisaa wodda duuchcha Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ati'a uwweeke hori giddi'n lalo yookaan gedhebi giddii'n eetetteka fi'lite ani kulenneshshanni dula dandeetatton; maalakanna minenni ittatton. <verse eid="DEU 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 12:22" />Fedheek manji batto'eeka yookaan batto'ebaaka gadansakenna kaddo'o geedummati maala itammashshanni ookkon maala ita dande'aan. <verse eid="DEU 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 12:23" />Yaane kinni munde giddo hedho hexxemmaxxe'e munde ha'witoxxe'e; mundendinni hedheeke horika maalanna ittoxxe, heqqedhi. <verse eid="DEU 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 12:24" />Munde wede'insha butta dhangalaas male'e ittoxxe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:10-14">Lew. 17:10-14</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 12:25" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo eeyendaashsha ati'anna ati uduma dagga'neexxe atixxe oose'a eloxxi kaddaashsha munde ha'witoxxe'e. <verse eid="DEU 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 12:26" />Yaane kinn woyyitte atixxa uwwanna geego atika duuchcha adhdhite Duuchchi Woddik Gootti fileemmake boonchiba'a aaxxe missiyyi. <verse eid="DEU 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 12:27" />Ciincatika tolcha, maalakanna munde duuchha, Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Magenike tolchimalcho'ni shiqishi; wele tolchuwwixxi munde Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Magenike tolchimalchi bira dhangalaassowaal; yaane kinni maala iti. <verse eid="DEU 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 12:28" />Ati'anna ati uduma dagga'neexxe atixxe oose'a eloxxi kaddaashsha ani'a ati'a uwwaa'neeka ajajuwwa xonxommatte heqqedhi; tenneenna assitatto wodda Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Mageni edo eolxenna gammachchiissaaxxe yaane assitette hiyyoten.<verse eid="DEU 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Misechchixxa Fakke Magenooffatatee Uwwemee xixichcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 12:29" />Boga insa'neke'n adhe assitatto wodda Duuchchi woddike Gootti arda ookkone asse biraan; atina boga insa'neeka dhaaldee ofoldatton. <verse eid="DEU 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 12:30" />Yoona ardi kutti hiyyeechchi uduma insa'nee hunjaammaxxa huje, hujati fonxoro giddo e'yitoxxe'e; «Aninna insa'neeshshanni assannon» hita'n konnee gosa gosak ardi dharichcha insa'neeka magenuwwa hitta magenooffanta'nemma hite laqqoxxe'e. <verse eid="DEU 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 12:31" />Ati Duuchchi woddika Gootta atike Mageni'a magenoofatatek kunni ardi dharichcha ifike magenuwi'a magenooffantammashsha kadiyyo hasissabaan; insa'ne dharichcha magenuwwa magenooffantaa wodda hunja'neexxi huje duuchchi hara elobaaxxenna Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo busha yaanen; insa'ne wele waalin finna ina'neeggaa ifike tolchiinke booncho'n magenuwwa insa'neekee giirate'n ciinceessinaan.<verse eid="DEU 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 12:32" />Ta'a yoona ani ate'n kulennexxa duuchcha assi; iso'n hana mittechchonna lebboxxe'e; mittetanna xe'ishshoxxe'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 4:2">Lew. 4:2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:18-19">Wal. 22:18-19</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 12:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="DEU 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 13:1" />Oddo giddii'n wabeek yookaan oojjo oojjotaak ke'eexxi, beessisa yookaan mambe'a assitaaxa yaane assannon atee hiyyoole. <verse eid="DEU 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 13:2" />Haaso'eeki beessisi yookaan mambe'a yaanuwwa duuchcha muuxendeele ati egendeboxxoxxa wele misechchixxa fakkuwwa magenooffanto hiyyoole, <verse eid="DEU 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 13:3" />Duuchchi woddika Gootta ha'nooka Mageno godobi mittin eeti'na'nexxa koko'a hase'e; mise iso'o erga gopheebaan ookkone wabeekixxa yookaan oojjanijiinxa laqqinoqqe. <verse eid="DEU 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 13:4" />Duuchhci woddika Gootta ha'nooka Mageno hordoffe; isoo ulfeesse: ajajuwwa isikanna heqqedhdhe; hiyyichcho isika laqqe; isoo magenooffatte; isini welti mitte godoba kadde. <verse eid="DEU 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 13:5" />Garbumma hexxinemmake Gibtse boganaa'n qullo fulcheeke Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'n jallitinaashsha assa'neeka oojjanjo yookaan ani wabeekaken hiyya'neeka duuchcha shiltine birre; iitta hedheeki manji Duuchchi woddike Gootta ha'nooke Mageno'ni hidda oltitinabaashshanna isi ajajeemmake orinaa'ni gargar higgino'a haseeten; tennexxee ha'no tenne elobaaxa yaane oddo ha'nooxi giddii'n fugusse.<verse eid="DEU 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 13:6" />Amati darre'n dayyi atik yookaan belti atikinna belto atixxi, eetattoxxi atixxi are yookaan lubbottishsha eetaattek jaali atik sho'ik «Marrennexxi wele magenuwwa magenooffanto» hiyyoole, atinna kadi edik ha'nook ege'nebaaka magenuwwa, <verse eid="DEU 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 13:7" />Bogiinke kassinaa'n ke'ise boginke kasiqico'n, shiqote kaddo'o bayya qarqara atike'n hedheeke gosa gosake ardike magenuwwi ate'e dedhiso'a wo'laanoole, <verse eid="DEU 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 13:8" />Kaddo malee iitta hedheeke manjika gorsa ijje adhitoxxe'e; haaso'a isika midde laqqoxxe; iitta hedheeke manji'a arjuntetinna shaqqunteti isi'a o'witoxxe waaldoxxe'e. <verse eid="DEU 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 13:9" />Iso'n wele manjjixi anga ibbebaa edi darre godoba gurtebexxong atinni shiy; okkoneechchi uduma weli gateeki mannina kinjik cancaqqe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kinjik cancaqe hiyyaaka hiyyichcho Ibrito shiyyi hitaan</char></note> shiyowaal. <verse eid="DEU 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 13:10" />Garbumma hexxetteke Gibtseke boganaa'n fulcheeke Duuchchi woddike Gootta atike Magenonaa'ni ate'e gargaritti hisso'a hasemmaxxe'e lubbo fuldaa qico'n iso'o kinjiki cancaqi. <verse eid="DEU 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 13:11" />Konnechchi uduma Isira'eeliki ard duuchchi kaddeexxa yaane duuchcha laqeexxi sodaatan: tennexxee langaxxa iitti elobaaxxi yaane kexxabaan.<verse eid="DEU 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 13:12" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atiki Mageni hexxotta'a uwwa'neeke qachchuwwinaa'n mitti giddo atee <verse eid="DEU 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 13:13" />fuggo manni ha'no giddii'n ke'eexxi ati egendeboxxoka «Wele magenuwwa marre magenooffanto» hine'e qachcha insa'neekika arda dedhinsa'noole, <verse eid="DEU 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 13:14" />Tennee laqqatto wodda tinni yaane hitta kaddeexxa hundii'n ke'issite'e dhukkussiisse laqi; iita hexxeexxi elobaaxi yaane oddo ha'nooxe'n kada isexxi dhugoottoole <verse eid="DEU 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 13:15" />Ookone qachchi giddo hedha'neeka manna hore insa'nengenninni mitteba shilte bir; booso ookkonee qachchixxa balleesi. <verse eid="DEU 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 13:16" />Konne qachchi giddo hedheeke mannixxi karra duuchcha bukki assitettexxi qachchiinxe oddo'n uggi; ookkonechchi uduma qachchi konne giddo hexxemmaxxa karra duuchhca Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Mageni'a tolchake assitettexxi giirate'n ciinceessi; tolcimalchokanna langaxxa hunjabaashsha olete kadde gatuun. <verse eid="DEU 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 13:17" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti isixe elobaaxe mufenaa'ni higeexi mararitteti sa'aashsha Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'aa foyyendeexxe karranaa'n mitteechonna ifi'a gatirsexxoxxe; konnee ajaja heqqexxottole edike annuwa atikee aagemmaxxe kakoshshanni ate'e eeyyeexxi laakoossa atika bira sa'issaan. <verse eid="DEU 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 13:18" />Telcho ani ate'ni uwwaanneka ajajuwwa heqqexxottolenna Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti atik Mageni atenaa'n hasa'neexa eloxa yaane hujjaattole tennee haaso'eexa duuchhca ati'a muuxa muuxaan.<verse eid="DEU 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="DEU 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yaaddoti Wodda Hoyyendeexa Oodhishatixxa Aada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 14:1" />Ha'no Duuchchi woddike Gootta ha'nooke Magenixxe oosen: tennexxee reyeeke manji'a ooxina wodda alba ha'nooka hoqexxinoqqe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:28">Lew. 19:28</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 21:5">21:5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 14:2" />Ati Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Mageni'a gargar foyendeetteke ardan buttate'n hedheeke wele ardi giddii'n isi'a gargar hexxeetteke arda kaddatoshsha fi'le'en.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:20">Fula. 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 7:6">7:6</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 19:5-6">19:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 26:18">26:18</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tit. 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1 Phex. 2:9</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batto'eekanna Batto'ebaaka Horeenna Biniincha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 11:1-47">Lew. 11:1-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 14:3" />Fedheechonna kaddoole batto'echcho ittoxxe. <verse eid="DEU 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 14:4" />Tennexxee ha'no ittinaachchir; lalo, gedhebo, re'e, <verse eid="DEU 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 14:5" />Gadansa, Geedumma, Xaaxa, werseessa, waala, Buddanne, Bihoone hinaaka biniichcha ittinaani. <verse eid="DEU 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 14:6" />Manne lameba hacaqqi hiyyeekanna alalfataaka gadhikanna minika biniichcha ittatton. <verse eid="DEU 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 14:7" />Yaane kinni alalfataakanna yookaan manne lameba hacaqqi hiyyeekaara ittinnabaan; kunninna Gaalaa, hilleensaanna osole ittinabaan; kunni biniinchii alalfatoolena midde manne isixxi lameba hacaqi hiyya gonpheemmaxxee ha'no'a batto'eechchuwwan. <verse eid="DEU 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 14:8" />Booyyetanna ittoxxe; insa'ne manne lameba hacaqqi hitoolena alalfata gonphaammaxxe'e batto'eechchishshaten: konnechuwwa ita waalin rensha midde abiddinoqqen.<verse eid="DEU 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 14:9" />Woddi'i giddo hexxaaxxe daduuwwa gosanaa'n keela kanna qonnonno affeexxa duuchcha ita dandeettinaan: <verse eid="DEU 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 14:10" />Yaane kinni wedi'i giddo keelakanna qonnonno affeebaaxxa wele daduwwa ittinoqqe: iitta hedheeki biniinchuwwi ha'no'a batto'eeken.<verse eid="DEU 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 14:11" />Ci'uwwa giddii'n battoottebaaxa ita dandeettinaan. <verse eid="DEU 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 14:12" />Indabaaxi; Sinbira, Risa, Naachcha, <verse eid="DEU 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 14:13" />Jole, Jajjonna ittanni wele gosa gosashshan; <verse eid="DEU 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 14:14" />Fakkeennake'e Qoodhande; <verse eid="DEU 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 14:15" />Qonga, Baaldudda, Diillise, Baaldo gosa gosashshanni <verse eid="DEU 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 14:16" />Guuggenjo, Rumichcha, Daakiyyeti korma, <verse eid="DEU 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 14:17" />Urungo, Allaatte, Rumachcha <verse eid="DEU 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 14:18" />Bejjo'o, Bu'lo, gutiguutale, Cirrichcho, golallamma abayyati qarqara hexxaaxxe gosa gosaxxa ci'uwwa duuchcha indaaxebaan.<verse eid="DEU 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 14:19" />Keela affe'exi shiixxara lubbo afeechchi duuchchi batto'eechchon: kunniichchi duuchchi indaachchobaan: <verse eid="DEU 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 14:20" />Yaane kinni insa'nee giddi'in battoottebaaxa ittinaan.<verse eid="DEU 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 14:21" />Ati Duuchchi woddike Gootta atike Mageni'a gargaritti hexxetteke manjo kaddeettaxxee wele atike boga'n keesumumma dageeki manni itaashsha uwwi yookaan gurgudhdha malee reyechcho itinoqqe, re'etixxe beltanjoka maala amatixxe adonni gaffoxxee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:19">Fula. 23:19</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:26">34:26</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tommekenaa'n Mitte Anga Fulchatixxa Aada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 14:22" />Wogga woggande'n huccite alfiitaattexxe karra duuchchanaa'n mitte anga qofinni foote uggi: <verse eid="DEU 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 14:23" />Fedheexxenninna Duuchchi Woddika Gootta atika Mageno sodaantaa qico barattotta'a summi isik ye'emaashsha fi'linee boonno'n huccitettexxe midhanaa'n, woyineti bulbulo, zayitetixxa uwwa, ittan horattetteke lalonaa'n gedhebonaa'n angafa Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Mageni edo ittatton: <verse eid="DEU 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 14:24" />Yaane kinn Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageni ate'e eebbisee wodda ifiki summi ye'emaashsha fi'leemmak boonchi ati hexxettebaa'n hara bayyate'neeke kadoole ookko iyyemara atee dandeessisagophphoole, <verse eid="DEU 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 14:25" />Uwwa maallaqiinbaa jijjiirte: maallaqakanna abixxite Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageni magenooffatemo'a fi'leemmake boonchiba mari. <verse eid="DEU 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 14:26" />Okkone maallaqinni hassetechcho lalo, gedhebo, woyineti bulbulo, jabaka ha'wo, yookaan futti hitettexxa yaanuwwa hirte Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Mageni edo atinna atik mini hadi ittine gammade. <verse eid="DEU 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 14:27" />Isi ifika yookaan geego afa gopheemmaxxe'e atike qachchi giddo hedha'neeka Leewwichcho deetoxxe'e. <verse eid="DEU 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 14:28" />Sakkaxxe sakaxxe woggake muuxama'n fichcha ha'nooki giddo huccitenemmachcho duuchchana'n tommekena'n mitte aaxxina'n qachcha ha'nooke'n bukki assitine'e tuulle. <verse eid="DEU 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 14:29" />Ha'nooke qachchi giddo hedha'neera ha'noninn welti qooxxabashsha qadaada afebaaka Leewwitotika manna, gadhii'n dageeka wele bogika manna, anna ama affebaaxxa oosenna aro'o shi'witeexxi melaalle duuchchiingi dage itowaal: Tennee duuchcha assitinoole Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'nook Mageni huccitineechcho duuchcha eebisaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:30-33">Lew. 27:30-33</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 18:21">Lak. 18:21</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="DEU 15" />
  <para style="s1">Liqi Waalemaaxxa Wogga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 25:1-7">Lew. 25:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 15:1" />Torbaxe woggake muuxama'n maallaqa liqeessitetteke manni duuchchi'a duuchchin wodda liqesse'neemmaka maallaqa insa'ne'aanni waali. <verse eid="DEU 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 15:2" />Tinnina Isira'eelichcho dayyo ifikee maallaqa liqeesseki duuchchi liqeessedheemmaka maallaqa waalowwaal: tinni wogga Duuchchi woddiki Gootti manna duuchchanaa'n liqa waale sa'a'neexxe wogga kaddeemmaxxe Isira'eelixxe gosanaa'n maallaqa liqeesseeka hiisse adhdhoqqe. <verse eid="DEU 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 15:3" />Atike boga'n keessummumma dage ofo'leeke manji'a liqeessitetteka maallaqa hiissaashsha laqa dandeettatton: Isira'eelixe gosa'a liqeessitetteka maallaqa kinni hiisaashsha laqqoxxe.<verse eid="DEU 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 15:4" />Kaddomale'e Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti atiki Mageni dhaaldota'a ati'a qadaada atike asse uwwa'neeke bog giddo birasa'isse ate'e eebisaammaxxe oddo atixxe'n hiyyeessi afemabaan. Ani techcho kulaanneka ajajuwwa duuchcha laqqe Duuchchi woddike Gootta atike Mageni'a ajajendottole; Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ate'e horte quba saxxattoshsha assaan. <verse eid="DEU 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 15:5" />Tinni kaddaachchi Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Mageni'a hara ajajendottolenna techcho ati'a uwwaanneka konnee ajajuwwa duuchcha xexxe'achchoti hordoffatto wodda callan. <verse eid="DEU 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 15:6" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atike Mageni hiyyemmashshanni eebbisaammaxxe, ati heddo gosa gosake manni'a liqeesitatton; heddo gosa gosa manna galchitato malee ayyi hundanna galdabexxon.<verse eid="DEU 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 15:7" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atiki Mageni ati'a uwwa'nee boga'n hedheeke qachcha duuchcha'n hiyyeessi mitti hedhool dayyo atike kademmaxxe ookkone manjo'n godoba jabeeffattoxxe; maallaqakanna hoyyexxoxxe. <verse eid="DEU 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 15:8" />Tenne mannii'n anga affetteechcho duuchcha mitte mami belo isi'a liqeessi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:35">Lew. 25:35</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 15:9" />Laqi gataaxxi torbaxxi wogga gelteen hita'na rakkichcha atike dayyi'a liqa hoyyexxoxxe; iitta hedheeka elobaaka yaado qalbete'n uggudhitoxxe'e; liqa hoyyexxottole rakkichchi dayyi atik Duuchchi Woddike Goottiba'a raaraan: ookkone wodda ate'n cubbote kaddaan. <verse eid="DEU 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 15:10" />Tenne mannii'ni qoxxinni beloo ifixxe uwwashsha mitte godobinini uwwi: tennenaa'n kexxeexxa Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageni hujjaattexxe hujenninna kaddo wele yaane duuchchan ate'e eebbisaan. <verse eid="DEU 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 15:11" />Buttate'n fedheexenni rakkichchinna hiyyeessi gophemabaan; tennexee ookko'o hexxeexxa rakkiyyenna hiyyeeyye dayyuwwa atika gargaartattoshsha ajajaanne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:11">Mat. 26:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:7">Mar. 14:7</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:8">Yoh. 12:8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Garboole Garbummatenaa'n Fulcha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 21:1-11">Fula. 21:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 15:12" />Isira'eelixxe gosa giddii'n labbakenna kado meyyaki mitte manji garba assedhe ate'n ifi gurgudhdhoole; jaane wogga ergatemeechchi uduma torbaxxe wogga'n garbummatenaa'n fulaashsha assitatton: <verse eid="DEU 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 15:13" />Garbummatenaa'n iso'o fulchitatto wodda anga duwwixinn geegeessitoxxe: <verse eid="DEU 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 15:14" />Duuchchi woddiki Gooti ati'k Mageni uwweexe karranaa'n gedhebi giddii'n, midhatenaa'ninna woyineti bulbulonaa'n uwwa eeyyanteti isi'a uwwi. <verse eid="DEU 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 15:15" />Konneechi edo atinna Gibtseke boga'n garba kaddeettaaxxanna Duuchchi woddiki Gootti qullo fulcheexxa deetoxxe: aninna techcho konnee ajaja ate'n kulaanneki tenne daafenaa'n kexxeexinniten.<verse eid="DEU 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 15:16" />Dedha atiba hedheki garbichchi «atinni afo'i weli aagemmaxxe'e ateenna mini hado atika eeyye me'abe'non» hiyyoole, <verse eid="DEU 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 15:17" />atike minike mikkilisanjo'n mutik mansha isixxa uri; ookkonechchi uduma rewoti qici'n atike garba kade hedhaan: meyyaxxenna kaddoole iittanni assi. <verse eid="DEU 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 15:18" />Isoonna mine atikenaa'n nage'iki fulchitatto wodda mitti garbichchi jaane wogga'a uwwa'neexxe la'o iima ati'a assemmaxxee ittanna yaaddoxxe. Yoona ati eloxxa isi'a assitoottole Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni jiro atixxa duuchcha eebbisaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:39-46">Lew. 25:39-46</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 15:19" />Horattetteke; lalo, gedhebo, konne horattetteke heddo hori giddi'n edise ilemeeka labaka duuchcha Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Mageni'a gargar foyeme hedhaasha assite waali; edisse ilendeexxa sangooluwwati huccitoxxe; iittan gedhebuwwi giddii'ni edise ilemeerika orda cirtoxxe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:12">Fula. 13:12</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 15:20" />Isi fi'leeke boonno'n atinna mini hadi atik wogga wogga'ninni Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Mageni edo konneechchuwwa ittaton. <verse eid="DEU 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 15:21" />Yaane kinn laloke'n, gedheboke'n komachchiissaachchi mitte afoole fakkeennake'e lekka naafoole, ille ba'oole, yookaan wele rakkonna afeeke kadoole, konneechchuwwa Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Mageni'a tolchake assite shiqishshoxxe. <verse eid="DEU 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 15:22" />Iitta hedheeka hore lalo gedhebo mine ha'nooge'n itte; battumma fuldineeke yookaan fuldinebaake kaddinoolenna Gadansakanna Geedunjo ittinammashshanni duuchching konneechuwanna ittinaan. <verse eid="DEU 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 15:23" />Mundetanna butta dhangalaase malee'e ittinoqqe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:4">Dada. 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:26-27">Lew. 7:26-27</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:10-14">17:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:26">19:26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:16">Lan. 12:16</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 12:23">23</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 15:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="DEU 16" />
  <para style="s1">Sa'atika Ayyaana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 12:1-20">Fula. 12:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 16:1" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti Abiibite hiyyemaa agenjo'ni Gibtseke boganaa'n hashsha ate'e fulcheemmaxxe Abiibite hiyyemaaka agenjo heqqexxe Duuchchi woddika Gootta atika Mageno ulfeessi. <verse eid="DEU 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 16:2" />Duuchchi woddike Gootta atike Mageniki summi ye'emaashsha fi'leeke booncho'n isi'a horattetteke lalo, gedhebonna re'e, giddii'n mitte mitte filde tolch. <verse eid="DEU 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 16:3" />Isoonna gamami e'yyeexe kebbonni ittoxe; Gibtsee'ni wiinamik fuldettaxxee Gibtsee'ni fuldettexxa yanna hedhotike baro duuchcha'n deetebexxongi tennee ita rakkoti woddixxe kebboon hita'n iti. <verse eid="DEU 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 16:4" />Boga atike duuchcha'n ati birra torbaane bara'a gamami afemoqeq'e; siretixxe barraxe hashsha'n tolchitattok huuni maalinna gorsiqico'n turaashsha assitoxxe'e.<verse eid="DEU 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 16:5" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni ati'a uwwa'neeke hoone qachcha'ninna kadi sa'atike ayyaani'a tolcha shiqishsha hassissabaan. <verse eid="DEU 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 16:6" />Yaane kinni summa ifikee galdumake kadaashsha Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni fi'laneeke boncho'n arishsho e'yitaa wodda hashshunte Gibtsee'ni fuldettaxxee yanna'n woggatixxe qaabbachcho'a ookko sa'atike ayyaanika tolcha tolchi. <verse eid="DEU 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 16:7" />Maalakanna gaffettexxi Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni fi'leeke booncho'n iti: bogi sooda wodda atike duunkaanibaa hig. <verse eid="DEU 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 16:8" />Jaane barra gamami e'yebaaka xalta it; torbaxxe barra'n Duuchchi woddika Gootta atike Magenixxa woyyitte bukki assi; eettenee barra hujetanna hujjoxxe.<verse eid="DEU 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Torbaane Torbaka Ayaana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:22">Fula. 34:22</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Lew. 23:15-21</ref>)<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:5-8">Lew. 23:5-8</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 28:16-25">Lak. 28:16-25</ref>. </char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 16:9" />Midha haama safendeexxe barranaa'n ke'issite torbaane torba laakko'i. <verse eid="DEU 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 16:10" />Okkonechchi uduma Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni atee eebisemmashshanni fedhe atixxe'n uutattoxxa uwwa shiqishati Duuchchi woddike Gootta atike Mageni'a Suba'etika ayyaana ulfeessi. <verse eid="DEU 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 16:11" />Atixxe atixxi labbaaxinna meyyaxxi oose, atia'a ergatemammaki labbakinna meyaki atik erganjuwwi, atike qacha'n hexxa'neexxi Leewwitonna wele bogiki manni annakanna ama affebaaxxi hiyyeeyye oossenna aro'o shi'witeexxi hiyyeeyye melaalle Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageni summa ifike galduma kadaashsha fi'leeke booncho'n, Duuchchi woddike Gootta atike Mageni edo gammadi. <verse eid="DEU 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 16:12" />Atinna Gibtseke boga'n garba kaddeettaxxa deetoxxe; konnee seeranna xexxe'achchoti heqqedhi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:26-31">Lak. 28:26-31</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="DEU 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Seemmati Giissenneka Fooqiinka Ayyaana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:33-43">Lew. 23:33-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 16:13" />«Maye isexxe'n midha bukki assitottolenna woyinetixxa gumma miiccettechchi uduma torbaane barraqico'n fooqiinka ayyaana ulfeessitatton: <verse eid="DEU 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 16:14" />Isoonna labbaxenna meyyaxxe oose atixxenni, mine atiba hujja'ni ergatenda'neexxe labbaxxenna meyyaxxe oosenninni, qachchi giddo hexxa'neexxe Leewwitoninna wele boganaa'n keessummumma dage'e ofo'leekenni iittanni annakanna ama afebaake hiyyeessinninna aro'i reyexe melaallenni welti mitteba gammadde. <verse eid="DEU 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 16:15" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni fi'lee booncho'n torbaane barra ulfeesi: Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni midhatinna huccitettechchi duuchchinni eebbisaammaxxe'e gammadinginni ulfeessitatton.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 29:12-38">Lak. 29:12-38</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 16:16" />«Woggate'n sasele labablli duuchchi kebbotike ayyaana'ni midha bukki assecatike ayyaana'ninna fooqinke ayyana'ni Duuchchi woddiki Gootti fi'laake booncho'ni atike Duuchchi Woddike Gotti Mageni edo shinqowwaal; huuni manjinna Mageni edo anga duwwixenni shiqoqqe'e. <verse eid="DEU 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 16:17" />Mitti mittiniig manji horateexxe karrana'n Duuchchi woddike Gootti'a hunna isixxishshann idagowaal.<verse eid="DEU 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dhugaatixxa Murte Uwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 16:18" />«Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni gosa gosa atixxike mini mini'a uwwa'nee boga'n hedheeke mitti mttinige qachcha'n murratanna akeekisanuwa fili; inisa'nenna ardake'n dhugaatixxa murte uunowaal. <verse eid="DEU 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 16:19" />Murte uutatto wodda dassitoxxe; gamisoxxe; matti beek mannixxa ille affebaashsha assammaxxeenna qulliyye daba murtaashhsa assammaxxa matta adhdhitoxxe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:6-8">Fula. 23:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:15">Lew. 19:15</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 16:20" />Hedhoti hexxotta'anna Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageni ati'a uwwaaka boga dhaldota'a qajeelakenna toggichchake kadi.<verse eid="DEU 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 16:21" />«Duuchchi woddike Gootta atike Mageni'a tolchiimmalcho giissitattoba magenooffantaaka Atseedi hinaaka haqichcho calla kaassoxxe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:13">Fula. 34:13</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 16:22" />Higgeenni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageni giba'neeke kinjiinka tolchinka utupha dhaaboxxe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:1">Lew. 26:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="DEU 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 17:1" />«Horattetteke heddo lalo, gedhebi, giddii'n Duuchchi woddike Gootta atke Mageni'a tolcha shiqishshato wodda mitte tafa afeeka hore shiqishshoxxe: iitta hexxeexi bushshaxi yaane duuchchi woddike Gootti edo diqatendeexxen.<verse eid="DEU 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 17:2" />«Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atiki Mageni ati'a uwwa'nee qachchi giddi'n mitteke'n hedha'neek labbaki yookaan meyyaxi Duuchchi woddike Gooti edo elobaaxxa yaane hujje seera xe'ishshaaxxera hexxeen: <verse eid="DEU 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 17:3" />Ittan anka seera sa'iyyot wele magenuwwa magenooffateek, konnechchuwwira'anna hiyyo, arishsho, yookaan baate, yookaan urjuwwa'a sagadeek<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:20">Fula. 22:20</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 17:4" />Iitta hexxeexxa odo laqqatto wodda hudhudhdhu assite uudi: yaane kinn iitta hexxeexxa elobaaxxa yaane Isira'eelik ardi hujo'ole; <verse eid="DEU 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 17:5" />Iitta hexxeexxa yaane huje'eka ookkonee manjichcho labbakenna kado mmeyyaki qachchi giddii'n aaxe fulchite kinjik cancaqqe shiyi. <verse eid="DEU 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 17:6" />Rewo murendeeke'e lami yookaan sasi manji dhuga fulche kuloole shiyemowwaal: yaane kinn mitti manji calli dhugaa fulche kuloole ikki manjichchi shiyemoqqe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:30">Lak. 35:30</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:15">Lew. 19:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:16">Mat. 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 13:1">2 Qor. 13:1</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:19">1 Xim. 5:19</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:28">Ibr. 10:28</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 17:7" />Manjichchi shiyemaa wodda sirete'n dhugaa fulche kuleek manni kino hana ibisowaal: itti aane weli ardinna kinot cancaqowwaal: tenne'e assati iitta hexxeexxa elobaaxa yaane oddo atixenaa'n fugussi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:13">1 Qor. 5:13</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 17:8" />«Manjiinxa munde lolaasati, buttii'n ke'ne manjo gegge'ati, manjo shiyati; tenne fakkaattaxxe elobaaxxe yaanenni qachchi giddo hexxeexxe weli gonphe'a murtetixxi uwwa atee'e rakkissa'noole Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni fi'leeke boonchiba'a marte; <verse eid="DEU 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 17:9" />Leewwixxe gosanaa'n qeesete kadeexenna ookkone wodda hayyo kadeeke'e yaane tennee kuli: yaanetanna isinni ati'aa murowaal. <verse eid="DEU 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 17:10" />Atinna Duuchchi woddiki Gootti fila'nee booncho'n hexxe'e uuna'nexxa murte deetoxxe: insa'neeka haaso'anna godobik xonxoommatte heqqedhi: <verse eid="DEU 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 17:11" />Uuna'neexxe akeette'ninna seerinni duuchchiinxa huji: middi'aanna bita'i'a higga'n mishikki hitoxxe. <verse eid="DEU 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 17:12" />Hayyichcha yookaan Duuchchi woddike Gootta atike Mageni'a ergatema'eenke Qeesichchi'a ajajema gibe'e iso'ni hincinno'e haaso'a'neeki manji hedhoole iso shinnowwaal. Konne qicinni elobaaxa yaane duuchcha Isira'eelike ard giddii'ni gondoortatton. <verse eid="DEU 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 17:13" />Ookkonechchi uduma manji duuchchi tenne laqe sodaatan: iitta hexxeexxa elobaaxxa yaane muuxatee'e hujaaki hedhabaan.<verse eid="DEU 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moyanjiinxee Uwwemeeka Seera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 17:14" />«Duuchchi woddki Gootti atik Mageni ati'a uwwa'neke bogibaa marte boga dhaalde bootessexxechchi uduma qarqara anike'n hedheeke ardishsha moyanjo fi'lo hitettele.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:5">1 Sam. 8:5</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 17:15" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageni ati'aa fileeka mayanjo fi'la dandeettatton: fi'litaatek moyanjinna atixxe sanne giddii'n kaduun, gosa atixxi gadho kadeeka gadhika manjo moossisa hasissabaan. <verse eid="DEU 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 17:16" />Iikki moyanji ifike sannachuwwi'a heddo fadhado afee'eke kadiyo hasissabaan: Magen ardi Gibtse'aa higabaashsha fadhado hiro'a ajajoqqe'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:28">1 Moy. 10:28</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 1:16">2 Odo. 1:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:28">9:28</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 17:17" />Moyanji heddo melaalle aadhoole Duuchchi Woddika Gootta hordofabaashsha kuttammaxxe'e melaale fakkanshoqqe: heddo worqenna sibiljo birre sa'isse ca'moqe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:14-22">1 Moy. 10:14-22</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 10:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 11:1-8">11:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 1:15">2 Odo. 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:27">9:27</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 17:18" />Motumate'n offo'laa wodda konne seerixxa Leewwitotixxi qeesoole ikkille mirqisanjo maxxafa'n ifi'a borreessowwaal. <verse eid="DEU 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 17:19" />Konnee maxaafa ifi bira abixxeexxi lubboti hedheeke bari qico'ni haaseessowaal: iitta assoole Duuchchi Woddika Gootta isika Mageno ulfeessinaa qicona maxaafi konne giddo borreessemeedheeka seeruwwakanna galdumuwwa xonxoommatatinna addatenshat muunxa'neechcho kadeexxa ege'naan. <verse eid="DEU 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 17:20" />Isi horte ifixinni Isira'eelika gosa gosaka arda qeerra baro moona'n he'naashsha, Duuchchi Woddike Goottike seeranaa'n iittanna elqenna kayya higoqqe wele dayyuwwa irra ifi lumoke assedhe uudoqqe.<verse eid="DEU 17:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="DEU 18" />
  <para style="s1">Qeesoletikanna Leewwitotika Qoobbo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 18:1" />«Leewwito qeesole; wele dhiisin madad Leewixxe gosa gosaki mini hadi Isira'eelixxe gosa gosake mini hadinni welti ifike hinaaka qadaada anfebaan: isixxe bakka'n Duuchchi woddike Gootti'a shiqaaka tolchanna uwwa inda'n he'naan. <verse eid="DEU 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 18:2" />Dayyuwa insa'nekee Isira'eelixxe oddo'ni qadaada anfeebaan: haaso'emmashshann Duuchchi woddiki Gootti fichcha insa'neeken.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:20">Lak. 18:20</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 18:3" />«Jibichcha yookaan Gedhebiinka buruussa tolchaa wodda qeesole Haye, Boqotanna, Gadhaachcha adhdhitowwaal. <verse eid="DEU 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 18:4" />Huccitettexxe midhanaa'ni, woyineti bulbulonaa'n, ejersiinxe zayitenaa'n, sirete'ni cirtetteettaxxa gedhebiinxa orda midde mittiichi gatebaangi umiinxe uwwa assite'e uwwi. <verse eid="DEU 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 18:5" />Insa'nexxe oddo'ni duuchchi woddi'a qeesete kande ergatemmaashsha Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Mageni Leewwixxa gosa fi'le'een.<verse eid="DEU 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 18:6" />«Mitti Leewwichchi hedha'neeke fedheeke Isira'eelike qachchi giddo Duuchchi woddiki Gootti fila'neeke boonchibaa dagatee halcha lumoxxa afoole; <verse eid="DEU 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 18:7" />Ookko'o ergatendammaxxee Leewwito dayyuwwishshanni Duuchchi woddike Gootta ifike Mageni edo hedhe ergatemowwaal. <verse eid="DEU 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 18:8" />Mini hadika karra gurgure maallaqa adha'noolena midde isinna ifixi oosuwwa wele qeesolle adhdhita'neexxe qixxe'n adhdhaan.<verse eid="DEU 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ardiinke Elobaaxxe Yaanuwwanaa'n Heqqee'naasha Uwwemeeka Xixichcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 18:9" />«Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atiki Mageni uwwa'neeke bogibaa martatto wodda; ookko hedha'neki ard huja'neexa elobaaxa yaane duuchcha hordoffoxxe. <verse eid="DEU 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 18:10" />Atixxe oddonaa'ni ayyinna labba belto; yookaan meyyaxxa giirate'n tolchoqqe: yookaan dhariinka beessisa kulaaki, hayyaataaki, gojotik manji hedhoqqe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:26">Lew. 19:26</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 22:18">Fula. 22:18</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 18:11" />Yookaan diginte daggamaak, fuggichcha hafuura ye'edhaak, moraakinna ekedha haaseessaak atixxe oddo'n afemoqqe'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:31">Lew. 19:31</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 18:12" />Konneechchuwwa hordofaak duuchchi Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Mageni edo jibbendeexxenna elobaaxe yaanen: ati edi'a me'itettexxe qixxe'n Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti atik Mageni arda ati edii'n fiissa'neek iitta hexxeexxa elobaaxxa battitte yaane hunjammaxeeten. <verse eid="DEU 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 18:13" />Ati kinni Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a addatendeetteke manjo kadiyo hasissaan» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:48">Mat. 5:48</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muuseshsha Hedheeka Wele Wabeeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 18:14" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Muussenna kunni boga insa'neeka nageessite dhaalchissaatteki ard morsisatanna xanote eenan: ati kinni Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni tennee'e assitotaa eeyabaan. <verse eid="DEU 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 18:15" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ha'nooki Mageni gosa ha'nooxi giddii'n iitta anishsha hedheeka wabeeka filowwaal: Isi hiyyaaxa duuchcha laqqine ajajemme.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:22">Erga. Huj. 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:37">7:37</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 18:16" />«Siinaxxe kooba iima bukki hitineemma wodda reyaannen hite sodaatati Duuchchi woddiki Gooti atiki Mageni langaxxa ate'n haaso'abaashshanna manbe'iinke beessisinni leelleexxa sodaachissa'neexxe giira ifi ege'nishshaa'naa uuddabexxoshsha hitee laqqeettan» hiyye. <verse eid="DEU 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 18:17" />Tennexxee Duuchchi woddiki Gootti hiyye qic: «Seerinigen qortuman. <verse eid="DEU 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 18:18" />Atishsha hedheeka wele wabeeka dayyuwi insa'neeki giddii'ni filannon: isi haaso'aka hiyyichcho uwwannon: ani ajajennexxa duuchcha ardakee haaso'aan: <verse eid="DEU 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 18:19" />Anike summinni haaso'a'neeke wabeekika hiyyicho laqabaaka duuchcha ani iso'o qorannon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:23">Erga. Huj. 3:23</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 18:20" />Yaane kinni ani ajajebe'noxa feeteenxa yaane anike summin haaso'ate'e wo'laanaaka wabeeka, yookaan wele dharichcha magenuwwike summin haaso'a'neeki wabeek shiyemowaal» hiyye.<verse eid="DEU 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 18:21" />Atinna qalbeti, «Mitti wabeekichchi haaso'a'neek raagi Duuchchi woddike Gootti ga'mii'n uwwendebaaxe kaddeexxa mayiki foye ege'nanno?» Hite dedha laqqatoxxe hexxeen. <verse eid="DEU 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 18:22" />Mitti wabeek Duuchchi woddike Goottike summinni haaso'ee'naa hiyyeexi muuxema gophphoole; iikki wabeek futti hiyyeeshshanni haaso'eexxe malee'e Duuchchi woddike Gootti ga'mii'n uwwedee'naa haaso'eeke hiyyichcho kada gophemmaxxee sodaattoxxe.<verse eid="DEU 18:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="DEU 19" />
  <para style="s1">Gargar Hedheeka Adabeessatika Qachuwwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 35:9-28">Lak. 35:9-28</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 20:1-9">Iya. 20:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 19:1" />Duuchchi woddiki Gooti atiki Mageni uwwa'neeke boga'n hedha'neeka arda kutti asse biree'na qachchuwwakanna miniwwa boojite ookko'o booteeffatte hexxatto wodda; <verse eid="DEU 19:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="DEU 19:2-3" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atiki Mageni hexxattoshsha uwwa'neeka boga saseba qoodde mitti mittingixxe oddo'n mitte mitte qachcha igaari: manjo anga sa'ee manni ookko'a baqate fulaaka ora giissi: ookkonechchi uduma anga sa'eek mitti manji konnee qachchuwi giddii'n mittiinbaa baqatee lubbo gataan: <verse eid="DEU 19:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 19:4" />Mitti manji halo afebaaka dedhiki mitte manjo anga sa'olee konne qachuwwi giddii'n mittiinba mare ifi gatisa dande'aan. <verse eid="DEU 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 19:5" />Fakkeennake'e; lami manni haqqe qurquuratee maree'na mitti haqqe qurquraa'nanni qoce sukke'atenaa'n fulde wele manjo shiltoole; shiyalli konne sase qachchuwi giddii'n mittiinbaa mare ifi gatisowal. <verse eid="DEU 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 19:6" />Hedheeki adabeessatiki qachchi; bayyate kadool kinn; halo fulatee seera afe'eeki reyeeke manjike mini hadinni welti abinde balleessa afebaanga manjichcho dedha mufeti shiyaaxxe hexxeen: ikki manjichchi halo afebaanga toliinka manjichcho shiyeek dedhikitemman. <verse eid="DEU 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 19:7" />Sase qachchuwwa gargari footottaa'a ajaja'neeki tenne buutonnitene.<verse eid="DEU 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 19:8" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atiki Mageni edike atike anuuwwi'aa kakoti kokeesseemmaashshanni boga ati'a ba'lisool, <verse eid="DEU 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 19:9" />ani techcho ajajaannek seera duuchcha muuxxe Duuchchi woddika Gootta atika Mageno eetottolenna isi hiyyaake seera'n me'itottole konnee boga ati'aa uwwaammaxxee wele sase adabeessatika qachchuwwa lebbe gargar foy. <verse eid="DEU 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 19:10" />Tenneenna assitattok Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atiki Mageni booteeffatte hexxotta'a qadaada atike asse uwwa'neke boga'n qajeeli manjixi munde ookko cophphabaashshanna atinna tenne daafenni qorendabexxoshshaten.<verse eid="DEU 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 19:11" />Yaane kinn mitti manji naaphunteti shene huyye wele manjo anga sa'eechchi uduma lubbo gatisatee konne qachchuwwi giddii'n mittiinbaa baqatoole; <verse eid="DEU 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 19:12" />Anga sa'eeki manjichchi hedha'neeke qachchiixxi geedhe anga sa'eemmaka manjichcho qachchi giddii'n ergisse aaxxowwaal: insa'nenna halo fullaashsha hadiinxe anga'n sa'issine uunowwaal. <verse eid="DEU 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 19:13" />Isoo'o ijje marartinoqqe: duuchchiinxe yaane'n eloxxi calli ati'a kaddaashsha anga sa'ee manjo Isira'eeli giddii'n fulchi.<verse eid="DEU 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ediwoddixxa Gabala Balleessa Hasissabaaxxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 19:14" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atiki Mageni ifike fichcha asse ofoldottaa'a ati'aa uwweeke qadaada'ninna olla'i atikixxe oddo'n ediwoddixe ila'ni gabalate'n kaasemmeka beessisa dhiibboxxe'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:17">Lew. 27:17</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dhugaa Fulche Kula'neekee Uwwendeexa Akeette</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 19:15" />Mitte manjixxa balleessa afatee'e mitte dhugaa calli geltabaan: mitte manjo balleessanjoke kadeexxa kokatee lame yookaan sase manjo hasisaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:30">Lak. 35:30</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:6">Lew. 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:16">Mat. 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:31">Yoh. 19:31</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 13:1">2 Qor. 13:1</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:19">1 Xim. 5:19</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:28">Ibr. 10:28</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 19:16" />Mitti elobaak manji wele elobaaka manjo balleessanjoke asse ku'loole, lame yookaan sase manni naqaashummati kula hasissaan. <verse eid="DEU 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 19:17" />Lamiing Duuchchi Woddik Gootti magenooffatema'nee booncho'n eettene yanna'n ergatendammaxxe hayyonna qeesole edo shinqowwaal. <verse eid="DEU 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 19:18" />Hayyoole anga sa'emmaka manjichcho jabeessine qorrowwaal: ikki manjichchi Isira'eelxe gosake ifixxe sanne'n dharik ku'loole, <verse eid="DEU 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 19:19" />Ku'lemeeke'e murremmaxxi murte iso'ni higgaan: iita hexxeexa elobaaxa yaane duuchcha konne qicinni ifi iimii'ni sa'issexxatton. <verse eid="DEU 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 19:20" />Manni duuchchi tennee laqa'emmaxxee langaxxa iitta hexxeexxa fuggoxxa yaane ati giddo assaba'a. <verse eid="DEU 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 19:21" />Murtetinna; lubbo balleesseeka, isixxanna balleessa, ille balleesseeka isixxanna balleessa, isso enqeeka isixxanna inqa, anga kuteeka isixxanna kuta, lekka enqeeka isixxanna enqa, iitta hexxeexxa elobaaxa yanne assaaka manna marartoxxe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:23-25">Fula. 21:23-25</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:19-20">Lew. 24:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:38">Mat. 5:38</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="DEU 20" />
  <para style="s1">Duulokee Uwwendeexxa Akeete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 20:1" />Naaphuwwa atika loldota'a duulo me'itatto wodda; fadhadokanna fadhadiinxa kaamolenna; hunna atixxi iima hedheeka manna uudatto wodda Gibtseke boganaa'n fulcheek Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atiki Mageni atinni welti hedheemmaxxee sodaattoxxe: <verse eid="DEU 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 20:2" />Lola ibbinebaa edi gama qeesichchi manniiba shiqqe hiyyaa qic, <verse eid="DEU 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 20:3" />Isinna: «Ha'no Isira'eelike arda! Laqqe! Ta'a yoona duuliinbaa me'itina'neen: naapha ha'nooka konnee'e sodaattinoqqe! Mee hunna ha'nooxi gooffowwal: raafendinoqqe! <verse eid="DEU 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 20:4" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ha'nook Mageni ha'noonni wolti me'ammaxxee midditte alfitinaan» hiyye.<verse eid="DEU 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 20:5" />Ookkonechchi uduma duulok ajajammaki manni duulamma manna'n hiyyaa qic, «Haaro mine ijaadhdhekinna giidhdhebaaki manji ha'nooxe oddo'ni meya hedhee? Hedhoole isi hadi'a higowwaal: isi duulo maraba dedha reyoole mine isika wele manjo giidhdhaan. <verse eid="DEU 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 20:6" />Yookaan woyinetike hiddichchika golqo kaalse umoke'n ra'iseeka bukki assedheb aak manji meya hedhee? Iitta hedheeki manji hedhoole hadi'a higowwaal: dedha duulo mareeba reyole woyinti bulbulo wele manjo la'onfaatan. <verse eid="DEU 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 20:7" />Aadhate'e dubarra kadhateek meya hedhee? Dedha iitta hedheeki manji hedhoole hadi'a higowwaal: dedha isi duulo mareeba reyoole isi kadhatemmaxxi belto wele manjixe are kaddaan» hiyye.<verse eid="DEU 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 20:8" />Ookkonechchi uduma akeekisanjuwwi, «Duulokee ajajaammaki manni higgeenni wele qortuma qora'noolle ha'nooxe oddo'n sodaate godoba gureeki manji meya hedhee? Iitta hedheeki manji dedha hedhoole hadi'a higowwaal: dedha iitta hedheeki manji hedhoole wele kanna daafaan» hiyyowaal. <verse eid="DEU 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 20:9" />Duulokee ajajaammaki manni; haaso'a konnee calla birreechi uduma mitti mittinige gamo'a ajajalluwwa fillowwaal.<verse eid="DEU 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 20:10" />Mitte qachcha balleessatee duuldinaa wodda edinse irbo uunaashsha nage'iinxa bukki fullaashsha lassi: <verse eid="DEU 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 20:11" />Dalla'iinxa ifi ifixxa hula ba'ninoole irbo uunaashsha nage'iinxa bukki fulloolenna ha'urtaaxxa huje ati'aa hunjowwaal. <verse eid="DEU 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 20:12" />Yaane kinn konne qachchiki ard irbo uunabe'non hine atee'e adhete'n ke'oole qachcha duuchcha buqqine abidde. <verse eid="DEU 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 20:13" />Duuchchi woddki Gootti atiki Mageni qachcha duuchcha atixxe anga'n sa'isse uwwaa wodda qachchi giddo hedheeka labballo duuchcha shilte biri. <verse eid="DEU 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 20:14" />Kaddoolena melaalletanna oosuwwa; horekanna qachchi giddo hexxeexxa karra duuchcha ifi'a boojite adhdhitatton: naaphiinxa karra duuchcha ifi'a la'oonfata dandeettatton: Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atiki Mageni kooneechcho duuchcha ati'aa sa'isse uwwaan. <verse eid="DEU 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 20:15" />Yoona ati hexxetteke boganaa'n hara bayyatte hedheeke gosa gosake ardixxe karra atixxe assexxebexxoka qachchuwwa hunnati abixxitatto wodda assitattoxxi konnechchinn butti'a hexxeexxen.<verse eid="DEU 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 20:16" />Duuchchi woddiki Gooti atiki Mageni qadaada atike asse uwwa'neeke boga'n hedheeka qachchuwwa duulde adhdhitatto wodda kinni giddo hedheeka manna shilte biri. <verse eid="DEU 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 20:17" />Tennexxee Keexitotixxe, Amooritotixxe, Kenaanitotixxe, Feeriizitotixxe, Hiititotixxe, Iyyaabussitotixxe gosuwwa duuchcha'ni Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ha'nook Mageni ajajemmashshanni konnee arda booso insa'neexxa balleessite biri. <verse eid="DEU 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 20:18" />Iitta assitina'neekinna yorte insa'neexxe dharichcha insa'neeka magenuwwa magenoofanta wodda busha kaddeexxa yaane duuchcha ha'no'aa barsiisati Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ha'nooki Mageni eeyabaaxa cubbo hujjinaashshaten. <verse eid="DEU 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 20:19" />Mitte qachcha booji'ate'e qopheeffattinnaa wodda lumoxxa yanna dooyyitina'n sa'issitinoole haqqetixxa gumma ha'no ita dandeettinaaxanna haqqetinna manjiinishsha dooyya gonphaammaxxe'e haqqe qurquurtoxxe. Dooyyitattaxxa haqqe woxxe balleessitaatteki manjoke ati'a kado'aatee? <verse eid="DEU 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 20:20" />Wele gummissa'nebaaxa haqqe kinn qachcha boojite anga ibirsexatto qico'ni woxxe tuulda'n dooyate'e eldaashsha la'onfata dandeettatton.<verse eid="DEU 20:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="DEU 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ayyi Shiyyeexxa Ege'nemebaakee Manjixxe Assendaxxa Cubbo birra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 21:1" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni dhaaldota'a ati'aa uwwaake boga'n mitti manji shiyemmeexxi diidage'ni afemeexxe kaddoolenna ayyi shiyeexxa ege'nemagophoole, <verse eid="DEU 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 21:2" />Atixxi geedhuwwanna hayyichchuwwi fulleexxi renshi ibeexxi afemeebaa'ni ke'issineexxi qarqara renshi ibeekee shiqaake qachchuwwi qico'n hedheeka bayyinne minkowwaal. <verse eid="DEU 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 21:3" />Ookkonechchi uduma renshi ibe afemeeke boonchibaa'ni yo'oshsha shiqaake qachchixxi geedhuwwa qotatee geltebaaxxanna qanbar ise'n fe'emebaaxxa goronsa anee'xxi, <verse eid="DEU 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 21:4" />konne edo hujemexxi ege'nemebaake yookaan kaaseme ege'nemebaake yaa'a'neek woddi giddo hedxxexxe dhooqaba'a eettenee raadda idangowaal; eettene dhooqa giddo eettenee raadda gooba miciirrowwaal. <verse eid="DEU 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 21:5" />Ergatemo'anna Duuchchi Woddike Goottike summinni eebinso'a heene'e wel gonphenna wel miidhatixxe yaanuwwa duuchcha'n murte uunaashsha Duuchchi Woddik Gootti qeesole Leewwixxi labbaxxi oose isi edo shiqqowwaal. <verse eid="DEU 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 21:6" />Ookkonechchi uduma iikki renshi afemeeke qarqara'ni hedheeke qachcha'n hexxa'neexxi geedhe duuchcha dhooqa giddo eettenee goobi micciiremeexxe goronsa hana anga anshexxowwaal. <verse eid="DEU 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 21:7" />Inisa'nenna hineexxi haasonnaa qic: «Anga no'oxxenni tennee munde dhangalaansebe'non; tinni assendaa woddanna ille nooxxenni anfebe'non. <verse eid="DEU 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 21:8" />Koo Duuchchi woddike Goottaa, ati woddetteka arda atika Isira'eelixxe hitettexxi tenne dhangalaasendeexxe qullite mundexxee no'o'o balleesanjoke assitoxxe'e.» Dhangalaatteexxe mundexxe'e gattowwaali insa'ne'aa hiyyendaan. <verse eid="DEU 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 21:9" />Atinna Duuchchi woddike Gootti edo eloxxa assittotle eettene qullitte munde dhangalaasatixxe balleessaa laqematenaa'n gataton.<verse eid="DEU 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Booji'endeexxa Manjichcho Aadhaate Uwwemeeka Seera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 21:10" />Naapha atika loldotta'a fuldee'na'a Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageni anga atixxe'n insa'ne'e sa'isse uwwee'naa boojitatto wodda, <verse eid="DEU 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 21:11" />Booji'eemeke manni giddii'ni dancha manjichcho affee'na'a ise atee gammachchiissoole, isee aadha dandeettatton. <verse eid="DEU 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 21:12" />Iseenna mini'a adhdhittetexxi umo isekanna haad; qe'ya isekanna woxxi. <verse eid="DEU 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 21:13" />Isenna booji'endee wodda oddo'iteemmaxxa seemmanna jijjiidhdhitowwaal; mine atike'ni ofldeexxi anna ifikeenna ama ifixxee mitte agenjiqico ooxxowwaal; ookkonechchi uduma aaxxettexxi are ifixxe assexxattoni isenna atixxe are kaddaan. <verse eid="DEU 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 21:14" />Uduma kinni ise'n gammada gophphottole eeteba marte heerundo'a wocci assi; isee'e salphisseettaxxe'e haranga maallaqake'n gurgura yookaan garbiinsha uudiyyo hasissabaan.<verse eid="DEU 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Angafa Belti'aa Uwwemeeka Seera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 21:15" />Mitti manji lame are afeexxe kaddoole, mitte eeye mitte jibboole, lamiinxi are isi'a labbaka belto ildoole, edise ilemeek belti kinni jibbemmaxxe manjichonaa'n i'leeke belto kadoole, <verse eid="DEU 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 21:16" />iikki manjichchi karra ifixxa duuchcha oose ifixxee qooda hasoole angafi beltika angafumamtika qoobbo gamiseexxi eeyyammaxxe areke belti'a uwwiyyo hasissabaan. <verse eid="DEU 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 21:17" />Yaane kinni jibbammaxxe arenaa'n ilemeeke belti'a afeexxe karranaa'n lame anga qoobbo uwwiyyoti angafumma isixxa kokeessowaal; iikki belti isike annixxe hunna umo kadeemmaxxe'e, angafummatik seer isiken.<verse eid="DEU 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hadokee Ajajemabaaka Belto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 21:18" />Mitti manjichchi anni yookaan ama hitaaxxa laqabaaka, xinxeexxe kaddoolenna baratabaaka gooba micciirakaanna jallichcha belto afo'oole, <verse eid="DEU 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 21:19" />anni isikinna ama isixxi ookkonee belto aa'neexxi insa'ne he'na'neeke qachchixxe huddumme'ni hexxeexxe geedheba'a idangowwaal. <verse eid="DEU 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 21:20" />Insa'nenna, «Kunni no'ok belti gooba miciidhdhaakenna jallichaken; hineenexxanna laqaakebaan; ha'wallokenna fooggalaken» hineexxi eettene geedhe'n kullowwaal. <verse eid="DEU 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 21:21" />Ookkonechchi uduma ookkone qachchik labballi duuchchi reyaa qico'n iso'oo kinot cancaqowwaal; tennee assiyyotinna fuggo ha'noxxe oddonaa'n fugusse; Isira'eeli'n hedheek duuchchinna tennee laqeexxi sodaataan.<verse eid="DEU 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gargari Gargaritti Hedheeka Seeruwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 21:22" />Mitti manji iso'o reyote geessissaaxxa balleessa huje'e shiyemee'na'a renshi isikinna haqichchoke'n fannisemoole, <verse eid="DEU 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 21:23" />renshi isik haqichchoke'n fannisemeeba galo'a waaldoxxe'e; tinninna haqichoke'n fannisemeek Duuchchi woddike Gootti edo badinemeeke kademmaxxe'e, Duuchhci Woddik Gootti atik Mageni qadaada atike kado'a ati'a uwwaa'neeka boga battoossitabexxoshsha ookkonee rensha eettene barra'inni moogi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:13">Gel. 3:13</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 21:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="DEU 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 22:1" />Atike dayyixxi qotiyyichchi, yookaan gedhebi ba'ee'naa affottole isiba hissite iyyedagi male'e sammite saxxoxxe. <verse eid="DEU 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 22:2" />Dayyi atik atike loola'n hedha gophoole yookaan isi ayyete kaddeexxa ege'na gophphottole anni hase dagaaxxee ookkonee hore atike mine'n aaxxe atiba turaashsha assi; ookkonechchi uduma hiissite isi'a uwwi. <verse eid="DEU 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 22:3" />Ittanni dayyo atikixxi harre seemma yookaan isicho ba'eechcho hoonechchonna affottole, isi'aa hissi; gaga'm hite waaldoxxe'e.<verse eid="DEU 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 22:4" />Isira'eel dayyo atike kadeekiki harrichchi yookaan qotiyyichchi orake'n ibee'na affottol ke'issi malee uuda'n saxxoxxe.<verse eid="DEU 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 22:5" />Duuchchi Woddika Gootta ha'nooka Mageno diqachchiissexxe kaddemmaxxe'e dubarte labballiinxa seemma oddo'witoqqe; labbakinna dubartetixxa seemma oddo'oqqe.<verse eid="DEU 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 22:6" />Ora me'ita'n ci'a haqqichoke'n yookaan butta beltanna ifixxe'n yookaan quuphphe'ke'n kabbite hexxeeka iseka mine affottole ama beltannati welti aadhdhitoxxe'e. <verse eid="DEU 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 22:7" />Yaane kinni ati'aa eloxxi kaddaashshanna wogga atixxi buttate'n qeerxaashsha beltanna adhdhitettexxi ama me'ito'a wocci assi.<verse eid="DEU 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 22:8" />Haaroka mine jaadhdhitatto wodda heellichotenaa'n manji ibe'na'a isixxe munde'a mini atik laqemabaashsha heellichchote'n fawo giissi. <verse eid="DEU 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 22:9" />Woyine kaassete fichchi giddo lame bifaxxa sanne rokkoxxe'e; tennee assitottole rokkettexxi sanne calla kaddebaangi woyyinetike hiddicho la'oonfata dandeettabexxon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:19">Lew. 19:19</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 22:10" />Qotiyyichchi harrichiki welti xamadde hujjoxxe'e. <verse eid="DEU 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 22:11" />Layinotike shimalinninna gedhebiinxe ordanni ganendeexxa seemma oddo'witoxxe. <verse eid="DEU 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 22:12" />Oddo'witattoke seemmake shoolinge kasa'n handaara giissi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 15:37-41">Lak. 15:37-41</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aadhatixxanna Heerumatixxe Ca'untexxa Heqqecca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 22:13" />Mitti manji aadhe ke'eexxi aadhemmaxxa are gibeexxi, <verse eid="DEU 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 22:14" />summa iseka dharik balleesatee, «Tennee manjichcho adhdhenne wodda ise wo'matebaan» hiyyoole, <verse eid="DEU 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 22:15" />Eettene beltok anninna ama duuddo dubarra kada isexxa kokeessatee'e ise'e qachchiinxe huddummexxe geedheba idagowwaal. <verse eid="DEU 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 22:16" />Beltotik anninna geedhete'n, «Ani belto anixxa konne manjichchi'a heerunsiseennani; isi kinni isee gibe. <verse eid="DEU 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 22:17" />Isinna summa iseka balleessati ane'ni, ‹Belto atixi duuddo dubarrichchobaan› hiyyeemmani, yaane kinni anxi belto duuddo dubarrichcho kaddeexxa kokeessaak beessisi kunnise» hiyya'ni beltotik hadi edo heerumi barixxa mundetixxa seemma qachchiinxe geedhe edo diriirsowwaal. <verse eid="DEU 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 22:18" />Ookkonechchi uduma iitti geedhe ookkonee aadhemmaka manjichcho xixxowwaal. <verse eid="DEU 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 22:19" />Tinninna kunni manjichchi Isira'eelichcho dubarrichchoka summa balleessemmaxxee dhibba biretika sibljo iso'o uwwinsowaal; konnee birretika siblijonna beltotike anni'a uunowwaal; iitti manjichchotanna duuchchi woddi'a isixxe kadde hexxaan; manjichchi hedhoti hedheeke baro'n ise'e waaliyyo hassissabaan.<verse eid="DEU 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 22:20" />Yaane kinni manjichchiinxi ku'la dhugaate kadde'na'a iitti manjichcho duuddo dubarichcho kaddeexxa kokeessaachcho afagophphoole, <verse eid="DEU 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 22:21" />ise edonni annike mine'n hexxemma wodda yabaabulde'e Isira'eeli giddo shookishshaaxxa yaane assitemmaxxe'e iseke annike minixxe huddummeba ise'e idangowwaal; ookkonna iseke qachchik manni ise'e rertaaqico'n kinjik cancaqowwaal; konneqicinni tennee fuggoxxa yaane ha'no, ha'noo giddii'n fuggussa hasissaan. <verse eid="DEU 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 22:22" />Mitti manji wele manjixxe arenni diiphe'e afemoole, inseni welti diiphemmaki manjichchinna iitti manjichcho shiyyemmowaal; konneqicinni tennee fuggoxxa yaane ha'no Isira'eeli giddii'n fuggussa hasissaan. <verse eid="DEU 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 22:23" />Mitti manji uwwendeexxa dubarichcho qachchi giddo afeexxi isenni welti diiphphoole, <verse eid="DEU 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 22:24" />ise qachchi giddo hexxee wodda manji dhaqqabaashsha raaragophphemmaxxee, iikki manjichchinna annaffeexxe arenni hunnat welti diiphemmaxxe'e lamiinga insa'ne'e qachchiinxe huddumme'n iyyemartineexxi rennaa qico'ni kinjink cancaqqe; konne qicinni ha'no fuggoxxa ha'noo giddii'n fuggussa hasissaan. <verse eid="DEU 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 22:25" />Yaane kinni mitti manji uwwendeexxa dubarichcho qachchi gadhidarre afeexxi hunnat welti dhiiphoole, tennee hujeek manjichchi calli shiyemuun. <verse eid="DEU 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 22:26" />Eettene dubarichcho'ni kinni mittechchonna assitoxxe'e; ise reyote'e geessissaaxxa cubbo hujjebaan; iitta hexxeexxi yaane jaalo ifike'n ke'eexxi iso'o shiyammake manjichchixxe yaaneshshaten. <verse eid="DEU 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 22:27" />Tinni kaddaachchi iikki manjichchi eettenee uwwendeexxa dubarrichcho qachchi gadhidarre afemmaxxeenna ise manji dhaqabaashsha raartee wodda midde ise'e dhaqqabe gargareek mitti manjinna hedha gophemmaxxeeten.<verse eid="DEU 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 22:28" />Mitti manji uwwendebaaxxa dubarrichcho afeexxi hunnat isen welti dhiiphee'na'a manni insa'nee afoole, <verse eid="DEU 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 22:29" />iikki manjichchi eettene dubarrichchoke anni'a onde tomme birretika sibljo uwwowwaal; manjichchi eettene dubarrichonni hunnati welti dhiiphemmaxxe'e ise'e aadhiyyo hasisaan; hedhoti hedheeke boro duuchcha'n ise'e waala dande'aba'a.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:16-17">Fula. 22:16-17</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 22:30" />Mitti manjichchi anna ifikixxa are aadhoqqe'e; anna ifikixxa ma'nanna battoossoqe'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:8">Lew. 18:8</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:11">20:11</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 27:20">Lew. 27:20</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="DEU 23" />
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi woddike Goottixxe Tuutanaa'n Gargar Higa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 23:1" />Labbaliink bisi cancaqemeek yookaan yakkemeek manji Duuchchi woddike Goottixxe tuutaba e'yoqqe'e.<verse eid="DEU 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 23:2" />Baanake kado'o yookaan isixxi horte duuchchi tomme ilaqico'n Duuchchi woddike Goottixxe tuuta giddo e'yitoqqe'e.<verse eid="DEU 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 23:3" />Amoonichchi yookaan Mo'aabichchi yookaan hiin isixxi horte tomme ila qico'n Duuchchi woddike Goottixxe tuuta giddo e'yoqqe'e. <verse eid="DEU 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 23:4" />Tinni kadiyyo hasisseechchi ha'no Gibistee'n fuldine'e ora me'itinaammaxxa yanna midha wode'e insa'ne'aa aa'nexxi ha'no'o qophe'nebaan; Mesiphexoomiya giddike Fetoorike qachchik Bi'oork belti Bele'aaminna ha'noo badinaashsha maallaqik iso'o hire.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:1-6">Lak. 22:1-6</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 23:5" />Kaddomalee Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'nook Mageni Bele'aami hiyyaaxxa laqa gibe; yaane kinni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'no'o eeyyemmaxxee badino isixxa eebbate asse.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:1-2">Neh. 13:1-2</ref>. </char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 23:7-24:9">Lak. 23:7—24:9</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 23:6" />Hedhoti hexxetteke baro duuchcha'n Mo'abi'aanna Amooni'a nage'ikinna eloxxi kaddaashsha halchitoxxe.<verse eid="DEU 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 23:7" />Eedoomito atike fira kandeemmaxxe'e insa'ne'e diqattoxxe'e; alaga kadde'e insa'nee boga'n hexxettan Gibtsito diqattoxxe'e. <verse eid="DEU 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 23:8" />Insa'neexxe sakkaxxe ilaxxi oose Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxe tuuta giddo e'ya dandeetta.<verse eid="DEU 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bagediinxe Kanbexxa Ca'umma Heqqacca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 23:9" />Naapha atika loldota'a fulde kaanbe ofo'litettexxa yanna battitte yaane duuchchinaa'n ifi heqedhi. <verse eid="DEU 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 23:10" />Ha'noo giddii'ni mitti manji hashsha hortetixxe sanneka wode'e dune batto'eek manji hedhoole, kaanbe giddii'n fuleexxi ookkonni turowaal. <verse eid="DEU 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 23:11" />Arishsho e'yito'a shiqqa'n daggamma wodda isi biso anshedhowwaal; arishshotinna e'iteeshshanni kaanbe giddi'a higowwaal.<verse eid="DEU 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 23:12" />Foole'akee fuldattoxxa bakka kaanbet gadhidarre giissi. <verse eid="DEU 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 23:13" />Atike mi'inni welti qotto afi; foole'akee fuldato wodda isinni bale qottettexxi foolo'a ofolde kexxettechchi uduma buttinna itti hiissi <verse eid="DEU 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 23:14" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni naapha atikenaa'n atee heqqo'anna anga atixxe'n sa'isse uwwo'a atixxe kaanbe giddo mammaremaammaxxe'e, atike qarqara'n battitte yaane afeexxi atenaa'n illeema higabaashsha olla'i atik woyyichchake kadowwaal.<verse eid="DEU 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gargar Hedheeka Seeruwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 23:15" />Mitti garbichchi gootta ifikebaa'n baaje atiba'a dagoole, gootta isike asso'a sa'issite uutoxxe. <verse eid="DEU 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 23:16" />Isi atike boga'n iso'o gammachchiisaake booncho'inna isi fi'leeke qachchi giddo hedhuun male'e iso'o miiccoxxe'e.<verse eid="DEU 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 23:17" />Isira'eelixxe gosak manji labbakenna kaddi yookaan meyyaxxi fakketi minike yabaabula kaddoqe'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:29">Lew. 19:29</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 23:18" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageni diqataaxxe yaane kaddemmaxxe'e yabaabulle assexxe meyyaxxee uwwemeeka yookaan labballo labbake'n yababule ke'e uwwemeeka maallaqa hoone werreegettexxa uutota'a Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Magenike mine'n idaggoxxe'e.<verse eid="DEU 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 23:19" />Maallaqiinxaa yookaan hoonechchika dhala alfiyyote dhaliki dayyo atikee liqeessitoxxe. <verse eid="DEU 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 23:20" />Alagake'e dhaliki liqeessa dandeettatton; yaane kinni eettenee dhaaldota'a e'yita'etteke boga'n huccitattochchi ducuchchinni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atiki Mageni ate'e eebbiso'a Isira'eelichcho atike dayyi'a dhaliki liqeessitoxxe'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:25">Fula. 22:25</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 25:36-37">Lew. 25:36-37</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 15:7-11">Lew. 15:7-11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 23:21" />Duuchchi woddike Gootta atike Mageni'a uwwatee werreeggettexxi yaane ate'n turtebaangi rakke uwwi: Duuchchi woddike Gootta atike Mageni'a uwwanno hite'e afo'o saxxettexxa yaane uwwi hiyya'neen: werreegga uwwa gophphottole kinni cubbote ate'n kaddaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 30:1-16">Lak. 30:1-16</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:33">Mat. 5:33</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 23:22" />Kaddo malee'e Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atikee'e werreegga gophand ise'ni cubbotebaan. <verse eid="DEU 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 23:23" />Yaane kinn Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Mageni'a ifixxe eeyyanni werreegaateshann: afo'ii'ni fulchexxetteka xexxe'achchot muuxa hasissaan.<verse eid="DEU 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 23:24" />Mitte manjike woyinetike hiddichchuwwi giddii'n qaxxaamurte saxxatto wodda fichchi giddo hexxeexxi gummanaa'n dandeettette qico iti: yaane kinni anga abixxitetteke miyi giddo ittanna gumma uggudhdhitoxxe. <verse eid="DEU 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 23:25" />Mitte manji huccemmaxxe midha giddii'n saxxato wodda tisha angati toxxe ita dandeettatton: yaane kinni midha haa'mite adhdhitoxxe.<verse eid="DEU 23:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="DEU 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 24:1" />Mitti manji mitte manjichcho aadheechchi uduma, isoo gammachchiissa'nebaaxxa yaane ise'n afe'e giboole, isee'e waaleexxa ege'nishshaaxxa borro ise'a uwweexxi ifike minenaa'n ise'e shorrowwaal. <verse eid="DEU 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 24:2" />Isike minenaa'ni fuldeechi uduma wele aro'o'n heerundoole, <verse eid="DEU 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 24:3" />langak isek aro'inna iittanni ise'e gibeexxi waale'exxa borro ise'n uwweexxi ifike minenaa'n shorroole yookaan isi reyoole, <verse eid="DEU 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 24:4" />okkonechchi uduma ise'e waalemmak siretik isek aro'i, ise battoottemmaxxe'e higgeenni lebe'e ise'e aadha dande'abaan. Iitta hexxeexxi yaane Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo jibbemeechon. Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageni geego atike asse uwwa'neeke boga'n cubbo idaggoxxe'e.<verse eid="DEU 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 24:5" />Reefi aadheek manji bagedo duuloqqe'e, isi wele huje hujoqqe'e. Mitte wogga'a hujebelo tolanga mine ifike'ni aadhemmaxxa ifixxa are gammachchisowaal. <verse eid="DEU 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 24:6" />Daamma yookaani isika suussuqanjo liqeeffattetteke maallaqixxe'e hite'e abidishsha adhdhittoxxe'e, tennee assa manjiinxa lubbo maallaqake'e abixxatishshaten. <verse eid="DEU 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 24:7" />Mitti manji Isira'eelito kadeek ifike dayyuwwi giddii'n hunnati aadheexxi garba assedhee'naa yookaan gurguraa'naa afemoole, isoo'o fulcheek manjichchi shiyemuun. Konneqicinni fuggoxxa yaane ati giddi'n fugussitatton.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:16">Fula. 21:16</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 24:8" />Soomiinke dhukkubixxe'e leewwito, qeesole, ati'aa uuta'neeka toggichcha seera muuxate'e ifi heqqedhi. Ani insa'ne'a uwweennka ajaja xonxoommatat hordofi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 13:1-14:54">Lew. 13:1—14:54</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 24:9" />Ha'no Gibtsee'ni fuldineechchi uduma orange'n hexxinee'na'a Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Magni Maaryaami'n asseexxa yaane qaabbati.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 12:10">Lak. 12:10</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 24:10" />Fedheenxa yaane jaalo atike'e liqeessitatto wodda maallaqiinxa abidishsha, ati'a uwwa'neexxa adhdhate'e isike mini giddo e'iytoxxe'e. <verse eid="DEU 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 24:11" />Ati gadho hexxe'e heqqi: ikk liqeessitetak manjichchi anga abidisaachcho minii'ni ati'a aadhe dagowwaal. <verse eid="DEU 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 24:12" />Manjichchi hiyyeessak kadoole, anga abidiseemmalcho atiba galchexxoxxe'e. <verse eid="DEU 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 24:13" />Buyyedhe galaashsha arishsho e'itebaang isi'a hiissi. Ookkonechchi uduma isinna atee'e galateeffataan, Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Mageni edonna qullitte huje kadde'e ati'a laakko'endaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:26-27">Fula. 22:26-27</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 24:14" />Atiba maallaqake'e huja'neeke hiyyeessakenna rakkichcha Isira'eelichcho dayyo atike kado, ati hexxaateke qachchuwwi giddii'n mitteke'n hedha'neek wele bogika manjo miiccoxxe'e. <verse eid="DEU 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 24:15" />Hujemmaxxa barratixxe hujeka maallaqa arishsho e'yitebaangi isi'a uwwi, hiyyeesake kademmaxxe'e haanonna haano anga geyu hiyya'nee yoraan. Uwwa gophphottole Duuchchi woddike Goottibaa oodhee'na'a cubbote ati'a kaddaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:13">Lew. 19:13</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 24:16" />Hadiinxe ballessa'a oose insa'neexxi shiyendoqqe'e, oosetinna hujjeexxe ballessaxxe'e hadi shiyemoqqe'e: mitti mittinig ifi ifixxe cubbonni shiyemowaal.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 14:6">2 Moy. 14:6</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 25:4">2 Odo. 25:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 18:20">Hiz. 18:20</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 24:17" />Wele bogike manji'a yookaan anna afebaake belti'aa dhuga dassittoxxe'e, aro'o shi'witeexxe manjichoxxa seemma anga abidishsha adhdhitoxxe'e. <verse eid="DEU 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 24:18" />Atinna Gibtseke boga'n garbake kaddeettexxanna Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni ookko'o'ni ate'e wode'eexxa qalliyyi. Aninna konne'e ajaja uwwenechchi tenne'e assitottaaten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:9">Fula. 23:9</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:33-34">Lew. 19:33-34</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 27:19">Lew. 27:19</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 24:19" />Fichchi giddii'n midha haa'mitatto wodda, deetee'naa gatteexxi deegge hexxoole, higge'e marte aaxxoxxe'e. Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageni huccittetechcho duuchcha eebiso'a ladde, wele bogike manji'a, annanna ama afebaakeenna aro'o shi'witeexxe manjichcho'a waal. <verse eid="DEU 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 24:20" />Atinna ejerisiinke haqichchonaa'n gumma harcaassatto wodda, dame damete'ni gataaka qocexxotta'a higge martoxxe'e. Wele bogike manji'a, annanna ama affebaakenna aro'o shi'witeexxe manjichcho'a waali. <verse eid="DEU 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 24:21" />Atinna woyinetike hiddichchixxa rodde qocexxatto wodda gatteexxa deegge higge'e qocexxoxxe'e, gatteexxa wele bogike manji, annanna ama afebaake, aro'o shi'witeexxe manjichcho'a waal.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:9-10">Lew. 19:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:22">23:22</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 24:22" />Atinna Gibtseke boga'n garbake kaddeettaxxa qaabbat. Aninna konne'e ajaja uwwennechchi tenne'e assitottaaten.<verse eid="DEU 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="DEU 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 25:1" />Lami manji loleme ku'late'e murittetixxe songobaa dangoole miicemeeka tola; mice'eka kinn balleesanjo assine murrowaal, <verse eid="DEU 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 25:2" />Ookkonechchi uduma balleessanjo kutiki kulchiisa; yookaan godobiki diiphisse'e duddoro kutik kulchiisaashsha murrichi ajajowwaal: kulchiisa'neekinna murrichchi hedheeba me'e ganema'ni murrema'neek balleessa isixxishshanden. <verse eid="DEU 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 25:3" />Shoole tommi kulchiisa dandeennaan: shoole tomme sa'a hasissabaan: ookkonechchi iima kulchiissitotol gode atixxa salphissette hiyyoten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:24">2 Qor. 11:24</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 25:4" />Midha huccitatto wodda qotiyo afo'o habooqqoxxe.<verse eid="DEU 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I'leebaang Reyeeke Manjichchike Dayyi'a Hujaaka Seera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 25:5" />Dayyuwi mitteba hedhee'na'a insa'nee giddii'n mitti labbaka i'lebaang rewoole, reyemmakixxi are isike fir giddo marte heeruma hasissabaan; ookkone reyemmakiki dayi ise'e dhaale galchowaal wosiilummatika seeranna muuxowwaal. <verse eid="DEU 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 25:6" />Iitta hexxeexe yaane kadda wodda edise ilemeeki labbaki belti reyeemmake manjichchike summinni ye'emowwaal: konne qicin Isira'eelixxe gosa'n reyeeke manjichchixxi booso baxxabaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:24">Mat. 22:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:19">Mar. 12:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:28">Luq. 20:28</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 25:7" />Yaane kinn reyeeke manjichchik dayyi isee'e aadhate'e hoodoole qachchiinke sooreessiba marte'e «Anke aro'ik dayyi ane'e aadha haseebaan: herelchi Isira'eelike ardixxe oddo'n sanne sa'issate'e hasebaan» hite kuldowwaal: <verse eid="DEU 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 25:8" />Okkonechchi uduma qachchi giddo hedheek sooreessuwwi manjichcho ye'ne haaseesse'nowwaal: ta'anna isee'e aadha gophanoole. <verse eid="DEU 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 25:9" />Reyemmake manjichchixxi are qachchiinke sooreessuwwi edo isiba'a shiqqowwaal: mitte lekkaka kophe isonaa'n fulchiteexxi albake'n hancufa tuffe «Dayyo ifike'e sanne wobbisabo'non hiyyaake manji'a iitta hexxeexxa shookissaaxxa yaane muuxa hasissaan» hitowwaal. <verse eid="DEU 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 25:10" />Okkone manjichchike mini hadixxi horte Isira'eelike ardi edo kophe lekkatenaa'n ibbe'eke manjike mini hado hine cee'mina'naa ye'ema'ni hedhaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:7-8">Rut. 4:7-8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wele Ajajuwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 25:11" />Lami manni lolemeex weli gooba hudhaa wodda mittiinxi are aro'o ifikee baassite weli labballiinka biso dhaphphi assite abiddoole; <verse eid="DEU 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 25:12" />Mitte mararte belo anga isexxa kuntowaal.<verse eid="DEU 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="DEU 25:13-14" />Kiilot yookaan mike egenebaak miyuwwinni elqe kayya ganda'n manjo sobboxxe. <verse eid="DEU 25:13-14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 25:15" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atiki Mageni uwwa'neeke boga'n qeerra baro hexxotaa fayyakanna addatendeexa kiilonna mike ege'neeka miya calla la'oonfat: <verse eid="DEU 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 25:16" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atiki Mageni iitta soba'n elobaaxe xaqaro huja'neeka manna duuchcha eeyabaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:35-36">Lew. 19:35-36</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amaleeqitotike mannixxa booso Balleessinaashsha Uwwemeek Ajaja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 25:17" />Ati Gibtsee'ni fuldette wodda Amaalqitoti manni hunjeexxa huje deetoxxe'e. <verse eid="DEU 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 25:18" />Insa'ne Mageno sodaata'neeke mannabaan: ati me'ita'n gophphe luggitette wodda uduma gateemmaka duuchcha shinnee birreen: <verse eid="DEU 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 25:19" />Tennexxee Duuchchi woddik Gootti atiki Mageni boga ati'a uwweeke qarqarake'ni hedheemmake atike naaphuwwa duuchchinaa'ni ate'e gargaaraa wodda buttate'n ayyinna insa'nee haba gante hiyyaak hedhabaa qicin Amaaleeqika manna duuchcha bululoke asseen! Atinni tenne'e ijje deetoxxe!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:8-14">Fula. 17:8-14</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 15:2-9">1 Sam. 15:2-9</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 25:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="DEU 26" />
  <para style="s1">Midha Aase'nammaxxe Yanna'ni Shiqqaaxxa Umiixa Uwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 26:1" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni uwwa'neeke bogibaa marte ifike asseexxenni mitte godobinni ofoldatto wodda; <verse eid="DEU 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 26:2" />Uwwa'neeke boga'ni huccitattoxxe midhanaa'n umiinxa uwwa agaladete'n Duuchchi woddike Gootta atike Mageniki summi ye'emaashsha fi'leeke boonno'n aaxe mari: <verse eid="DEU 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 26:3" />Eettennee yanna baalloomake'n hedheeke qeesichchibaa martettexxi «Ani telcho Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageni no'oxxe oose'a uwwo'a annuwwa no'oke'n kako aageemmake bogibaa dagennexxa kokeesa'neen» hiyyi. <verse eid="DEU 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 26:4" />Qeesichchikinna agalade aadheexxi Duuchchi woddike Gootta atike Magenike tolchi edo uggaan: <verse eid="DEU 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 26:5" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi woddike Gootta atike Mageni edo hitatto qici «Anni anki okkoo'ni okko sa'a'ni me'a'neek Sooriyixxe gosake manjomman: heenoka ifika mini hado aadheexxi Gibtseke bogibaa mare keessumumma ofo'leen: heeno'meemmak lumoke, jabakenna, hore bira sa'aan hite haaso'i. <verse eid="DEU 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 26:6" />Gibtsek manni kinni no'oo rakkise, salphisee, garba insa'neke assine no'o hujinseen. <verse eid="DEU 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 26:7" />No'onna no'oke annuwwike Duuchchi woddike Gootti Magenibaa raarrenneni: Magenikinna raare no'oxa laqeex rakko no'oxa; gonphetanna miiccama no'oka uudeen. <verse eid="DEU 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 26:8" />Tennenaa'n kexxeexxa Duuchchi woddiki Goottinna lumoxxe hunna isixxenninna jabaxxe hirre isixxenni leellishat; lumoxxe soda'anni lumoke beessisinni manbe'iki Gibtsee'ni no'o fulcheen. <verse eid="DEU 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 26:9" />Kabaa'a aadhe dageex malebikinna adoti duroome celqe hiyyeeka shaqqaka boga dhaalchiseen. <verse eid="DEU 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 26:10" />Tennexxee ani isi anaa'a uwweexe karranaa'n angafa kadeechcho igageennen» Konneechchi edi'aanna agalade Duuchchi woddike Gootti edo uggite magenooffat. <verse eid="DEU 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 26:11" />Ati'anna mini hado atike Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atik Mageni assemmaxxe qixxe'n eloxa yaane gammaadina'n galateeffatte: Leewwitotinna ha'nonni wolti hexxa'neexi keessumma konne galatiinke ayyaana'n insa'nenna qoodemmowwaal.<verse eid="DEU 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 26:12" />Sakkaxxe wogga'n umiinxa uwwa duuchcha shiqishshattoxxe wogga'n, angafa yaane duuchcha bukki assitee birtettechchi uduma qachchi giddo hedheeke Leewwitotee, keessumumma ofo'leeke manni'a, hadi reyeexe oose'anna aro'i reyeemmaxe melaalle'a uutee'naa goddine indaashsha uwwi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:28-29">Lew. 14:28-29</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 26:13" />Ookkonechchi uduma Duuchchi woddike Gootta atike Mageni edo hitatto qici, «Ati ane'ni kuldetteshshanna woyyomeeka qoobbo anka mine ankenaa'n aadhe Leewwitotee, wele boganaa'ni dageeke manni'a, anna afebaakeenna aro'o shi'witeexxee uwweennen. Atike seeri gadho me'ebe'non; mitti dedhennek midde hedhebaan. <verse eid="DEU 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 26:14" />Oodhishshaten hedhenna wodda woyyichcha qoobbonaa'n mitechchonna itebe'non; batto'enne woddanna konne woyyoomeechchinaa'n mitechchonna adhdhebe'non; reyeeke manni'a shiqaake tolchi'a aadhennechchi hedhebaan; Duuchchi Woddike Gootta anke Magenika hiyyicho laqeennen; ajaja isika duuchchanna muuxeennen. <verse eid="DEU 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 26:15" />Iimate'n hedheeke woyyichcha atike galduma'n hexxe uudi; arda atika Isira'eeli'aanna edike annuwwa no'oke'e kako aaggeettashshanni, no'o'a uutetteka konee shamoka boga eebbis» hiyyi.<verse eid="DEU 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 26:16" />«Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atiki Mageni konnee seeranna aada heqqexxattoshsha techcho ajaja'en: atinna mitte qalbeninn mitte heduminni heqqedhi. <verse eid="DEU 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 26:17" />Duuchchi woddike Gootta atike Mageno kadeexxa egende isi hiyyaake seera'n galdotaa, ajajakanna seera isika heqqedhateenna ajajematee techcho kokeessiteetten: <verse eid="DEU 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 26:18" />Tennexxee Duuchchi woddiki Gootti haaso'emmashshanni ati techcho isi'a gargaritt hexxe foyendeetteke ard asse fi'le'een: atinna ajaja isik duuchcha heqqexxattoshsha kula'neen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5">Fula. 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 4:20">Lew. 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:6">7:6</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 14:2">14:2</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tit. 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:9">2 Phex. 2:9</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 26:19" />Tennee assitottole dadeemmake ard duuchchi irra galatik, summik gurrikinna ate'e lummiso'a ati'a haaso'emmashshan isi'a gargar hedheeke arda assa'neexa ate'ni kule'en» hiyye.<verse eid="DEU 26:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="DEU 27" />
  <para style="s1">Geebaalixxe Kooba'ni Uurreeka Tolchimalcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 27:1" />Muusenna Isira'eelike ardik sooreessuwwi arda hiyye ajajee qici, «Techcho ani ha'no'a ajajaanneka konnee ajajuwwa duuchcha heqqe. <verse eid="DEU 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 27:2" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ati'a uwwa'neke bogiba'a e'yate'e Yordaanoosi fooffineechchi uduma, heenoxxa lumollamma kino uurrissettexxi ise'ni hana boo'e issi. <verse eid="DEU 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 27:3" />Edike annuwwi atikiki Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageni uwwanno hiyye addachchiisemmaka shamoke bogiba'a Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageni ati'a uwwa'neke bogiba'a e'yate'e yoordaanosi'i fooffatto wodda konnee seerika hiyyichcho duuchcha tenne kino hana borreessi. <verse eid="DEU 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 27:4" />Atinna Yordaanoosi'i fooffetteshanni, techcho ani ate'e ajajenneshshanni tennee kinuwwa Geebalxe Kooba iima kaasi, atinna ise'ni hana boore issi. <verse eid="DEU 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 27:5" />Ookko'o Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Mageni'a, sibljiinke miyinni tuqqebexxok kinoti tolchimalcho giissi. <verse eid="DEU 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 27:6" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Magenika tolchimalcho bocendebaaxxe kinonni huji, iso'ni hana Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Mageni'a ciincatika tolcha shiqishi. <verse eid="DEU 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 27:7" />Ooko'o mittoomiinka tolcha tolchi, itatanna iti Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Mageni edo gammadi. <verse eid="DEU 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 27:8" />Tenne kino hana konne seerika hiyyichcho duuchcha ca'a assite'e itti borreessi» hiyye.<verse eid="DEU 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Geebaalixxe Kooba'ni Kulendeexxa Badino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 27:9" />Ookonechchi uduma Muuse qeesoletanna leewwito, duuchcha Isira'eelika arda hiyyee qic, «Koo Isira'eelike arda, sammi hitine caqasi, Ati techcho Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Magenike arda kaddeetten. <verse eid="DEU 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 27:10" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootta atike Mageni'a ajajemi: techcho ati'aa uwwa'neeka ajaja isikanna aada isixxa heqqedhi» hiyye. <verse eid="DEU 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 27:11" />Muusenna eettene barra arda hiyye ajajeeqic, <verse eid="DEU 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 27:12" />Yordaanoosi'i fooffineeshshanni: Simooni, Leewwi, Yihuda, Yisakoori, Yoosefinna Biiniyaami gosa gosaka arda eebbinso'a Geriizaanixe Kooba iima uurrinowwaal. <verse eid="DEU 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 27:13" />Roobeli, Gaadi, Aseeri, Zabiloni, Daaninna Nefitaalemiir Geebaalixxe kooba iima badinotee'e gosa gosake ardi'a uurrinowwaal.<verse eid="DEU 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 27:14" />Leewwito hafuura gikki assite Isira'eelike arda duuchcha'ni hine kullaa qic,<verse eid="DEU 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 27:15" />«Angatixxa oge ege'neeki manjichchi Duuchchi woddike Gootti ga'mii'ni misechchixxa fakke boce hujaak, yookaan magenuwwa giissedhe sho'iki uurrisedhaak manji badinemeeke kaduuni» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:15">Ardi duuchchi «Kaddowwaal!» Hiyyowwaal.<verse eid="DEU 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 27:16" />«Anna ifika yookaan ama isixxa salphisaak badinemeeke kadowwaal!» Hiyye.</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:16">Ardi duuchchi, «Ameen!» Hiyyowwaal.<verse eid="DEU 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 27:17" />«Jaali ifikixxa gabala dhiiba'ni gabalate'ni hexxeexxa kino hoyyaaki manji badinemeeke kadowwaal!»</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:17">Ard duuchchi «Ameen!» Hiyyowwaal.<verse eid="DEU 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 27:18" />«Ille ba'eeka fuggo oribaa'a akeekaaki manji, badinemeek kadowwaal!»</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:18">Ard duuchchi «Ameen!» Hiyyowwaal.<verse eid="DEU 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 27:19" />«Wele bogike manjo'ni, annanna ama afebaakenna aro'o shi'witeexxe manjichcho'ni dhugaa dassaaki manji badinemeeke kaddowwaal!» Hiyye.</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:19">Ard duuchchi «Ameen!» Hiyyoweaal.<verse eid="DEU 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 27:20" />«Anniixxe arenni welti diiphaaki manji anniixa ma'na batteessemmaxxe'e badinemeeke kadowwaali»</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="DEU 27:20">Ardi duuchchi «Ameen!» Hiyyowwaal.<verse eid="DEU 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 27:21" />«Manjiinsha hori biniinchik diiphaak manji badinemeeke kadowwal!»</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:21">Ard duuchchi «Ameen!» Hiyyowwaal.<verse eid="DEU 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 27:22" />«Wele amanaa'ni yookaan wele annanaa'ni ilendeexxe ifixxe dayyonni yabaabulaaki manji badinemeeke kadowwaal»</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:22">Ardi duuchchi «Kaddowwaal!» Hiyyowwaal.<verse eid="DEU 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 27:23" />«Aretixxe amanni welti yabaabulaaki manji badinemeeke kadowwali»</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:23">Ardi duuchchi «Ameen!» Hiyyowwaal.<verse eid="DEU 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 27:24" />«Sho'omee manjo shiyaaki manji badinemeeke kadowwaal»</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:24">Ardi duuchchi «Ameen!» Hiyyowwaal.<verse eid="DEU 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 27:25" />«Qajeela manjo shiyate'e matta maallaqa adhdhaaki manji badinemeeken»</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:25">Ardi duuchchi «Kaddowwaal!» Hiyyowwaal.<verse eid="DEU 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 27:26" />«Konne seerika hiyyichcho heqqedhe muuxabaaki manji badinemeeke kadowwal»</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:26">Ardi duuchchi «Ameen!» Hiyyowwaal.<verse eid="DEU 27:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="DEU 28" />
  <para style="s1">Ajajemati Daggaaxxa Eebba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 26:3-13">Lew. 26:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:12-24">Lew. 7:12-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 28:1" />Duuchchi woddike Gootta atike Mageni'a shenendinni ajajendottolenna ani techcho ati'a uwwaanneka ajaja duuchcha xexxe'achchoti hordoffottole, Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageni buttate'ni hedha'neeke gosa gosake ardi iima atee'e umoke assaani. <verse eid="DEU 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 28:2" />Duuchchi woddika Gootta atika Mageno ajajendottole; tinni eeba duuchcha atixxe kaddaan.<verse eid="DEU 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 28:3" />Ati qachchake'ninna fichchiki eebbisendattoni.<verse eid="DEU 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 28:4" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti oose atixxa, boga atikixxa midha, laliinxa jabbe, gedhebiinxanna re'etixxa beltanna eebbisan.<verse eid="DEU 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 28:5" />Atixxe doonexxa midhanna qiricco atixxa eebbisaan.<verse eid="DEU 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 28:6" />Ati e'yate'ninna fulate'ni eebbisendatton.<verse eid="DEU 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 28:7" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ate'ni ke'aaka atika naaphuwwa ati edo insa'ne injifatemmaashsha assaani. Insa'nenna atiba'a mitte oranaa'ni dangaan torbaane ora'ni xeeremmaani.<verse eid="DEU 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 28:8" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti qoqqoba atikanna elootte huccitettexxa karra duuchcha eebbisaan. Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageni ati'a uwwa'neeke boga'ni ate'e eebbisaan.<verse eid="DEU 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 28:9" />Duuchchi woddike Gootta atike Magenika ajajuwwa heqqexxottolenna isi hiyya'neeke ora'ni me'itaatole, isi uwwanno hiyye'e addachiisemmashsha woyyoomeeke ifike arda ate'e assaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 28:10" />Ookkonechchi uduma buttate'n hedheeki ardi duuchchi, atee'e Duuchchi woddiki Gootti summa isikinni ye'eexxa uude'e sodaataan. <verse eid="DEU 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 28:11" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ati'a uwwo'a edike annuwwa atike'e kakateemmake boga'ni heddo oose heddo horenna gurte ko'itattoxxa midha, celqe hitattoxxa durumma ati'a uwwaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 28:12" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ati hexxetteke bogi'a xeena mayete'ni uwwateenna, huccittetechcho duuchcha eebbiso'a, iimatixxa eebbatixxa hula ati'aa banaani. Atinna heddo gosa gosake ardi'aa liqeessitatto malee'e ayyenaa'ninna liqeeffattabexxon. <verse eid="DEU 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 28:13" />Duuchchi woddiki Goottinna ate'e umoke assaa malee'e eegete assabaan. Techcho ati'a uwwa'neek Duuchchi woddike Gootta atike Magenika ajajuwwa xonxoommachchoti heqqitottole, haanonna kaddo ati lumoke malee'e ijje shiixxexxabexxon. <verse eid="DEU 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 28:14" />Wele magenuwwa hordofati, insa'ne'aanna ergatemat tochcho Ani ati'a uwwaanneke ajajuwwanaa'ni middi'a bita'i'a higgoxxe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 11:13">Lew. 11:13</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 11:17">17</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ajajema Gopha Idagaaxxa Badinuwwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 26:14-46">Lew. 26:14-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 28:15" />Yaane kinn Duuchchi woddike Gootta atike Mageni'a ajajema gophphottole techchixxe barra'ni, Ani ati'a uwwaanneka ajajuwwanna seeruwwa isika duuchcha xonxoommatte hordofa gophphoottole, konneechchinni butti'a hexxeexxi Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi badino atee hanqattabaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 28:16" />Ati qachchake'ninna boga atike'ni huccitettexxe midhanninna badinendatton. <verse eid="DEU 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 28:17" />Atixxi doonenna atixxe midhaxxi qiricco badinendaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 28:18" />Oose atixxa, boga atikixxa midha, laliinxa jubbuwwa, gedhebiinxanna re'etixxa beltanna badinaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 28:19" />Ati mini'a e'yate'ni badindatton; fulate'ninna badinendatton. <verse eid="DEU 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 28:20" />Ati Duuchchi Woddika Gootta waalde fuggoxxa huje hujatenaa'ni kexxeexxa, booso atixxi rakke baxxe kuttii muddatto qico'ni anga atixxi hucciteemmachcho duuchcha'ni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti badino, weekenshanna xixichcho isika ate'ni ibisaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 28:21" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ati dhaaldotta'a e'yitaatteke boganaa'ni ate'e balleessa qico'ni, bala ate'ni ibisaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:19">Fula. 22:19</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:15">20:15</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 28:22" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ati baxxattoqico'ni huqqisake dhukkuba, eebbinjo, fulaantichcho, jabaka eebbinjo, caama, midhate'ninna waagenna, buquna itti ibisaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:9">Lak. 18:9</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 20:17">20:17</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 28:23" />Ati iimi darre hexxeexxi iima sageettotishsha, ati hunda hexxeexxa buttanna sibiljiinsha jabeessannon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:17">Lew. 18:17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:14">20:14</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 28:24" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti buttate'ni ganaaka xeena bukotibaanna huurinba'a jijjiiraan; kunniichchuwwinna ati baxxatto qico'ni iimi'ni butti'a ate'ni ganaani. <verse eid="DEU 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 28:25" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atike naaphuwwi edo ate'e injifatendattoshsha assaan. Ati insa'neeba mitte darree'ni daggatton; yaane kinni insa'ne edii'ni torbaane darre'ni baqattaton, atinna buttatixxe mootumma duuchcha'a salphinnike kaddatton. <verse eid="DEU 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 28:26" />Renshi atiki iimixxe ci'uwwaanna buttike biniinchuwwi'a itate kadaan, tennee ci'uwwa shorraaki hedhabaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:10">Gel. 3:10</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 28:27" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti fayyitabexxoke Gibtseke fulaantichchi dhukkubbinni, lumo misira malaata'neexxe madanni, qanxoti ate'e waye uudisan. <verse eid="DEU 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 28:28" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti maraattattoshsha, ille baxxattoshshanna doonsa kiyya hitattoshsha ate'e seldo uudisaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 28:29" />Balla'i dukkana giddo tirimmisa'ni me'ammashsha, atinna barra saafo'a tirmmissa'ni me'itatton. Assitattoxxi duuchcha ati'a qajeeldabaan. Barra barra'ninni miicndatton, mulqendatton: ate'e gargaaraak hedhebaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 28:30" />Ati dubarra aaxxotta'a kadhattatton: yaane kinn weli manji ati hunidii'ni isee'e aadhe isenni welti diiphaan. Ati mine ijaadhdhitatton; yaane kinni giddo galdabexxon. Woyine kaarsexxatton: yaane kinn isinaa'ni gumma ittabexxon. <verse eid="DEU 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 28:31" />Ati uuddaa'naanni Jibichchi atiki gorra'emaan, konne maalanaa'ninna iittechchonna afo'o atike'ni maaqqabexxon. Harrichchi atikinna hunnandinni atena'ni aadhemaan. Ati'aanna hiissemabaan. Gedhebi atikinna atike naaphuwwi'a uwwemaan, konnee gedhebo anga insa'neexxenaa'ni ibisaaki hedhabaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 28:32" />Labbaxxinna meyyaxxi atixxi oose wele bogike gosa gosake ardi'a uwwendaan, anga insa'ne'ni ke'issatee hunna affabexxon, techcho soodo danguuni hita'ni ille atixxi duuchchi wodda insa'ne'e heqqande'ni garjitaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 28:33" />Boga atike'ni huccitettexxa midha duuchcha buttike manna itaani, hexxetteqico'ni ate'ni fuggoxxinna miiccami ate'ni bira saxxaa malee'e ati'a woyyoottaaxxi yaane hexxabaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 28:34" />Uudaattexxi yaane duuchcha ate'e maraachchitaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 28:35" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ate'e lekkatenaa'ni ke'isse'e umiin qico'ni tare sa'aake fayyabaakenna wixxirri assitaaxxa mada, gulubo atike'ninna lekka atixxe'n ibisaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 28:36" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ateenna ate'ni hana moosisemaaka moyanjo, atinna ediki atiki annuwwi, egendinebaake gosa gosake ardiba'a ha'noo adhdhee me'aan. Ookoonna ati haqichchokena'ninna kinjokennaa'ni giissemeeka wele magenuwwa magenooffatatton. <verse eid="DEU 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 28:37" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ati e'yitattoshsha akeeka'neeke boga'ni gosa gosake arda duuchcha'ni ati salphatteetteke, jibbendeettekenna cee'mendeetteke kaddatton. <verse eid="DEU 28:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 28:38" />Fichchi atiki giddo heddo sanne facaassatton, awwaaneessi itaammaxxe'e bukki assitattoxxi heenoxxe kaddaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 28:39" />Corroqa ittammaxxe'e atinna woyinetika hiddichcho kaalsexxe'e kuufissatton, yaane kinni woyinetenaa'ni ha'witabexxon, roddetanna bukki assexxabexxon. <verse eid="DEU 28:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 28:40" />Atike boga duuchcha'ni ejersiink haqqichchi hedhaan, yaane kinn isinaa'ni gumma harcaatammaxxe'e zayite isixxa issattabexxon. <verse eid="DEU 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 28:41" />Atinna labbaxxanna meyyaxxa oose i'litatton, yaane kinn insa'ne booji'naammaxxe'e insa'ne atinni welti he'nabaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 28:42" />Haqquwwa atixxanna fichcha atiki giddo hexxeexxa midha duuchcha awwaanesinki haagani itaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 28:43" />Atixxe oddo'ni hedha'neeki wele bogik manji ate'e sa'e nophpha'ni me'aa wodda, ati kinni jale isixxe kadde'e butti'a higgaton. <verse eid="DEU 28:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 28:44" />Isote ati'a liqeessa malee'e ati isi'a liqeessitabexxon. Isi umoke kada ati kinni eegete kaddaton. <verse eid="DEU 28:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 28:45" />Tinni badino duuchcha ate'ni daggaan, atinna Duuchchi Woddika Gootta atika Mageno ajajema gophpheettaxxeenna isi ati'a uwweeka ajajanna aada heqqedha gophpheettaxxe'e, ati baxxatto qico'ni tinni baluwwa duuchcha ate'e hanqattabaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 28:46" />Insa'nenna ati'anna hore atixxe'e duuchchi woddi'a beessisakenna saadinote kandaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 28:47" />Kaddo malee'e ati duroondetto wodda Duuchchi woddika Gootta atika Mageno gammadda'ninna ilillissa'ni isi'a ergatema gophpheettaxxe'e, <verse eid="DEU 28:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 28:48" />solo'ikinna dheeboti, daaratinna jabaxxe hiyyonni, Duuchchi woddiki Gootti, ate'n ke'isake atike naaphuwwi'a ergattatton. Isinna atee'e balleessaa qico'ni gooba atike'ni sibljiinka qanbara dukinsaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 28:49" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti laagada insa'neka egendebexxoka gosa gosake ardika sannachcha bayyi boganaa'ni ate'ni ergaan, insa'neenna sinbiriinsha ate'ni ke'issaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 28:50" />Insa'nenna geercho ulfeessabaakera, oose mararabaak uunda wodda yo'oshsha sodaachchisaake gosa gosake ardan. <verse eid="DEU 28:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 28:51" />Insa'nenna ate'e balleesinaa qico'n laliinxa, gedhebiinxanna re'etixxa horte atixxanna fichchi giddixxa midha duuchcha indaan; Insa'nenna atixxi booso baxxaa qico'ni huccitettaxxe midhanaa'ni, lalo, gedhebo, re'etixxa horte duuchcha, iittanni woyinenna ejersiinke haqichchixxa gumma midde ati'a gatisabaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 28:52" />Ati addattaattek lumola jabaka gollifachchotika qachchuwwa dalla'uwwi diigemaa qico'ni boga duuchcha'ni hedheeka qachchuwwa atika duuchcha abidaan. Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atiki Mageni ati'a uwwa'neeke boga'ni hedheka qachchuwwa duuchcha buqaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="DEU 28:53" />Yaane kinni naaphi atik ate'e buqe'e rakkisa wodda, weekenshatenaa'ni kexxeexxa, Duuchchi woddik Gootti atik Mageni, ati'a uwweexxa labbaxxenna meyyaxxe oose atixxika maala ittaton. <verse eid="DEU 28:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="DEU 28:54" />Wele waalin oddo atixxe'ni shaqqaki lafilagati manji midde ifike dayyi'a kaddo eeya'neexxe are ifixxeenna kadi gattemmaxxe oose ifixxe'e mararabaan, <verse eid="DEU 28:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="DEU 28:55" />ittanni isi itaammake oose ifixxike maalanaa'ni ittelchonna insa'ne giddi'ni welekee uwwabaan. Tinni duuchchanna kaddaa'naa atika qachchuwwa duuchcha naaphuwwi abideemmaxxe'e, ate'ni geltaaxxe jabaxxe rakkonaa'ni kexxeexxa konneechcho calla isi'aa gateemman. <verse eid="DEU 28:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="DEU 28:56" />Atixxe oddo'n hexxeexxi shaqqaxxi lafilagatto tenne shaqquntenninna lafilagatumate'naa'ni kexxeexxa lekka isexxa buko tuqqe egendebaaxxi manjichcho, eeta'neenga iseka aro'o ittanni ildeenga labaka beltonna meyyaxxa belto ise'ni maachonna lanbabaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="DEU 28:57" />Gadaameesa isekenaa'ni fulemmachchonna ildemmaxxa ifixxa oose corfatta'neen. Isenna tenne'e assita'nechchi rakkote'ni hexxemma wodda atiki naaphuwwi qachchuwwa atika buqe atee'e rakkisaamma wodda, insa'nee'e shoxxe itto'a hiteeten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:57 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:28-29">2 Moy. 6:28-29</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 4:10">Erm. Wiiga. 4:10</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 28:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="DEU 28:58" />Konne maxaafi giddo borreessendeexxi konne seerik hiyyichchuwwi xonxoommachchoti hordofa gophphottolenna manbe'inkanna sodaachchisaaka Duuchchi woddike Goottike atike Magenika summa ulfeessa gophphoottole, <verse eid="DEU 28:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="DEU 28:59" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti sodaachchissaaxxanna lumo qico rakkonna qeerra baro turtaaxxa bala, fayyabaaka dhukuba ate'ninna horte atixxe'ni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ibisaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="DEU 28:60" />Isinna sodaattaatteka Gibtseka dhukkuba duuchcha ate'ni idagaan, kunni dhukkubuwwi atenaa'ni citabaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="DEU 28:61" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti konne seeriinke maxaaf giddo borreesendebaaxxa, heene bifaka dhukkubanna baxxaatto qico'ni rakko ate'ni idagaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="DEU 28:62" />Ha'noke Duuchchi woddike Gootta ha'noke Mageni'a ajajema gophphineemmaxxe'e, ha'no iimatixxe urjeshsha bira saxxineemmaki hee'no'mitinaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="DEU 28:63" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ha'noo duroonse laakoossa ha'nokanna bira sa'isa'issee'na iso'o gammachiisa gophphineemmaxxe'e, isi ha'noo balleesse booso ha'nooxxa kutti assati gammadaan. Tennexxe'e dhaaldino'a e'yitina'neeke boganaa'ni goshendinan. <verse eid="DEU 28:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="DEU 28:64" />Duuchchi woddik Goottinna boga duuchcha'n hedheeke gosa gosake ardi duuchchixxe, oddo'ni ate'e xeeraan. Ookko'ni atetenna kadi ediki atik annuwwi egendinebaaxxa haqichchokenaa'ninnaa kinjokenaa'ni hujemeeka wele magenuwwa magenoofattaton. <verse eid="DEU 28:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="DEU 28:65" />Ookkone gosa gosake ardixxe oddo'n nage'a affabexxon, lekka atixxa uggitattoka booncho affaboxxon. Ookonna Duuchchi woddiki Gootti weekendeexxa sammo, halchat garjiteexxa illenna godoba kultitattoxxa hedino ati'a uwwaan. <verse eid="DEU 28:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="DEU 28:66" />Rewunnuni hiyyoti hashshanna barra soda'a wo'mati, lubbo atixxi nage'a alfa gophati, duuchchi wodda ruphphi hita'ni hexxatton. <verse eid="DEU 28:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="DEU 28:67" />Godobi atiki soda'ati wo'meemmaxxeenna ille atixxi uuddaammaxxee yaanenaa'ni kexxeexxa bogi soodaa woodda, «Maye hedhe hashsheele» hashshaa wodda kinni, «Maye hedhe soodeele» hitatton. <verse eid="DEU 28:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="DEU 28:68" />Langaxxa higgabexon hiyyenneke ora'ninna Duuchchi woddiki Gootti hoboloti Gibtse'a ate'e hiissaan. Ookko'ninna labbakinna meyyaki garboole insa'nexxe kaddinaasha naaphoole ha'nooxxe'e ifi gurgurate'e umo ha'nooka shiqishshinaan; ha'no kinni hiraaki hedhebaan.<verse eid="DEU 28:68" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="DEU 29" />
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi woddik Gootti Mo'aabike Boga'n Isira'eelike Ardin Aageexxa kako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 29:1" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti Siinax kooba'n kakateemmaxxe kako'n higgeen Mo'aabike boga'n Isira'eelike ardin welt kako aagaashsha Muuse'e ajajeemmak weli kakotik hiyyichchuwwi konnechchin butti'a hedheeken.<verse eid="DEU 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 29:2" />Muusenna Isira'eelika arda ye'eexxi Duuchchi woddiki Gootti Gibtseke moyanjo'n; mootoleeyyete'ninna konne boga'n asseexa duuchcha; <verse eid="DEU 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 29:3" />Insa'ne'n geessiseexxa cinifachchiissaaxxa bala, muuxeeka manbe'inka beessisuwwanna lumollamma yaane duuchcha illendinni uuddine'en. <verse eid="DEU 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 29:4" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti kinn telchixxe barra qico'n kaddin saxxinna qico hubatine uuddinaaxa ille, mansha, qalbe ha'no'a uwweeban. <verse eid="DEU 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 29:5" />Shoole tomme wogga duuchcha gammoojje qiilli bogi giddo ha'no'o akeekaamma wodda seemma ha'nooxxi muddeba'a; lekka ha'nooxxixxi kophetinna muddeemmabaan. <verse eid="DEU 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 29:6" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ha'nook Mageno kadeexxa egendinaashsha ita ittinebaan woyine yookaan machcheessaaka ha'wo ha'witinebaan.<verse eid="DEU 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 29:7" />Ookkone boonniba shiqqinee wodda; Haseebonika moyanjo Sewooninna Baasaanika moyanjo Oogi shinnoo'aa dangeemman: yaane kinn no'o insa'ne'e bululoke assineennen:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:21-35">Lak. 21:21-35</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 29:8" />Boga insa'neekanna dhaale Roobeli'aanna Gaadike mini hadi'a ittan gamisa Minaaseke minke hadi'a geegoke assine qoqqoonde uuneenen:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:33">Lak. 32:33</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 29:9" />Tennexxee huccitinelchi duuchchi ha'no'a kadaashsha tenne kakoka seera duuchcha xexxe'achchot muuxxe. <verse eid="DEU 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 29:10" />Ha'no duuchchiingiki gosa gosak akeekisanjuwwinna sooreessuwwi ha'nok, geedhuwwa ha'nooxxinna ha'noo ajajaamakiir; iittanni weli Isira'eelik ardi duuchchi telcho ha'nook Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageni edo uurtine'een. <verse eid="DEU 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 29:11" />Oosse ha'noxxinna aruwwa ha'nooxxi haqqe ati'a bonca'n wode'e ikkilda'n atike olla'n hedheek keessuntichchinna atinni welti uurre'een. <verse eid="DEU 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 29:12" />Uuritneechchinna Duuchchi woddike Gootti ha'nooki Mageninni welt kako aaggoteeten: tinni kakonna Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ha'nook Mageni telcho ha'no'a kakoti ege'nishee'exxen. <verse eid="DEU 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 29:13" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti tenne'e asse'eki ha'no uutineeke yaadinninna annuwa ha'nook Abirihaami'a, Yissaaqi'a, Ya'iqoobi'a afo'o sa'e kakateemmashshann ha'noona ifike arda asse abixxo'aa haseeten. <verse eid="DEU 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 29:14" />Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti tennee duuchcha kakot kokeesedhe kakata'neechchinna ha'noonni callabaan. <verse eid="DEU 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 29:15" />Isi tenne kako aaga'neek telcho tenne bakka'n isi edo he'nenneke no'o duuchchiingeninna telcho no'on welt kaba hedha gopheekeerinni weltiteni.<verse eid="DEU 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 29:16" />Gibtseke boga'n he'nenne wodda hitta he'nennexxanna hitta hedheeke ardi giddii'n hitta kande sa'nennexxa egendine'en. <verse eid="DEU 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 29:17" />Oddo insa'neexe'n diqachchiisaachcho; haqqeti giissineex; kinjo bonce giissineek, birretinna worqeti giissineexa fakkuwwa uuddine'en. <verse eid="DEU 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 29:18" />Okkone gosa gosake arduwwika magenuwwa magenoofatatee qalbe ifixxa Duuchchi Woddike Gootta no'oke Magenonaa'n udumi'a higaak techcho ha'no giddii'n fedheeki labbak yookaan meyyaki; mini hadi yookaan gosa gosak mini hadi hedhebaaxxa kokke; oddo ha'nooxe'n iitta hexxeexxa bushaxxanna qaraartaaxxa huje hujaaki ha'nooxe oddo'ni hexxoqqe:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:15">Ibr. 12:15</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 29:19" />Iitta hedheek manji konnee kakataaka hiyyichcho laqqaaxxa yanna qalbe ifixxi giddo ifi eebbisa'n «Anxe qalbeke yaadishshanna hedhennexxenna nage'i ani'a hedheen» hiyye hedaan; tinni kinni elokenna fuggoke manna'n ba'ne iyyedaga. <verse eid="DEU 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 29:20" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti iitta hedheeke manji'a hara gattowaal hiyyaba'a; mufe isixxinna hinaaffe isixxi iso'n bubbaan; konne maxaafa'n borreesendeexxi badino duuchcha iso'n dirritaan; Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Isira'eelike gosatike munuwwinaa'n iso'o ballessaan. <verse eid="DEU 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 29:21" />Konne seeriinke maxaafa'n borreesndeexxe kakotixxe badinoqicishsha Duuchchi Woddik Gootti iso'o Isira'eelike gosatike minuwinaa'n iso'o ba'neti foyaan.<verse eid="DEU 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 29:22" />Hegerixxe ila'n; sanne ha'nooxxanna bayyi boganaa'n dageeka baari widika manna Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ha'nooke boga'n ibiseeke dhukuba insa'nenna uundan. <verse eid="DEU 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 29:23" />Bogi duuchchi boosi qarqarike buttinanna maxine calla kadee luggaan. Mitteechchonna ise'ni kaansabaan: mitteechchonna fulchabaan: Duuchchi woddiki Gootti jabaxxe mufe isixxinni balleessemmaxxe Sedoominna Gomorik, Adaamakenna Tsibaayoke bogishsha kadde gattaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-25">Dada. 19:24-25</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 29:24" />Eettene yanna'n bogi duuchchik ardi hiyye laqaa qic; «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti konne boga'n maye'e tennee yaane duuchcha asse? Jabaxxe mufe'a Iso'o geessisseexxi yaane maachcho?» Hine qorraan. <verse eid="DEU 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 29:25" />Hiissichchikinna, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageni edike annuwwi insa'nekinn Gibtseke boganaa'n fulchee wodda aageemmaxxa kako diingeemmaxxeeten. <verse eid="DEU 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 29:26" />Insa'ne ookkonechchi edo magenooffante egennebaakanna Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna magenooffantabaashsha hoyyeeka dharichcha magenuwwa magenoofante sagande. <verse eid="DEU 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 29:27" />Tennexxe Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ardake'n mufate konne maxaafi giddo borreesendeexa tennee bala duuchcha boga insa'neke'n ibisse. <verse eid="DEU 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 29:28" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna jabaqicin mufate: jabaxe mufenaa'n kexxeexxa boga insa'neekenaa'n aadhe fulche wele egennebaake bogibaa baanjashsha asse. Tennexxee telchonna ookkonni he'neen» hiyye.<verse eid="DEU 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 29:29" />«Duuchchi woddiki Gootti no'oki Mageni maqo waale'exi heddo yaanuwa hexxeen: leelliteexxi yaanuwwa kinn no'onna oose no'oxxi heqqe'nonnaa hasissaaxe yaane seeri isikixxe hiyyuwa duuchchan.<verse eid="DEU 29:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="DEU 30" />
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi woddike Goottibaa Higatl Alfinaaxa Eebba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 30:1" />«Ani telcho ati edo eebbatenaa'ninna badinotenaa'ni fi'litattoshsha ati'aa waaleennen: Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ardiinxe oddo'n shorree booncho'n hexxe isoo'o qaabbattettele <verse eid="DEU 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 30:2" />Ati gosa atixinni wolt Duuchchi woddike Goottiba higgettelenna telcho ani uwwaannek Duuchchi woddike Goottika seeruwi'a godobi mittin hexxe ajajendaattele; <verse eid="DEU 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 30:3" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atiki Mageni mitte godobinni atee'e gattowaal hiyyaan: Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atee'e ardiinxe oddo'ni shorreexxe bakka duuchchanaa'n hiisseexxi haaroba duroonsamman. <verse eid="DEU 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 30:4" />Buttatixxe gabala qico'n xeerendine'e hexxinoolenna midde Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atiki Mageni mitteba bukki asse aadhe dagaan: <verse eid="DEU 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 30:5" />Konne qicinni edik annuwwi atik hedhemmake boga higgeen dhaaldatton: ikki bogginna edike annuwwi irra dureessakenna horte bira saxxattoshsha assaan. <verse eid="DEU 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 30:6" />Duuchchi woddika Gootta atika Mageno mitte godobinna shenitte hedhonni eetattoshsha, hedhotinna hexxattoshsha Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageni sanne atixxixxa qalbe jila offo'lishaan. <verse eid="DEU 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 30:7" />Tennee badino duuchcha atee giba'neeke'ninna miiccammake naapha'n hiissaan: <verse eid="DEU 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 30:8" />Atinna higgeen isi'a ajajendatton: ani telcho uwwaannek isika ajajuwwa xonxommatati heqqexxatton: <verse eid="DEU 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 30:9" />Hujjaattexxe yaane duuchcha'ni Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ate'e duroonsaan: oose atixxa; horateetteka horenna fichchi giddixxi karra duuchcha raxxee missaashsha assaan: Duuchchi woddiki Gootti edika annuwwa atika duroonse celqi asse ifi'a gammademmashshan ateenna duroonse gammadaan. <verse eid="DEU 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 30:10" />Tenneena assa'neek konne seeriinke maxaafi giddo borreessemeeka ajajuwwanna seeruwwa heqqedhati mitte godobinninna mitte heduminni Duuchchi woddike Gootta atike Magenibaa higgottoleten.<verse eid="DEU 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hedho Yookaan Reyo Giddii'n Mitte Fi'la Hasissaaxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 30:11" />«Ani telcho uwwaanneki ajaji hara ha'ureeke yookaan atenaa'n bayyateebaan: <verse eid="DEU 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 30:12" />‹Isi hiyyaaxa lanqe ajajemmonnaa ayyete mareex no'a aadha› hite laqqabexxoshsha; kunni seeri hedheeb iimate'nitebaan. <verse eid="DEU 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 30:13" />‹Isi hiyyaaxa lanqe ajajemmonnaa Abbaayati wido foofexxi ayyete no'a aadha?› Hite laqqabexxoshsha; isi hedheebi abbaayati widobaan. <verse eid="DEU 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 30:14" />Hiyyichchi ha'no'a hara shiqon hedheen: heqqexxottaanna afo'oke'ninna qalbe giddo hedheen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:6-8">Rom. 10:6-8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 30:15" />«Ani telcho hedhotanna qananumma rewotanna elletenaa'n yookaan rewotenaa'ninna ba'netenaa'n fi'litotta'a ati'a waaleennen: <verse eid="DEU 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 30:16" />Ani telcho ajajaanek Duuchchi woddike Gootta atke Magenike ajajuwwi'a ajajendottole, seerake'n me'ittotole, ajajuwwa, seeruwwakanna aada duuchcha heqqexxottole lubboti hexxatton: bira saxxatton: Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atiki Mageninna martattoke boga duuchcha'n atee eebbisaan. <verse eid="DEU 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 30:17" />Yaane kinni qalbe atixxen udumi'a higge'enna ajajema gophphee'e wele magenuwwi'a kumbu hittota'a sobendetexxi konne magenuwwa magenoofatottole, <verse eid="DEU 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 30:18" />Yoona baxxina'neexxa telcho ani ate'e xexxe'achchisaannen. Yordaanoosika galaana foofe ofoldattoke boga'n qeerra baro hexxabexxon. <verse eid="DEU 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 30:19" />Hedhotenaa'ninna rewotenaa'n; Duuchchi woddik Goottixxe eebbana'ninna badinonaa'n eetettexxa fi'litottaa ati'a waaleennen: fi'litinaa woddanna iimatanna butta dhugaa ati'a abixxannon: Tennexxee ha'noonna sanne ha'nooxi duuchcha lubboti hexxinaashsha hedho fi'le. <verse eid="DEU 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 30:20" />Duuchchi woddika Gootta atika Mageno eeyyi: Isi'a ajajem: Isoo addati: tinninna ati'a hedhotenaa'n caala edike annuwa atike Abirihaami'a, Yisaaqi'anna Ya'iqoobi'a kakateemmashshanni marte ofoldattoke boga'n qeerra boro hexxatton» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Dada. 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:3">26:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 28:13">28:13</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 30:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="DEU 31" />
  <para style="s1">Iyyaasu Muusexxe Bakka'n Fileme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 31:1" />Muusenna Isira'eelike ardi'a tennee duuchcha haaso'e ke'eechchi uduma; <verse eid="DEU 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 31:2" />Hiyyee qici; «Yoona anxi wogga dhibbanna diddama kaddemmaxxe'e ta'in edi'a ha'noo akeeka dande'abe'non: konneechchi uduma ani Yordaanoosika galaana foofabo'noxa Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ane'n kule'een.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Fula. 20:12</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 31:3" />Duuchchi Woddi Gootti atiki Mageni ati'a edo sa'e me'aan; konne gosa gosaki arduwwinna ati edii'n insa'nee ballessaan; atinna boga insa'neeka dhaaldattoni; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti haaso'emma qicinni Mageni Iyyaasu edise foossaan. <verse eid="DEU 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 31:4" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Amooritotika moyanjuwwa Sewooniinna Oogi'i boga insa'nengenninni balleessemmashsha konneeranna balleessaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:21-35">Lak. 21:21-35</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 31:5" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti insa'nee ha'no edo sa'isse ha'no'a uwwaan; ha'nonna insa'ne'n ha'no'o ajajennexxa duuchcha insa'ne'n assitina. <verse eid="DEU 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 31:6" />Jabaatte, worbe shenumma ha'no'ni hexxowwaali: insa'ne'e soodaattinoqqe, godoba gurtinoqqe: Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageni atinni welti hedheen: ha'no'o dedhabaan: waalabaan» hiyye.<verse eid="DEU 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 31:7" />Konneechchi uduma Muuse Iyyasu'u ye'eexi Isira'eelike ard duuchchi edo hiyyee qici; «Jabaatte, worbe, shenummandinni hedhi: Duuchchi woddiki Gootti edike annuwi'a kakatemmashshanni boga adhinaashsha arda filde qophexxaattek atenden: <verse eid="DEU 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 31:8" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti umi isingenni atinni wolt hedhe akeekaan: hunabaan: hara waalabaan: tennexxee sodaattoxxe: godoba gurtoxxe» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:5">Iya. 1:5</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 13:5">Ibr. 13:5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Torbaxxe Wogga'n Seeri Diideessemiyyo Hasissaaxxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 31:9" />Muusenna ookkonee seera borreesseexxi Duuchchi Woddike Goottika kakotika taabota dukkammaxxe qeesole Leewwixxe horte'anna Isira'eelike ardike akeesanjuwwi duuchchi'a uwwe. <verse eid="DEU 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 31:10" />Ookkonechchi uduma Muuse insa'nee hiyye ajajee qic: «Liqi waalemaaxxa duuchchin woddi'a torbaane woggake muuxxama'n fooqiinka ayyaana wogga wogga'n ulfeessemammaxxe barra'ni,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 15:1">Lew. 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 16:13-15">16:13-15</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 31:11" />Isira'eelik ardi duuchchi Duuchchi Woddike Gootta atike Mageni edo isi fi'leeke booncho'n bukki hinaa wodda konne seera insa'nee edo haaseessi. <verse eid="DEU 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 31:12" />Duuchching Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyya'neexxa lanqeexxi barantaashsha, sodaantashshanna konne seerika hiyyichcho duuchcha xonxomante heqqe'naashsha labbakanna, meyyakanna, oosetanna, qachchuwa ha'nooke'n keessumummati hedha'neeka mannanna mitteba bukki asse. <verse eid="DEU 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 31:13" />Konne qicinni Duuchchi Woddike Gootta ha'nooke Magenika seera laqqeebaaxxi horte ha'nooxxi duuchcha isixxa laqqaaxxe hexxeen: Tennexxee Yordaanoosi'i fooffine dhaaldina'neeke boga'n he'naake baro duuchcha'n Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a ajajensha barantowwal» hiyye.<verse eid="DEU 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'anna Iyyaasu'a Uwweexxa Akeette</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 31:14" />Konneechchi uduma Duuchchi woddiki Gootti Muusee hiyyee qici; «Dedha atixxe lubbo'n daggaaxxi yaane hexxaan: akeekaashsha ajajuwwa uwwonnaa Iyyaasuu yexxe atinna isi Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ulfinniki leela'neek duunkaani giddi'a shikki hiyye» hiyye. Muusenna Iyyaasu ookkone duunkaaniba marre: <verse eid="DEU 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 31:15" />Duuchchi woddiki Goottinna duunkaani iima duumanchik leelle; iikki duumanchinna duunkaaniinxe huddume iima uurre.<verse eid="DEU 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 31:16" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti Muuse'e hiyyee qici; «Yoona ati rerte'e edike annuwa atikibaa me'itottaaten; ookkoneechchi uduma kunni ard isin wolt ageemmaxxa kako waalan. Aneenna dedheexxi mara'neeke boga'n hexxeexxa adibaaruwwa magenooffataan. <verse eid="DEU 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 31:17" />Tinni kaddaa wodda ani insa'ne'n mufeti gargaritti hiissannon: yaada anka insa'nenaa'n sho'edhannon: inisa'neenna renne mundaan: insa'nee'ninna heddo elobaak dhukub abidaan: Ookkone wodda; ‹Tinni rakko no'o'n dagge'ebi Mageni no'ok oddo no'oxxe'n hedha gophemmaxxeetebaa?› Hinaan. <verse eid="DEU 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 31:18" />Miseelchixxa fakkuwa magenoofatat hunjeexxe cubboxxe daafen Ani ookkone wodda ijje gargaarabe'non.<verse eid="DEU 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 31:19" />«Tennee faaro borreessite Isira'eelike arda'n barssiisa'n faarsinaashsha assi: tinni faaronna insa'ne'n dhugaa anxe kaddaan. <verse eid="DEU 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 31:20" />Edike annuwwa insa'neke'e kakatenneshshanni malebikinna adoti celqe hiyye duroome bogibaa insa'ne'e imarannon: insa'nenna ookko'o inde goddinee furdanteexxa yanna anee'e deenaan: aangemmaxxa kako waallexxi wele magenuwa magenooffantaan. <verse eid="DEU 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 31:21" />Heddo jabaxxi rakko geltaa wodda tinni oose insa'nexe'n dedhendabaaxxi faaro farsendaa wodda tinni insa'ne'n dhuga'a kulendaan. Insa'ne'a uwwonna afo'o sa'enneke bogibaa marre gennebaang edigam ta'anni maa yaada anfeexa ege'neennen» hiyye.<verse eid="DEU 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 31:22" />Eettene barra Muuse faaro borreessexxi Isira'eelike arda'n barsiise.<verse eid="DEU 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 31:23" />Konneechchi uduma Duuchchi woddiki Gootti Neweka belto Iyyasu'u; «Jabaat shenummaniddinni hedhi: Ani uwwonnaa afo'o sa'enneke bogibaa Isira'eelika arda aaxxe imartatton: aninna atinni wolt hedhannon» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:23">Lak. 27:23</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 1:6">Iya. 1:6</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 31:24" />Muusenna konne seerika hiyyichchuwwa muuxamini qico'n maxaafake'n borreesseechchi uduma; <verse eid="DEU 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 31:25" />Muuse Duuchchi woddike Goottika kakotika taabota ba'exxa'neexxi leewwito hiyyee qici; <verse eid="DEU 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 31:26" />«Mageniiki seeri borreesemeek konne maxaafa aaxxineex; Duuchchi woddike Gootta ha'nooke Maginik kakotike taaboti bira ugge: konneqicin ardake'n dhugaa kulatee insa'ne'a kaddaan. <verse eid="DEU 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 31:27" />Isira'eelik ardi hittee qico jallaameyyenna fuggaaleyyet kandeexxa ani ege'neennen: ani ifi ege'ne insa'nen hedheennexxenninni midde Duuchchi woddike Gootta'n jallineeshshanni he'neen: anxe rewo uduma fa'i konne caala jallinaan: <verse eid="DEU 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 31:28" />Tennexxee tenne duuchcha kulonnaa gosa insa'neexixxa hayyooletanna arda galchitammaxxa sooreesuwwa ani'a bukki assi: Ani iimate'ninna buttate'n ku'le waalannon. <verse eid="DEU 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 31:29" />Anxe reyo uduma ku'lenneka ajaja waalle ke'ne battootto yaane hunja'neexa ege'neennen: Duuchchi woddike Gootti edo elobaaxxa yaane hunje iso mufachiinsaammaxxe aareexxi fuggoxxinni ke'aan» hiyye.<verse eid="DEU 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muusexxa Faaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 31:30" />Konneechchi uduma Muuse bukki hoyye hedheek Isira'eelik ya'i duuchchi edo tenne faaroxa hiyyichchuwwa ke'itokenaa'n aadhe muuxamiqico'n haaseesseen.<verse eid="DEU 31:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="DEU 32" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 32:1" />Tee iimanna butta! Hiyyaannexxa laqqe:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:1">haaso'annexxa duuchcha sammi hitine caqasse:<verse eid="DEU 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 32:2" />Barsiisa anxi xeeniinsha gandowwaal:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:2">haaso'ikinna fixeensiinsha coccophphuun;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:2">Badda'ate'n ofo'leeke fixeensishsha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:2">mudhote'n gandeexxe kiifoshsha;<verse eid="DEU 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 32:3" />Duuchchi woddike Goottika summa lassannon:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:3">Mageno no'okika lumminne haaso'e.<verse eid="DEU 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 32:4" />Isi wolo'o no'oxxen: huje isixxinna qullitteten:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">ori isiki duuchchi qajeelaken:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">mitte dedha afebaak addatemeek Magen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">Isi dhugaatikenna shaqqaken.<verse eid="DEU 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 32:5" />Isi edo elobaak insa'neeka adaba leelisheen:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:5">tenne'ni isinxe oose kandebaaxxa ege'nendaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:5">insa'ne hara ba'ekenna fuggaaleeyye ilan.<verse eid="DEU 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 32:6" />Ha'no gowwoolenna yaada affinebaar;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:6">Duuchchi woddike Gootti'a galati uutina'neek konne qicinnitee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:6">Anni atik atee i'leek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:6">atee dadeekinna atee giisseeki isotebaa?<verse eid="DEU 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 32:7" />Qari baro'n kaddeexxa yaane qaabbat:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">olmi bari edo hedhemmaka kassi hiyyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">anna atika laqi, ate'e alfeeki, atee dadeek, atee giisseek isotebaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:7">Geedhuwwatanna qodhdhi insa'nenna ati'a barrinse kullaan.<verse eid="DEU 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 32:8" />Lumok dada duuchchik Duuchchi woddiki Gootti Magen gosa gosake ardi'a qadaada uwwee wodda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">isi manjiinxa sanne gargar hisse foye wodda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:8">Isira'eelixxe ooseke laakkoossixxe qixxe'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">manjo gosa gosati foye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">mitti mittinge manni'a gabala giisseen.<verse eid="DEU 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 32:9" />Duuchchi woddike Goottiki qoobbi arda ifikenni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:9">Ya'iqoobinna gargari hedheeke isike qadaada kaddemmaxxeeten.<verse eid="DEU 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 32:10" />Qiilla boga'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:10">gommoojje qiilla boga'n afeeni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:10">Gollake kade: isoo heqqeen:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:10">illetike gummichchishsha to'ateen.<verse eid="DEU 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 32:11" />Sinibri mine ifika diigeexxi beltana ifixxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:11">ifixxe beltanna hana shalallissammashsha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:11">Isoo abishshote'e keela farri assedhaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:11">keeli isikinna kiphaan.<verse eid="DEU 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 32:12" />Duuchchi woddiki Goott isoo qofin akeeken:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:12">dharichchi magen isin wolt hedhemmabaan.<verse eid="DEU 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 32:13" />Kooba lumoxi iima fulcheen:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:13">isi huccemmaxxa karra itiseen:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:13">buttini giddii'ni leelliteexxi daamo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:13">booretike boga'n fuleeke ejersinke haqichchixxa zayite itiseen.<verse eid="DEU 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 32:14" />Laliinka buuronna gedhebiinka dalla'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">re'etixxa ha'yo, adonna ititto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">Baasaanika elola buruusa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">jabbuwwanaa'n elolla dinne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">Gummichcho miince giissineeka bulbulo hawitineen.<verse eid="DEU 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 32:15" />Yishuuruni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yisur Isira'eelike summ kada wodda, Yishuru hiyya qajeelake hiyyaten, ard duroome celqe hiyye jallineen. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:15">ite goddo furdateen:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:15">Dademanga Mageno dedheeni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:15">isi'a golla kadeeka ifika anjirallo tuffate.<verse eid="DEU 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 32:16" />Magenonga misechchixxa fakke magenooffatati gaabinse:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:16">elobaaxxa hunja'ni mufachchiinseen.<verse eid="DEU 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 32:17" />Konneechchi edo egenebaak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">barri giddii'n dageek;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:17">Magenokeete kaddebaang durrisakee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">edik annuwi insa'neek magenooffatebaake magenuwwi'a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">tolcha shiqinsheen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:20">1 Qor. 10:20</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 32:18" />Annake kadeeka Mageno waalleen:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:18">insa'neenni dade'enga Duuchchi woddika Gootta deenen.<verse eid="DEU 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 32:19" />Meyyaxxinna labbaxi oose insa'neexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:19">iso'o mufachiisemmaxxe'e</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:19">Duuchchi woddiki Gootti tennee uudeexxi shorreen.<verse eid="DEU 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 32:20" />«Alba ankanna insa'nenaa'n hoyyedhannon» isinna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:20">«dokko maa kandaaxxa uudannon:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:20">insa'ne leetabaaxe ilani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:20">hegeri'a kadaaran hine abixinaaxxe ilabaan hiyye.<verse eid="DEU 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 32:21" />Dhugaatike kadebaake miseechchixxe fakkuwa'ni anee gaabbinseen:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">la'o affebaaxxe insa'neexxe fakkuwwa'ni ane'e mufachchiisann on:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:21">Aninna tuffatemeek ard edo gaabbisannon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">woyi flabaake manna'n insa'ne salphisannon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:22">1 Qor. 10:22</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:19">Rom. 10:19</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 32:22" />Mufe anxixxi giira:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:22">butti'ni hundike wiidi qico'ni bubbaan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:22">Buttatanna boga duuchcha itte birtaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:22">bubenjikinna koobuwwa duuchcha ca'a asse luxube waalan.<verse eid="DEU 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 32:23" />«Higgeggeenni rakkonde'n rakko geessisannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:23">halo anixa duuchcha insa'nen fulannon.<verse eid="DEU 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 32:24" />Kutti assaaka solo'o insa'ne'n ibisannon:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">elobaake dhukkubinninna bala ibise'na mundaan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:24">Itaaka biniinchuwanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">iddaaka bofuwwa ergannon.<verse eid="DEU 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 32:25" />Ora orange'n bagedi kutti assaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:25">mine duuchcha'n soda'a e'itaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:25">ka'umikinna meyyak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:25">oosetinna geedhuwwa muddaan.<verse eid="DEU 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 32:26" />Ani booso insa'neexa balleessannon:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:26">ookonechchi uduma insa'nee qaabataak hedhabaan:<verse eid="DEU 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 32:27" />Yaane kinn naaphuww insa'neek gacifatabaashsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:27">‹Injifatteexxi anga no'oxxe malee'e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:27">Duuchchi woddik Gootti tennee assebaan hinabaasha› »</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:27">naaphiinka diina hoodenneni.<verse eid="DEU 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 32:28" />Isira'eelik ard hedumanga afeerabaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:28">qaabantaarabaan.<verse eid="DEU 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 32:29" />Maye hedhe qaroomme tennee qaabbanteel:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:29">haba marre genna'neexxa sila hende uundaman!<verse eid="DEU 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 32:30" />Rassa insa'neexxi sa'isse uwwagopheele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:30">Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti waala gopheele</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:30">Mitti manji hitta kuma shorra?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:30">Lami hittata tomme kuma bajaashsha assa?<verse eid="DEU 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 32:31" />Naaphuw no'ok midde mitte afo'o kademmashshanni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:31">insa'neek gootti no'oke Magenishshatebaan.<verse eid="DEU 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 32:32" />Woyinetik hiddichchi insa'neek Sodoomixxe woyinena'ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:32">Gomorake fichchana'ni dagaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:32">Shiyammak woyoinetike hiddichchixxe buqqeshsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:32">daali insa'neekinna heexotike haqichchinni wo'maan.<verse eid="DEU 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 32:33" />Woyine insa'neexxinna shiltammaxxe buuteshshanna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:33">idde shiyammake bofishshaten.<verse eid="DEU 32:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 32:34" />«Tinni naaph no'ok assexxi balleessa anke masseccatike mine'ni masse'neen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:34">maxaafa anke'ni maxxansemeekebaa?<verse eid="DEU 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 32:35" />Halo anxen, ani halo hiissannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">yanna gelta wodda lekka insa'neexxi guggufattaan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:35">Huje insa'neexxishshanni hir ba'naxxi barra gelte'en;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">insa'ne'ni geltaaxxi murtenna muddande'een<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:19">Rom. 12:19</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:30">Ibr. 10:30</ref>. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">booke kande gantaan» hiyye.<verse eid="DEU 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 32:36" />Hunna anfebaaxxa uudanno wodda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:36">Duuchchi woddiki Gootti ergatoole ifixxe'e marraan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:36">kunni eloke; kunni yo'oke hiyye foyebaang</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:36">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti arda ifikee murte uwwaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 135:14">Far. 135:14</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 32:37" />Isinna hiyya'ne qici, «Rassa insa'nexxe kaddeek,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:37">iiki insa'nek magenuwwi habata hedhe?<verse eid="DEU 32:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 32:38" />Tolcha insa'neekenaa'ni ha'yo ittemar;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">woyinetike bulbulonaa'n ha'weemmak magenuwwi insa'neek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">ke'e insa'ne'e gargaarowal gollakenna kadowal.<verse eid="DEU 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 32:39" />«Ani calli Magenoke kadennexxa ege'ne:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">anee male'e weli hedhebaan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:39">Shiyannok; hedho uwwannok anten:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">enqannon xaasannon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">anga anixxenaa'n ayyinna gargaaro'a dande'abaan.<verse eid="DEU 32:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 32:40" />Anga anxa iimi'a ke'isse kakata'n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:40">Ani Duuchchi woddik Gootti hedhaanneke,<verse eid="DEU 32:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 32:41" />Calacala hiyyaaka wolaantichcha anka qadhdhannon:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">naapha anike'ni halo fulanon:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">anee gibammakee huje insa'neexxika hira uwwannon.<verse eid="DEU 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 32:42" />Shiyemeemmakenaa'nin booji'ememmakenaa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:42">naaphuwwiinke sooresuwinaa'n munde halo anxa fulannon:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:42">wolaantichchi anikinna naaphiinka maala kochchisaan» hiyye'e kakatannon.<verse eid="DEU 32:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 32:43" />Koo ank arda Duuchchi woddik Gootti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">ergatoole isixxa munde halo fulaan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:43">Naaphuwwakanna halo fulaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">gibammak xixeexxi ardiinxe cubbo'a gattowwaal hiyyaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">butta tenneka battooma ca'assaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">tennexxee ookkone isike ardinni wolti gammad.<verse eid="DEU 32:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 32:44" />Muusenna Newek belti Iyyaasuu ardi laqaashsha hafuura gikki assineex faaro faarsina. <verse eid="DEU 32:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 32:45" />Muuse konneechinn iimi'a hedheeka haaso'a ardakee haaso'eechchi uduma; <verse eid="DEU 32:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 32:46" />Insa'nee hiyyee qici: «Konne maxaafika seera xonxoommachchot heqqedha dandeennaashsha oose ha'nooxe'n kuldinaashsha ani telcho ha'noo'n dhugaate kaddaasha hiyyaannexxa duuchcha qalbeeffatte. <verse eid="DEU 32:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 32:47" />Kunni seeri hedho ha'nooxxike hafuura malee tolanga futti hineesha borreessineeke hiyyichchobaan; tennexxee tenne hiyya'a ajajemme: iitta assitinoole Yordaanoosi fooffine adhdhitina'neeke boga'n qeerra baro hexxinaan» hiyye.<verse eid="DEU 32:47" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muuse Reya'neexxe Kooba'ni Reyeexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 32:48" />Eettene barra'n Duuchchi woddiki Gootti Muuse hiyyee qici: <verse eid="DEU 32:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 32:49" />«Mo'aabike boga'n Iyyaarikoke qachchi edo hedheek Abaarixxe koobuwwabaa me'e: Naabawwu hinaaxe kooba da'mi: ookkoo'ninna Isira'eelike ardi'a dhaalchisaaneka Kenaanika boga hubatte uudi: <verse eid="DEU 32:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 32:50" />Dayyi atik Aarooni Horexxe kooba'n hana reyeexxi edike firi isik reyemmakiba'a me'emmashsha atinna eettene fuldettexxe kooba hana rerte atike reyemaake atike firiba'a me'i. <verse eid="DEU 32:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 32:51" />Ha'no laminiing Isira'eelike ard edo ani hiyyenneke ora'n me'itinebaan: Tsiini hinaake gammojje qiilla boga'n Qaadeesike qachchi bira hedheek Meriiba hinaaxe muumuwwa bira hexxemma wodda Isira'eelike ardi edo ane'e ulfeessitinebaan. <verse eid="DEU 32:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 32:52" />Tennexxee boga ookkonee ifi edo uudatto malee; Ani Isira'eelike ardi'a dhaalchisaanneka ookkonee bogiba geltabexxon» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:12-14">Lak. 27:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 3:23-27">Lan. 3:23-27</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="DEU 33" />
  <para style="s1">Muuse Isira'eelixxe Gosake Mini Hadi Duuchchi'a Hancufa Biifee qico</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 33:1" />Mageniinki erganji Muuse lummedhebaang ediga'ma Isira'eelike ardi'a uwweek hancufi konneechchinni butti'a hedheen;<verse eid="DEU 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 33:2" />Muusenna hiyyee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:2">«Duuchchi woddiki Gootti Siinaxxe koobanaa'n dageen:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">Edoomii'n soodimarixxe arishshoshsha ifa uwween:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">Faaraanixxe koobanaa'n insa'ne'a ifise:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:2">Isinna laakkonne dhaqqanbabaaxxe woyyoole isixxinn welti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">middi ga'manaa'n giiratik bubenji hedhemman.<verse eid="DEU 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 33:3" />Duuchchi woddik Gootti dhugaandinni arda isika eeya'neen:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:3">woyyoolle isixxa duuchcha heqqaan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:3">Insa'nenna lekka isixxi hunda guluffante heeshshi qokki hinani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:3">atika ajajanna lanqaan:<verse eid="DEU 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 33:4" />Isira'eelike ardi fichcha kadeeka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:4">Muuse no'o'a uwweek seera heqqedhaan.<verse eid="DEU 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 33:5" />Gosa gosake mini ardiink sooresuwwi Isira'eelike ardinni welti hingeexxi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:5">mitteba bukki hina wodda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:5">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eelika arda Yishuuri'i moyee galcha'nemman» hiyye.<verse eid="DEU 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 33:6" />Muuse Roobelixxe gosake mini hadixxee hiyyee qici,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:6">«Fedhee qiconna midde Roobeelixxe gosake miniki laakkoossi heeno'moolenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:6">ballo Roobelixxe gosaki mini hadi hedhot hedhdhowwaal, reyoqqe» hiyye.<verse eid="DEU 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 33:7" />Yihudaxxe hiyyee qici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">«Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Yihudaxxa soodachcho laqi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">isike firba'anna iso'o idag;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">anga atixxenni isi'a faachcheeffata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">maganneten naaphik lolemaaxxa yanna iso'o gargaari» hiyye.<verse eid="DEU 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 33:8" />Isinna Leewixxe hiyyee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:8">«Tumiimi atixxinna Uuriimi atixxi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">Leewwi'i Mageniinke manjixxe kaddowwaal;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:8">Maasahi hiyyemma booncho'n iso hega uudete;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">Mariibike wodi'i biranna isinn welti morondette.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:7">Fula. 17:7</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 20:13">Lak. 20:13</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 33:9" />Isi atixxee hiyyeexxi anniinxeenna ama ifikixxee haaso'aa wodda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">‹Ani insa'nexxe'e ege'nennechchi hedheban› hiyye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:9">Ani dayyuwwa isika fowabo'non;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">oose isixxanna waale'en.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:9">Hiyyichcho atikee ayyete ajajeme;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">kako atixxanna heqqedhe.<verse eid="DEU 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 33:10" />Galduma atika Ya'iqoobi'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">seerakanna Isira'eelk ardi'a barsisaan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:10">Ati edo dakkadha gunbaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">ciinceessinaaka tolchanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">tolchisanjoke'n idangaan.<verse eid="DEU 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 33:11" />Duuchchi woddike Goottaa! Hunna isixxa duuchhca eebbis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">isixxe angaxxe huje'ninna gamad;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:11">Iso'n ke'aakara hunna gophisi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">naapha isikanna langaxxa nammi hiyyabaashsha assi» hiyye.<verse eid="DEU 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 33:12" />Biiniyaamixxe gosake mini hadixxe'e:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:12">«Duuchchi woddik Gootti iso'o jaallateek soda'a belo nage'ik hedhowwaal:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:12">hunnaameessi Mageni barra duuchcha isoo heqqaan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:12">Duuchchi woddike Goottixxe anga hunda gollifatee hedhaan» hiyye.<verse eid="DEU 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 33:13" />Yooseefixxe gosake mini hadixxe'e hiyyee qici;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:13">«Duuchchi woddiki Gootti iimi'n gana'neek xeeninnii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:13">butta dhi'moti hunda hedheeke wedi'in;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:13">boga insa'neeka eebbisowwaal.<verse eid="DEU 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 33:14" />Arishshoti raxxaaxxi eloxxi gumma hexxuun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:14">baatetinna maye maye'n aagaxxa midha ibissuun.<verse eid="DEU 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 33:15" />Ittani qara he'nemmaxxe koobuwwa insa'neexxenni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:15">gooruwwat gadho gatteexxi bakka duuchcha midhati calq hitowaal:<verse eid="DEU 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 33:16" />Bogi insa'nek duuchchi elolla yaanenni wo'mowwaal:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">giira ittee'naa buba'neeke ko'molchi giddo leelleeke Duuchchi Woddike Goottik badhaadhi isi'a bira sa'owwaal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:16">Kunni duuchchi dayyuwwi isikixxe oddo'ni galchalloke kadeemmake</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">Yooseefixxe sammo'ni ugginowaal.<verse eid="DEU 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 33:17" />Yooseefik gaachchanni sangooletishsha sodaachchisa'neeken:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">gaafuwikinna xaaxxiinke gaafisha jabaken:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">Isinna arda duuchcha otaan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">bogi iimii'ni shorraan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">Efireemik tomm kumuwwi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">Minaase boonchikinna ittan kumaken» hiyye.<verse eid="DEU 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 33:18" />Isinna Zabilonixxe'e hiyyee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:18">«Koo Zaabilooni hobolot me'itette wodda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:18">atinna Yisakoori duunkaana atinge'ni hexxe gammadi.<verse eid="DEU 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 33:19" />Gosa gosatika mine koobat hani'a ye'na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:19">ookonna seeriinka tolcha tolchina.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:19">Insa'ne abbaaya giddixxa birasaxxeexxa durumma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:19">maanchiinsha giddixxa sho'endeexxa karra alfina» hiyye.<verse eid="DEU 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 33:20" />Isinna Gaadixxe gosake mini hadixxe'e hiyyee qici;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:20">«Gaadika boga ba'liseeka Duuchchi woddiki Gootti lummedhowwaal:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:20">ciqiletanna xiyyo gane dhoosate'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:20">Gaadi neenqishsha ookko'o hedhaan.<verse eid="DEU 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 33:21" />Galchatik qoobbi isixxe anga'n hedheemmaxxe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">ifi'a shaqqak boga fi'leen:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:21">Ardiinxi hayyoole bukki hiteemma wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">Duuchchi Woddike Goottik yaadinna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">seeri Isira'eelike ardi'a muuxeen» hiyye.<verse eid="DEU 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 33:22" />Isinna Daanixxe gosak mini hadixxe'e hiyyeqic;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:22">«Daan Baasaanina'ni xogge sa'ake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:22">neeqiinke beltanjon» hiyye.<verse eid="DEU 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 33:23" />Nefitaalemixxe hiyyee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:23">«Nefitaalemi Duuchchi Woddike Goottik gaachchaninni yo'oshsha eeyyeme'en;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:23">isixxa eebbanna badhaadheen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:23">edo yo'oshsha eeyyemee manjon:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:23">abbaayyatanna abbaayatika bita'ika boga dhaala» hiyye.<verse eid="DEU 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 33:24" />Aseerixxe gosake mini hadixxe'e hiyyee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:24">«Aseeri wele gosak mini hadi duuchchanaa'n irra duroome calqe hiyyowwaal:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:24">isinna dayyuwi giddii'n jajemowwaal:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:24">abbaayyatanna abaayatika bita'ika boga dhaala.<verse eid="DEU 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 33:25" />Qachchuwwi atikixxi huluwwa sibiljikinna sageettoti itti jabaatuun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:25">baro atikee duuchcha'inna nege'i ati'a kada.<verse eid="DEU 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 33:26" />«Koo Yishuuruni atee gargaaro'a iimuwwati hana, duumanchake'ninna gaachanna ifikenni me'aake atike Magenishsha hedheek ayyinna hedheba'a.<verse eid="DEU 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 33:27" />Dhuuchi woddi'a hedhaak Magen golla atiken</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:27">duuchchi woddixxi hirre isixxi kipha no'oken: naapha ati edii'n shorraan: booso insa'neexxa ‹balleessitattoshsha assitan›<verse eid="DEU 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 33:28" />Tennexxe Isira'eeli qofin nage'ik hedha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:28">iimi'n woji coccoba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:28">Midhatinna woyinetixxi booka hexxeeke boga'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:28">Ya'iqoobixxa hortenna tuqaaki hedhebaani.<verse eid="DEU 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 33:29" />Koo Isira'eelike arda! Ati eebbisendeetteke manjon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">Duuchchi woddiki Gootti atee wodee'eke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">Atishsha shalo gale'ek ayyet?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">Isi wonte atixxenna gargaarsanjoken;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">naaphi maxxisa'ni atibaa dagaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">umo insa'neeka cancaqqatton» hiyye.<verse eid="DEU 33:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34" />
  <para style="s1">Muusexxa Rewe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1" />Muusenna Mo'aabike diidanaa'n ke'exxi Naabawwuxxa kooba da'me: Iyyaarikoo'ni middi darre'ni hedheeke Feesiga hinaaxxe koobaka boga duuchcha leellishe: Ookko'ni Duuchchi woddiki Gootti iso'o boga duuchcha mareme'e to'ataashsha asse: tinninna Gele'aadike boganaa'n ke'isseexxi middi darre'ni hedheeke Daanike qachchi qicco'ni, <verse eid="DEU 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2" />Nefitaalemika boga madada; Efireemikanna Minaaseka boga; boroti darrenaa'n Meediteraanyaantixxe abbaayaxxe gabala qico'n hedheeka Yihudika boga duuchcha; <verse eid="DEU 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3" />Negeebikanna meedawutik, Iyyarkoxx wolo'onaa'n meexxeti qachcha hina'neexxe Iyyaarikoxxe wolo'onaa'ni, Zo'aari qicco'ni hedheeka boga duuchcha leellishe. <verse eid="DEU 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti Muuse'e, «Sanne insa'neexxe uwwonnaa Abirihaami'a Yissaaqi'a Ya'iqoobi'a uwwano hiyye ofo'o sa'eennake bogi konneten: Yoona illeti uuddattoshsha asseennen: ookko mara kinn ati'a hasissabaan» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Dada. 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:3">26:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 28:13">28:13</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5" />Tennexxee Duuchchi woddike Goottik ergamj Muuse Mo'aabike boga'n hedhemma wodda Duuchchi woddiki Gootti haaso'emmashshanni ookkonni lummedhe. <verse eid="DEU 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6" />Duuchchi woddiki Goottinna Beetipe'orike qachchi edo Mo'aabike boga'n hexxeexxe wolo'o'n moogeen: yaane kinn telchii qico'ni isi moogemee boonchonga kokate uude ege'naak ayyina hedhebaan. <verse eid="DEU 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7" />Muuse lummedhee wodda wogga isixxi dhibbanna lame tommemman: yaane kinni ille kookootteemmabaakenna; uduudakanna jaba manjommani. <verse eid="DEU 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8" />Isira'eeliki ardi kora hunnaaxxi barra saxxaaqico'n sase tomme barra Muuse'a yaanda'n Mo'aabik diida'n oo'neeni.<verse eid="DEU 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9" />Muusenna anga ifixxa Neweke belto Iyyaasu'ni hana uggeemmaxxe'e Neneweki belti Iyyaasu beekumiink hafuuri iso'ni wo'me; Isira'eelik ardinna Iyyaasu'a ajajeme. Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Muuse ajajeemmaxxa duuchcha ardi asse.<verse eid="DEU 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 34:10" />Duuchchi woddiki Gootti alba ifik edo haasosseeke Muuseshsha hedheeka wabeek ookkonechchinni kayya Isira'eeli giddo afemeba'a.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:11">Fula. 33:11</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 34:11" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse'e ergee'naa eettene manbe'iinxa yaanuwwanna beessisuwwa duuchcha Gibtseke boga'n Feri'ooninna jalqabuwwi edo tennee duuchcha asso'a ergeemmaxxa erga muummeeseek isishsha hedheek wabeekichch ijje hedhebaan. <verse eid="DEU 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 34:12" />Muuse Isira'eelike ardi duuchchi edo assemmaxxee jabaxxanna sodaachchissaaxxa yaanuwwa duuchchanna asseeki weli wabeekichchi ijje hedhebaan.<verse eid="DEU 34:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34" />
</usx>